:281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"24.89.236.44","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e89cc64d5df28aafce7d392ebe646e5e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Happy planning.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885366,"PostDate":1423173478,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Happy planning.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"njwood000@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.7.173.185","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1405824791,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Msmimi","Id":279087,"Name":"Msmimi","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5bc78089ba3f40955c14abedb2a481b1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m getting a pretty great deal with Palace Resort. As long as my wedding group equals 75+ room nights, all of my private events are free. (75 room nights = 7 nights x 11 rooms) If you do the math, as long as you have 11 rooms in your wedding block, you will qualify for the unlimited private events :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1885826,"PostDate":1423581950,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm getting a pretty great deal with Palace Resort. As long as my wedding group equals 75+ room nights, all of my private events are free. (75 room nights = 7 nights x 11 rooms) If you do the math, as long as you have 11 rooms in your wedding block, you will qualify for the unlimited private events <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8de4c44d59621cd1ab8cdeb1644dee9c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"perianjay\"] that&amp;nbsp; is&amp;nbsp;a really great deal!!! How much are you getting the rooms for per night? Would everyone have to stay for 7 nights ? or it just needs to equal 75 nights in total with varitons through the guest .. 1 room stays 3 nights .. 1 room stays 4 nights .. 1 room stays 5 etc&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1886080,"PostDate":1423680417,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> that\u00a0 is\u00a0a really great deal!!! How much are you getting the rooms for per night? Would everyone have to stay for 7 nights ? or it just needs to equal 75 nights in total with varitons through the guest .. 1 room stays 3 nights .. 1 room stays 4 nights .. 1 room stays 5 etc\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422632988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.51.153.112","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"305bf5b77ae8a23d31a2d318d35691c0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1886080\" timestamp=\"1423680417\"]\n@[member=\"perianjay\"] that  is a really great deal!!! How much are you getting the rooms for per night? Would everyone have to stay for 7 nights ? or it just needs to equal 75 nights in total with varitons through the guest .. 1 room stays 3 nights .. 1 room stays 4 nights .. 1 room stays 5 etc[\/quote]As long as you have a total of 75 nights. So it&#039;s fine if someone stays three nights :)\nRight now it&#039;s approx $1663 per person, but we get a once time price drop guarantee up to 60 days before departure. My TA said it will for sure drop lower.\n\n:)","Attachments":[],"Id":1886099,"PostDate":1423690612,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 11 February 2015 - 10:46 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"281478\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/281478-perianjay\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">perianjay<\/span><\/a> that\u00a0 is\u00a0a really great deal!!! How much are you getting the rooms for per night? Would everyone have to stay for 7 nights ? or it just needs to equal 75 nights in total with varitons through the guest .. 1 room stays 3 nights .. 1 room stays 4 nights .. 1 room stays 5 etc\u00a0<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>As long as you have a total of 75 nights. So it's fine if someone stays three nights <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Right now it's approx $1663 per person, but we get a once time price drop guarantee up to 60 days before departure. My TA said it will for sure drop lower.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><a  class=\"bbc_url\" href=\"http:\/\/www.TickerFactory.com\/\"><img src=\"http:\/\/tickers.TickerFactory.com\/ezt\/d\/4;10731;1\/st\/20151215\/e\/Our+Wedding\/k\/ec4b\/event.png\" alt=\"event.png\"><\/a><br><br><br><br>\n\u00a0","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419437814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1b6e8dcc4c71c55d7bfca44f584c134b","RawContent":"[quote name=\"perianjay\" post=\"1886099\" timestamp=\"1423690612\"]\nAs long as you have a total of 75 nights. So it&#039;s fine if someone stays three nights :)\nRight now it&#039;s approx $1663 per person, but we get a once time price drop guarantee up to 60 days before departure. My TA said it will for sure drop lower.\n\n :)[\/quote]Oh so thats about 237 a night if its 7 nights. I will speak to my travel agent and see about this offer. He mentioned the palace resorts will pretty much offer or do anything possible to attempt to lock the wedding date with them. thanx for the info :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1886141,"PostDate":1423748846,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>perianjay, on 11 February 2015 - 01:36 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>As long as you have a total of 75 nights. So it's fine if someone stays three nights <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>Right now it's approx $1663 per person, but we get a once time price drop guarantee up to 60 days before departure. My TA said it will for sure drop lower.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Oh so thats about 237 a night\u00a0if its 7 nights. I will\u00a0speak to my travel agent and see about this offer. He mentioned the palace resorts will pretty much\u00a0offer or do anything possible to\u00a0attempt to lock\u00a0the wedding date with them.\u00a0thanx for the info <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"racht33@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"192.249.47.212","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1422632988,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281952.jpg?_r=1424197509","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"racht33","Id":281952,"Name":"racht33","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":78739,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d7f9b1996afe9aee9fcb659c30fdc788","RawContent":"[quote name=\"racht33\" post=\"1886141\" timestamp=\"1423748846\"]\nOh so thats about 237 a night if its 7 nights. I will speak to my travel agent and see about this offer. He mentioned the palace resorts will pretty much offer or do anything possible to attempt to lock the wedding date with them. thanx for the info :)[\/quote]Yea! Their wedding offers are pretty good too. I&#039;m really happy with my choice to go with Palace (also their resorts are beautiful - i&#039;ve been to a few.. truly 5 star service and amenities)","Attachments":[],"Id":1886213,"PostDate":1423772992,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>racht33, on 12 February 2015 - 05:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Oh so thats about 237 a night\u00a0if its 7 nights. I will\u00a0speak to my travel agent and see about this offer. He mentioned the palace resorts will pretty much\u00a0offer or do anything possible to\u00a0attempt to lock\u00a0the wedding date with them.\u00a0thanx for the info <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Yea! Their wedding offers are pretty good too. I'm really happy with my choice to go with Palace (also their resorts are beautiful - i've been to a few.. truly 5 star service and amenities)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>\u00a0<br><br><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><br><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-th