{"Success":true,"Data":{"OtherParticipants":[],"Messages":[{"Id":16093,"Author":{"Id":279807,"Name":"kyoung090","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279807.jpg?_r=1425064124","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":228,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1425066641,"Content":"how are things coming along for you?? our weddings are coming so fast!","PostKey":"32f0fcba8c7c1f8d4abd8c6eaf2196a1","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":16221,"Author":{"Id":278147,"Name":"erobin223","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278147.jpg?_r=1417725779","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Date":1425402944,"Content":"<p>Things are going at a snails pace over here. I'm not sure when or where I should gather my guests for a welcome party. Are you using your own music for the ceremony? Which location is your wedding again?<\/p>\n","PostKey":"e26a93fae239cc0602e0d93e47bd8496","CanDelete":true,"Attachments":[]},{"Id":16844,"Author":{"Id":279807,"Name":"kyoung090","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279807.jpg?_r=1425064124","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":228,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1427666180,"Content":"<p>I just saw this I am sorry! I am using the band to play while everyone is seating, but we were going to bring our own music cause I have a song I would like to walk down the aisle to. We need to work on that though. We will use something like a speaker with bluetooth but i want to make sure its loud enough. We have a little bose speaker so we will see. My wedding is at the beach and the reception is at the preferred pool. We are doing our welcome party\/meet and greet on sunday, the day before my wedding in the lobby at that bar. We have about 40 in our group. I am still finalizing some things, it is coming quickly!! What about your wedding? where are you having everything held?<\/p>\n","PostKey":"77b6f241cb4e60f6355ff84af026e37c","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]}],"Id":8798,"Subject":"wedding plans","StartDate":1425066640,"Starter":{"Id":279807,"Name":"kyoung090","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279807.jpg?_r=1425064124","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":228,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"To":{"Id":278147,"Name":"erobin223","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278147.jpg?_r=1417725779","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"Preview":{"Id":16844,"Author":{"Id":279807,"Name":"kyoung090","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279807.jpg?_r=1425064124","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":228,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"Date":1427666180,"Content":"I just saw this I am sorry! I am using the band to play while everyone is seating, but we were go...","PostKey":"77b6f241cb4e60f6355ff84af026e37c","CanDelete":false,"Attachments":[]},"IsRead":true,"IsDeleted":false,"TotalReplies":2,"Notifications":true,"CanReply":true},"Pages":{"TotalItems":3,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
