{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bedcfbc00e237adea49bae05be1db53f","RawContent":"We&#039;re flying (from Canada) with Air Transat and transportation to and from the resort is included with our package.  I have heard of couples getting free private shuttles from the airport, but I think that&#039;s just for the bride and groom.  There are shuttle companies you can hire for a pretty decent rate if you&#039;re trying to transport all of your guests.  Last year I went to Tulum for a friend&#039;s wedding, and she hired a private shuttle for the group because the transfer would have taken far too long if we went on the shuttle that was included with our trip (from Sunwing - another Canadian vacation company).  I think we paid about $20 each for the private shuttle to Tulum, and that included beer and water for around 20 people.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ps31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Amy thanks for sharing the information about the new contact. \n \n A question for everyone:  What kind of transportation service are you using from the airport to Sapphire?  My TA said he could arrange a service to pick us up, but I&#039;ve had several guests ask me to check with the hotel.  Does anyone know if the resort offers a shuttle of some sort??  Some of my guests seem to think it should be part of the package, but I would imagine it&#039;s an additional fee.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1502933,"PostDate":1313081372,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> We're flying (from Canada) with Air Transat and transportation to and from the resort is included with our package.\u00a0 I have heard of couples getting free private shuttles from the airport, but I think that's just for the bride and groom.\u00a0 There are shuttle companies you can hire for a pretty decent rate if you're trying to transport all of your guests.\u00a0 Last year I went to Tulum for a friend's wedding, and she hired a private shuttle for the group because the transfer would have taken far too long if we went on the shuttle that was included with our trip (from Sunwing - another Canadian vacation company).\u00a0 I think we paid about $20 each for the private shuttle to Tulum, and that included beer and water for around 20 people.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ps31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Amy thanks for sharing the information about the new contact.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> A question for everyone:\u00a0 What kind of transportation service are you using from the airport to Sapphire?\u00a0 My TA said he could arrange a service to pick us up, but I've had several guests ask me to check with the hotel.\u00a0 Does anyone know if the resort offers a shuttle of some sort??\u00a0 Some of my guests seem to think it should be part of the package, but I would imagine it's an additional fee.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lianeetodd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305064173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239838.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lianee","Id":239838,"Name":"lianee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e449449eceeab97a4a78deeecb549ff6","RawContent":"With our TA our prices did include transfers to and from the airport. With the wedding package we bought we will receive private transportation. I wonder if other resorts have so much turn over as it seems like this one always has a new wedding planner.","Attachments":[],"Id":1503047,"PostDate":1313090786,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                With our TA our prices did include transfers to and from the airport. With the wedding package we bought we will receive private transportation. I wonder if other resorts have so much turn over as it seems like this one always has a new wedding planner.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"408a95f37e55e0745df7350d4c591d88","RawContent":"Thanks for the info about Anel! \n \n I am planning on a welcome reception, but to keep it free we were just thinking of doing a dinner in the Market Cafe (buffet). I believe they will more or less block off an area for the group so it&#039;s semi-private. I just can&#039;t justify paying $22 per person plus tax &amp;amp; service to have it in one of the restaurants with a set menu, on top of all the other add-ons at this point! \n \n Another idea I had thought about was a meet-and-greet at one of the bars. More casual that way and people would be free to go wherever they liked for dinner still. We&#039;ll see..\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kelnces[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I have been in touch with Anel and although her emails are a bit delayed, she seems very organized and responsive.  I have been using the same email address to contact her as I originally had with Sandra.  Is anyone else having a welcome reception and if so what is the location you are using?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1503048,"PostDate":1313090815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the info about Anel!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am planning on a welcome reception, but to keep it free we were just thinking of doing a dinner in the Market Cafe (buffet). I believe they will more or less block off an area for the group so it's semi-private. I just can't justify paying $22 per person plus tax & service to have it in one of the restaurants with a set menu,\u00a0on top of all the other add-ons at this point!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Another idea I had thought about was a meet-and-greet at one of the bars. More casual that way and people would be free to go wherever they liked for dinner still. We'll see..<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kelnces<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I have been in touch with Anel and although her emails are a bit delayed, she seems very organized and responsive.\u00a0 I have been using the same email address to contact her as I originally had with Sandra.\u00a0 Is anyone else having a welcome reception and if so what is the location you are using?\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahspencer15@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1281413134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231199.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"82turtles","Id":231199,"Name":"82turtles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0acedce211e6467737bfaa56ed783157","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thats a really great idea, we have a large group and i read that capacity in the restaurants is only 35 people.&amp;nbsp; We are looking at having over 75, so I may have to do a private event.&amp;nbsp; I reached out to Anel to find out our options and am awaiting her response.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1503193,"PostDate":1313104093,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thats a really great idea, we have a large group and i read that capacity in the restaurants is only 35 people.\u00a0 We are looking at having over 75, so I may have to do a private event.\u00a0 I reached out to Anel to find out our options and am awaiting her response.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelnces@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297830267,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236845.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kelnces","Id":236845,"Name":"kelnces","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b9de884ff898dc5262f75e79976db46","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the info on the transportation question, my TA said he could arrange that for each guest.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; On a another note...I recently contacted the new coordinator, Anel, and she responded in less than a day!&amp;nbsp; I was pleasantly surprised with her timely response.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m hoping that&#039;s a good sign:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1503798,"PostDate":1313196375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the info on the transportation question, my TA said he could arrange that for each guest.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> On a another note...I recently contacted the new coordinator, Anel, and she responded in less than a day!\u00a0 I was pleasantly surprised with her timely response.\u00a0 I'm hoping that's a good sign:)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashirkey@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300687841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237999.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ps31","Id":237999,"Name":"ps31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"76ccc9a11480067f765029e0ab101975","RawContent":"That&#039;s nice that they don&#039;t inform us !","Attachments":[],"Id":1503938,"PostDate":1313256763,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That's nice that they don't inform us !\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moderncosmo1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304978447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239791.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moderncosmo1","Id":239791,"Name":"Moderncosmo1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f66b98d38624362998de54629dbff2f8","RawContent":"ps31, \n \n My guests roundtrip transportation from the airport to the resort is included in their travel package from my travel agent.  They will be using the shuttles from the resort but at no additional cost.  This was definitely a perk since it can get very confusing when traveling to an international country.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ps31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Amy thanks for sharing the information about the new contact. \n \n A question for everyone:  What kind of transportation service are you using from the airport to Sapphire?  My TA said he could arrange a service to pick us up, but I&#039;ve had several guests ask me to check with the hotel.  Does anyone know if the resort offers a shuttle of some sort??  Some of my guests seem to think it should be part of the package, but I would imagine it&#039;s an additional fee.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1505068,"PostDate":1313461646,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> ps31,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My guests roundtrip transportation from the airport to the resort is included in their travel package from my travel agent.\u00a0 They will be using the shuttles from the resort but at no additional cost.\u00a0 This was definitely a perk since it can get very confusing when traveling to an international country.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ps31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Amy thanks for sharing the information about the new contact.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> A question for everyone:\u00a0 What kind of transportation service are you using from the airport to Sapphire?\u00a0 My TA said he could arrange a service to pick us up, but I've had several guests ask me to check with the hotel.\u00a0 Does anyone know if the resort offers a shuttle of some sort??\u00a0 Some of my guests seem to think it should be part of the package, but I would imagine it's an additional fee.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eead867d1ad35660fa8f54227ecca526","RawContent":"That&#039;s exciting that your going to see the resort before hand. I&#039;m just like you detail oriented can&#039;t wait to see what you have to say about it. Im getting married 10 13 12 :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1506586,"PostDate":1313637823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                That's exciting that your going to see the resort before hand. I'm just like you detail oriented can't wait to see what you have to say about it. Im getting married 10 13 12 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moderncosmo1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304978447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239791.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moderncosmo1","Id":239791,"Name":"Moderncosmo1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2fe385afa56b18f4e46766c02494c71d","RawContent":"[quote name=\"jsal4\"]\n&lt;p&gt;I just submitted the ppwk and deposit for a wedding date of 10\/12\/12. My fiance and I have actually booked a trip to see it 10\/21\/11 - 10\/26\/11. I am very much a planner and very detail oriented. Once we get back from our trip, I will definitely post everything I find out and whatever I can negotiate.&lt;\/p&gt;[\/quote] Can&#039;t wait to hear how your trip went. I&#039;m getting married 10\/13\/12 :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1506587,"PostDate":1313637965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"jsal4\" url=\"\/t\/74418\/now&#045;sapphire&#045;weddings&#045;formerly&#045;paradisus&#045;riviera\/10#post_1648761\"><p><p>I just submitted the ppwk and deposit for a wedding date of 10\/12\/12. My fiance and I have actually booked a trip to see it 10\/21\/11 - 10\/26\/11. I am very much a planner and very detail oriented. Once we get back from our trip, I will definitely post everything I find out and whatever I can negotiate.<\/p><\/p><\/blockquote> Can't wait to hear how your trip went. I'm getting married 10\/13\/12 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moderncosmo1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304978447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239791.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moderncosmo1","Id":239791,"Name":"Moderncosmo1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"12dd202e634260bc89f57a9c3ade60fc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Well it took longer than expected to get everything finalised, but we have finally booked our photographer! We are using Jonathan from LaLuna, and I am so excited!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1506593,"PostDate":1313638706,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Well it took longer than expected to get everything finalised, but we have finally booked our photographer! We are using Jonathan from LaLuna, and I am so excited!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":20,"NextPage":30,"PreviousPage":10,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
