{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f21b74896ca190a19444b7ec93bd58aa","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just submitted the ppwk and deposit for a wedding date of 10\/12\/12. My fiance and I have actually booked a trip to see it 10\/21\/11 - 10\/26\/11. I am very much a planner and very detail oriented. Once we get back from our trip, I will definitely post everything I find out and whatever I can negotiate.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1499193,"PostDate":1312489973,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just submitted the ppwk and deposit for a wedding date of 10\/12\/12. My fiance and I have actually booked a trip to see it 10\/21\/11 - 10\/26\/11. I am very much a planner and very detail oriented. Once we get back from our trip, I will definitely post everything I find out and whatever I can negotiate.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312489536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd3361da9a74260bb7008079a29589c5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Any updates on whether or not Sandra is still with Now Sapphire?&amp;nbsp; I haven&#039;t had to contact her for a while, so I&#039;m not really sure what&#039;s going on there.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1499823,"PostDate":1312559243,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Any updates on whether or not Sandra is still with Now Sapphire?\u00a0 I haven't had to contact her for a while, so I'm not really sure what's going on there.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lianeetodd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305064173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239838.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lianee","Id":239838,"Name":"lianee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b20efe5bd529f19460d3a6e519c6b31b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Great idea on the new thread! I am getting married at NOW Sapphire on April 21, 2012.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1499947,"PostDate":1312568759,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Great idea on the new thread! I am getting married at NOW Sapphire on April 21, 2012.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"210e7156fa60a7a0ac2ad74e39baf61b","RawContent":"Hi lianee (&amp;amp; everyone else), \n \n I just heard back from the resort Concierge (sp ?), Olivia Rodriguez, and she told me that Sandra is [u]no longer [\/u]working at the Sapphire.  She said my new contact is Anel Torres.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lianee[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Any updates on whether or not Sandra is still with Now Sapphire?  I haven&#039;t had to contact her for a while, so I&#039;m not really sure what&#039;s going on there.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1501720,"PostDate":1312915091,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi lianee (& everyone else),<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I just heard back from the resort Concierge (sp ?), Olivia Rodriguez, and she told me that Sandra is <u>no longer <\/u>working at the Sapphire.\u00a0 She said my new contact is Anel Torres.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lianee<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Any updates on whether or not Sandra is still with Now Sapphire?\u00a0 I haven't had to contact her for a while, so I'm not really sure what's going on there.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b06064da23d581b88a4f855dc5ef0bc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for the update Amy!&amp;nbsp; Have you tried to email Anel yet?&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t really think I have much to discuss with them at this point, so I&#039;m going to wait until I have things more sorted out on my end.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1501853,"PostDate":1312924828,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for the update Amy!\u00a0 Have you tried to email Anel yet?\u00a0 I don't really think I have much to discuss with them at this point, so I'm going to wait until I have things more sorted out on my end.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lianeetodd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305064173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239838.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lianee","Id":239838,"Name":"lianee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecce0d466dcbe2baff9ed9f6384f1c26","RawContent":"lianee, \n \n I did email Anel yesterday just to confirm she had all my reservation info, contact info, etc. but I have not heard back from her.  I&#039;ll give it about a week before I start to panic, hehe. \n \n I&#039;ll keep you posted.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lianee[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks for the update Amy!  Have you tried to email Anel yet?  I don&#039;t really think I have much to discuss with them at this point, so I&#039;m going to wait until I have things more sorted out on my end.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1502290,"PostDate":1312997887,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> lianee,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I did email Anel yesterday just to confirm she had all my reservation info, contact info, etc. but I have not heard back from her.\u00a0 I'll give it about a week before I start to panic, hehe.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'll keep you posted.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lianee<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks for the update Amy!\u00a0 Have you tried to email Anel yet?\u00a0 I don't really think I have much to discuss with them at this point, so I'm going to wait until I have things more sorted out on my end.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acab576d88af3053104c0cfc556f6cb9","RawContent":"Sad to hear that Sandra is no longer there. I had read reviews that said she was amazing and did a great job with their wedding! \n \n Hm, that&#039;s a good idea contacting Anel.. I should email and make sure they still have all my info and reservations confirmed! Is Anel&#039;s email the same as what Sandra&#039;s was?\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AmyG[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n lianee, \n \n I did email Anel yesterday just to confirm she had all my reservation info, contact info, etc. but I have not heard back from her.  I&#039;ll give it about a week before I start to panic, hehe. \n \n I&#039;ll keep you posted.\n \n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1502365,"PostDate":1313004496,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sad to hear that Sandra is no longer there. I had read reviews that said she was amazing and did a great job with their wedding!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hm, that's a good idea contacting Anel.. I should email and make sure they still have all my info and reservations confirmed! Is Anel's email the same as what Sandra's was?<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AmyG<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> lianee,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I did email Anel yesterday just to confirm she had all my reservation info, contact info, etc. but I have not heard back from her.\u00a0 I'll give it about a week before I start to panic, hehe.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'll keep you posted.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahspencer15@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1281413134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231199.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"82turtles","Id":231199,"Name":"82turtles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a074473d0c5e376dcf9d77fecbacdd35","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I have been in touch with Anel and although her emails are a bit delayed, she seems very organized and responsive.&amp;nbsp; I have been using the same email address to contact her as I originally had with Sandra.&amp;nbsp; Is anyone else having a welcome reception and if so what is the location you are using?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1502483,"PostDate":1313015300,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I have been in touch with Anel and although her emails are a bit delayed, she seems very organized and responsive.\u00a0 I have been using the same email address to contact her as I originally had with Sandra.\u00a0 Is anyone else having a welcome reception and if so what is the location you are using?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kelnces@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297830267,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236845.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kelnces","Id":236845,"Name":"kelnces","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"072f81f2dd20166d4d1fcfe42b64ed9d","RawContent":"Hi 82turtles, \n \n I also heard great things about Sandra, so hopefully Anel is on top of it.   :-)\n   \n Yes, Anel&#039;s email address is the same that Sandra used, just as kelnces said.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]82turtles[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sad to hear that Sandra is no longer there. I had read reviews that said she was amazing and did a great job with their wedding! \n \n Hm, that&#039;s a good idea contacting Anel.. I should email and make sure they still have all my info and reservations confirmed! Is Anel&#039;s email the same as what Sandra&#039;s was?\n \n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1502577,"PostDate":1313022828,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi 82turtles,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also heard great things about Sandra, so hopefully Anel is on top of it.\u00a0\u00a0 :-)<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yes, Anel's email address is the same that Sandra used, just as kelnces said.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>82turtles<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sad to hear that Sandra is no longer there. I had read reviews that said she was amazing and did a great job with their wedding!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hm, that's a good idea contacting Anel.. I should email and make sure they still have all my info and reservations confirmed! Is Anel's email the same as what Sandra's was?<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"67cc878d5c0efdf50167bdba19ec3426","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Amy thanks for sharing the information about the new contact.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; A question for everyone:&amp;nbsp; What kind of transportation service are you using from the airport to Sapphire?&amp;nbsp; My TA said he could arrange a service to pick us up, but I&#039;ve had several guests ask me to check with the hotel.&amp;nbsp; Does anyone know if the resort offers a shuttle of some sort??&amp;nbsp; Some of my guests seem to think it should be part of the package, but I would imagine it&#039;s an additional fee.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1502756,"PostDate":1313044355,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Amy thanks for sharing the information about the new contact.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> A question for everyone:\u00a0 What kind of transportation service are you using from the airport to Sapphire?\u00a0 My TA said he could arrange a service to pick us up, but I've had several guests ask me to check with the hotel.\u00a0 Does anyone know if the resort offers a shuttle of some sort??\u00a0 Some of my guests seem to think it should be part of the package, but I would imagine it's an additional fee.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashirkey@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300687841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237999.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ps31","Id":237999,"Name":"ps31","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
