{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9de122878058e4e42bbb83505843d485","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We are also using johnathon from la luna! I can&#039;t wait!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1507000,"PostDate":1313702045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are also using johnathon from la luna! I can't wait!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"magirl21@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.184.150.231","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276800205,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229273.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"magirl","Id":229273,"Name":"magirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62ff70b2a45322b2cc0b3eded474f340","RawContent":"That&#039;s awesome, I really love his work. When is your wedding? I&#039;m wondering if I get to snoop at your photos before my wedding rolls around!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]magirl[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We are also using johnathon from la luna! I can&#039;t wait! \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1507016,"PostDate":1313702945,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That's awesome, I really love his work. When is your wedding? I'm wondering if I get to snoop at your photos before my wedding rolls around!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>magirl<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We are also using johnathon from la luna! I can't wait!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"113346742a5f8220e416637aab0e19ae","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I am new to this forum so I am still trying to figure everything out. &amp;nbsp;I am getting married at the Now Sapphire on June 30, 2012!! &amp;nbsp;I had some difficulty at first booking the resort, but eventually got it all figured out. &amp;nbsp;Ramon is my WC, anyone have him? &amp;nbsp;He has been good with responding and answering questions.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I also am going with La Luna Photography and am trying to decide between Jonathan and Melissa. &amp;nbsp;Anyone ever use either?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have actually been to the resort (early June of this year) and thought I might be able to help some brides who have not been there. &amp;nbsp;My FI and I fell in love with it and despite hours of research, no other resort could compare to NOW for looks and price! &amp;nbsp;I am going to try and post some actual pics too further below, so you all can see real photos. &amp;nbsp;I am not a photographer though : )&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The resort is just as beautiful as the pics so you can rest easily! &amp;nbsp;There is a seaweed problem on the beach and especially in the ocean, but it may have just been from a pending storm. &amp;nbsp;They do have machines to wash it off the beach. I have to say that the staff was amazing. &amp;nbsp;They were extremely helpful, although we did tip slightly. &amp;nbsp;We did a private dinner on the beach (which is similar to the wedding food) and the food was excellent. &amp;nbsp;The restaurants are pretty good too for all inclusive. &amp;nbsp;I am not a fan of buffet, but even that was pretty good when we ate it. &amp;nbsp;We did preferred club and really enjoyed the perks, although I am not sure you have to. &amp;nbsp;We were able to reserve front row beach cabanas, although it never seemed to be a problem while we were there. &amp;nbsp;It was not very crowded, yet it was before schools were out. &amp;nbsp;I heard the pool was an issue reserving seats if you were not preferred club, but we can sit by a pool where we live so we only jumped in and went back to the beach. &amp;nbsp;Our room&#039;s view was phenomenol!. &amp;nbsp;We were only there for a few days so we did not do any excursions, but there were many options. &amp;nbsp;They had all sorts of vendors come to the resort one of the nights and we bought beautiful hand painted pictures for very little money! &amp;nbsp;All in all the resort was great. &amp;nbsp;Feel free to ask any specific questions!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I would also like to add that while we were there we saw a wedding and it was beautiful! &amp;nbsp;I wish I had my camera on me to take pics!. Unfortunately a freak storm rained on the bride as she came out, but it did look beautiful before and the resort did a great job! &amp;nbsp;Of course, the rain stopped about 10 minutes after the ceremony! &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here are some pics:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"078.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520261\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; View from our balcony. &amp;nbsp;Ocean front preferred club.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"IMG_0198.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520263\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"129.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520265\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Our private dinner. &amp;nbsp;You can see the seaweed before it is cleared off. &amp;nbsp;Still beautiful beach!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"101.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520267\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Main pool with gazebo.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"108.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520271\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; View from lunch restaurant. &amp;nbsp;You could also eat here for breakfast with Preferred club, which we enjoyed!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I have a ton more pictures, so if you want to see more, just let me know! &amp;nbsp;Enjoy! &amp;nbsp;\n Lauren&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1508076,"PostDate":1313900582,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone,<\/p> <p> I am new to this forum so I am still trying to figure everything out. \u00a0I am getting married at the Now Sapphire on June 30, 2012!! \u00a0I had some difficulty at first booking the resort, but eventually got it all figured out. \u00a0Ramon is my WC, anyone have him? \u00a0He has been good with responding and answering questions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also am going with La Luna Photography and am trying to decide between Jonathan and Melissa. \u00a0Anyone ever use either?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have actually been to the resort (early June of this year) and thought I might be able to help some brides who have not been there. \u00a0My FI and I fell in love with it and despite hours of research, no other resort could compare to NOW for looks and price! \u00a0I am going to try and post some actual pics too further below, so you all can see real photos. \u00a0I am not a photographer though : )<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The resort is just as beautiful as the pics so you can rest easily! \u00a0There is a seaweed problem on the beach and especially in the ocean, but it may have just been from a pending storm. \u00a0They do have machines to wash it off the beach. I have to say that the staff was amazing. \u00a0They were extremely helpful, although we did tip slightly. \u00a0We did a private dinner on the beach (which is similar to the wedding food) and the food was excellent. \u00a0The restaurants are pretty good too for all inclusive. \u00a0I am not a fan of buffet, but even that was pretty good when we ate it. \u00a0We did preferred club and really enjoyed the perks, although I am not sure you have to. \u00a0We were able to reserve front row beach cabanas, although it never seemed to be a problem while we were there. \u00a0It was not very crowded, yet it was before schools were out. \u00a0I heard the pool was an issue reserving seats if you were not preferred club, but we can sit by a pool where we live so we only jumped in and went back to the beach. \u00a0Our room's view was phenomenol!. \u00a0We were only there for a few days so we did not do any excursions, but there were many options. \u00a0They had all sorts of vendors come to the resort one of the nights and we bought beautiful hand painted pictures for very little money! \u00a0All in all the resort was great. \u00a0Feel free to ask any specific questions!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would also like to add that while we were there we saw a wedding and it was beautiful! \u00a0I wish I had my camera on me to take pics!. Unfortunately a freak storm rained on the bride as she came out, but it did look beautiful before and the resort did a great job! \u00a0Of course, the rain stopped about 10 minutes after the ceremony! \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here are some pics:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"078.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520261\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> View from our balcony. \u00a0Ocean front preferred club.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0198.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520263\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"129.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520265\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> Our private dinner. \u00a0You can see the seaweed before it is cleared off. \u00a0Still beautiful beach!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"101.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520267\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> Main pool with gazebo.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"108.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520271\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> View from lunch restaurant. \u00a0You could also eat here for breakfast with Preferred club, which we enjoyed!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have a ton more pictures, so if you want to see more, just let me know! \u00a0Enjoy! \u00a0<br \/> Lauren<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"llkrik10@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.146.185.112","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1307928428,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241054.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Llkrik1010","Id":241054,"Name":"Llkrik1010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6da6ffabad2cbe3568697dc2e56a6fe0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Lauren-&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Welcome to this thread, you&#039;ll love it.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s a great group of people and I love hearing from others in my same situation:)&amp;nbsp; These are great pictures, thanks for sharing!&amp;nbsp; I can say that any pictures of the place is appreciated since I&#039;ve never been and won&#039;t be there until my wedding.&amp;nbsp; Also the good review(s) is nice to hear.&amp;nbsp; I have not heard of Ramon, but there has been some changes there recently.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m glad he has been good with communication!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1508498,"PostDate":1314006438,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Lauren-<\/p> <p> Welcome to this thread, you'll love it.\u00a0 It's a great group of people and I love hearing from others in my same situation:)\u00a0 These are great pictures, thanks for sharing!\u00a0 I can say that any pictures of the place is appreciated since I've never been and won't be there until my wedding.\u00a0 Also the good review(s) is nice to hear.\u00a0 I have not heard of Ramon, but there has been some changes there recently.\u00a0 I'm glad he has been good with communication!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashirkey@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300687841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237999.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ps31","Id":237999,"Name":"ps31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"729076195d91c36a058187ca6c969074","RawContent":"We are very excited to check everything out this October. Congrats to you! I think October will be perfect weather for our weddings!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Moderncosmo1[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Can&#039;t wait to hear how your trip went. I&#039;m getting married 10\/13\/12 :)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1508890,"PostDate":1314040466,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We are very excited to check everything out this October. Congrats to you! I think October will be perfect weather for our weddings!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Moderncosmo1<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Can't wait to hear how your trip went. I'm getting married 10\/13\/12 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12px;\"><strong><span><em><span>\"Where there is love, there is life.\"<\/span><\/em><\/span><\/strong><\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"saludbrewer@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312489536,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243235.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jsal4","Id":243235,"Name":"jsal4","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bb9f35920ce50623632ccb2ec523ca91","RawContent":"Thanks for the welcome!  I think you are going to love the resort!  It really is so pretty!  Here are some more pics, so you can see the resort even more: \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522299\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n There is water everywhere and beautiful fountains! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522301\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n View of where we stayed from the beach.  The rooms really do look just like the pictures and the bathrooms are also very nice! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522305\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n This was the shrimp provencal that we got for our private dinner on the beach. It is acutally a wedding food option (I think divine package) and it was very good! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522309\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n This is the main lobby.  It is really open and a nice breeze.  This is where the vendors come in and set up.  There is a nice bar to the right and plenty of seating. \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522311\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n A little motivation to get through the time before everyone&#039;s wedding! \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ps31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Lauren- \n Welcome to this thread, you&#039;ll love it.  It&#039;s a great group of people and I love hearing from others in my same situation:)  These are great pictures, thanks for sharing!  I can say that any pictures of the place is appreciated since I&#039;ve never been and won&#039;t be there until my wedding.  Also the good review(s) is nice to hear.  I have not heard of Ramon, but there has been some changes there recently.  I&#039;m glad he has been good with communication! \n[\/quote] \n \n Let me know if anyone has any other questions. \n Lauren","Attachments":[],"Id":1509627,"PostDate":1314119344,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Thanks for the welcome! \u00a0I think you are going to love the resort! \u00a0It really is so pretty! \u00a0Here are some more pics, so you can see the resort even more:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"071.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522299\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> There is water everywhere and beautiful fountains!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"096.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522301\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> View of where we stayed from the beach. \u00a0The rooms really do look just like the pictures and the bathrooms are also very nice!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"133.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522305\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> This was the shrimp provencal that we got for our private dinner on the beach. It is acutally a wedding food option (I think divine package) and it was very good!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0327.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522309\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> This is the main lobby. \u00a0It is really open and a nice breeze. \u00a0This is where the vendors come in and set up. \u00a0There is a nice bar to the right and plenty of seating.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0322.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/522311\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> A little motivation to get through the time before everyone's wedding!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ps31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Lauren-<\/p> <p> Welcome to this thread, you'll love it.\u00a0 It's a great group of people and I love hearing from others in my same situation:)\u00a0 These are great pictures, thanks for sharing!\u00a0 I can say that any pictures of the place is appreciated since I've never been and won't be there until my wedding.\u00a0 Also the good review(s) is nice to hear.\u00a0 I have not heard of Ramon, but there has been some changes there recently.\u00a0 I'm glad he has been good with communication!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> Let me know if anyone has any other questions.<\/p> <p> Lauren<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"llkrik10@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.146.185.112","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1307928428,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241054.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Llkrik1010","Id":241054,"Name":"Llkrik1010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"62a065bbe4c5d066e40c71173c1d708b","RawContent":"Llkrik1010,  Thank you so much for sharing the pics and a review of your visit.  It helps put me at ease since I have not been to the resort.  Good luck in your planning and welcome to this awesome forum!!!\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Llkrik1010[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Everyone, \n I am new to this forum so I am still trying to figure everything out.  I am getting married at the Now Sapphire on June 30, 2012!!  I had some difficulty at first booking the resort, but eventually got it all figured out.  Ramon is my WC, anyone have him?  He has been good with responding and answering questions. \n \n I also am going with La Luna Photography and am trying to decide between Jonathan and Melissa.  Anyone ever use either? \n \n I have actually been to the resort (early June of this year) and thought I might be able to help some brides who have not been there.  My FI and I fell in love with it and despite hours of research, no other resort could compare to NOW for looks and price!  I am going to try and post some actual pics too further below, so you all can see real photos.  I am not a photographer though : ) \n \n The resort is just as beautiful as the pics so you can rest easily!  There is a seaweed problem on the beach and especially in the ocean, but it may have just been from a pending storm.  They do have machines to wash it off the beach. I have to say that the staff was amazing.  They were extremely helpful, although we did tip slightly.  We did a private dinner on the beach (which is similar to the wedding food) and the food was excellent.  The restaurants are pretty good too for all inclusive.  I am not a fan of buffet, but even that was pretty good when we ate it.  We did preferred club and really enjoyed the perks, although I am not sure you have to.  We were able to reserve front row beach cabanas, although it never seemed to be a problem while we were there.  It was not very crowded, yet it was before schools were out.  I heard the pool was an issue reserving seats if you were not preferred club, but we can sit by a pool where we live so we only jumped in and went back to the beach.  Our room&#039;s view was phenomenol!.  We were only there for a few days so we did not do any excursions, but there were many options.  They had all sorts of vendors come to the resort one of the nights and we bought beautiful hand painted pictures for very little money!  All in all the resort was great.  Feel free to ask any specific questions! \n \n I would also like to add that while we were there we saw a wedding and it was beautiful!  I wish I had my camera on me to take pics!. Unfortunately a freak storm rained on the bride as she came out, but it did look beautiful before and the resort did a great job!  Of course, the rain stopped about 10 minutes after the ceremony!   \n \n Here are some pics: \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520261\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n View from our balcony.  Ocean front preferred club. \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520263\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520265\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n Our private dinner.  You can see the seaweed before it is cleared off.  Still beautiful beach! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520267\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n Main pool with gazebo. \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520271\/width\/1000\/height\/500[\/img] \n View from lunch restaurant.  You could also eat here for breakfast with Preferred club, which we enjoyed!  \n \n I have a ton more pictures, so if you want to see more, just let me know!  Enjoy!  \n Lauren[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1509682,"PostDate":1314122859,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Llkrik1010,\u00a0 Thank you so much for sharing the pics and a review of your visit.\u00a0 It helps put me at ease since I have not been to the resort.\u00a0 Good luck in your planning and welcome to this awesome forum!!!<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Llkrik1010<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-right: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-bottom: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Everyone,<\/p> <p> I am new to this forum so I am still trying to figure everything out. \u00a0I am getting married at the Now Sapphire on June 30, 2012!! \u00a0I had some difficulty at first booking the resort, but eventually got it all figured out. \u00a0Ramon is my WC, anyone have him? \u00a0He has been good with responding and answering questions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also am going with La Luna Photography and am trying to decide between Jonathan and Melissa. \u00a0Anyone ever use either?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have actually been to the resort (early June of this year) and thought I might be able to help some brides who have not been there. \u00a0My FI and I fell in love with it and despite hours of research, no other resort could compare to NOW for looks and price! \u00a0I am going to try and post some actual pics too further below, so you all can see real photos. \u00a0I am not a photographer though : )<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The resort is just as beautiful as the pics so you can rest easily! \u00a0There is a seaweed problem on the beach and especially in the ocean, but it may have just been from a pending storm. \u00a0They do have machines to wash it off the beach. I have to say that the staff was amazing. \u00a0They were extremely helpful, although we did tip slightly. \u00a0We did a private dinner on the beach (which is similar to the wedding food) and the food was excellent. \u00a0The restaurants are pretty good too for all inclusive. \u00a0I am not a fan of buffet, but even that was pretty good when we ate it. \u00a0We did preferred club and really enjoyed the perks, although I am not sure you have to. \u00a0We were able to reserve front row beach cabanas, although it never seemed to be a problem while we were there. \u00a0It was not very crowded, yet it was before schools were out. \u00a0I heard the pool was an issue reserving seats if you were not preferred club, but we can sit by a pool where we live so we only jumped in and went back to the beach. \u00a0Our room's view was phenomenol!. \u00a0We were only there for a few days so we did not do any excursions, but there were many options. \u00a0They had all sorts of vendors come to the resort one of the nights and we bought beautiful hand painted pictures for very little money! \u00a0All in all the resort was great. \u00a0Feel free to ask any specific questions!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would also like to add that while we were there we saw a wedding and it was beautiful! \u00a0I wish I had my camera on me to take pics!. Unfortunately a freak storm rained on the bride as she came out, but it did look beautiful before and the resort did a great job! \u00a0Of course, the rain stopped about 10 minutes after the ceremony! \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Here are some pics:<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"078.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520261\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> View from our balcony. \u00a0Ocean front preferred club.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_0198.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520263\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"129.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520265\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> Our private dinner. \u00a0You can see the seaweed before it is cleared off. \u00a0Still beautiful beach!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"101.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520267\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> Main pool with gazebo.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"108.JPG\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/520271\/width\/1000\/height\/500\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> View from lunch restaurant. \u00a0You could also eat here for breakfast with Preferred club, which we enjoyed!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have a ton more pictures, so if you want to see more, just let me know! \u00a0Enjoy! \u00a0<br \/> Lauren<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7284e2c30833f2e4665c098faa2a509f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Lauren,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks so much for the information and pictures! Like the others, it puts me at ease about the resort.&amp;nbsp; I have never been there and will not see the resort until 2 days before the wedding.&amp;nbsp; I did some research online, and I could not find another resort that beat the value that NOW Sapphire provides.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1509684,"PostDate":1314123094,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Lauren,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks so much for the information and pictures! Like the others, it puts me at ease about the resort.\u00a0 I have never been there and will not see the resort until 2 days before the wedding.\u00a0 I did some research online, and I could not find another resort that beat the value that NOW Sapphire provides.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f9a1dd17b1b7712b6da8318a2be01f7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; hello Ladies!!!\n \n I hope all the wedding planning is going great and fun :) I finally came across this thread and so happy I did. I have been searching for reviews on the Sapphire and could not find any. Thanks for all the comments, they have been truly helpful. I was hoping someone could send me contact (email) info for either Olivia Rodriguez or Anel Torres. I have been working with Ramon, though he has been very helpful and&amp;nbsp;thorough with his responses, it seems to take a while to hear back from him (it has been 3 weeks,&amp;nbsp;I emailed him multiple times and still have not heard back yet). I am trying to book my wedding date for 5\/28\/12 as soon as possible since I do not have much time left for the STDs etc. The Royal has been very quick to respond so I may have to choose that resort. I wanted to give the Sapphire one last shot since some of you mentioned working with Olivia and Anel. Also anyone have opinions on The Sapphire Vs The Royal (which is better and why)&amp;nbsp;... Thanks Everyone!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1510490,"PostDate":1314216145,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> hello Ladies!!!<br \/> <br \/> I hope all the wedding planning is going great and fun <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I finally came across this thread and so happy I did. I have been searching for reviews on the Sapphire and could not find any. Thanks for all the comments, they have been truly helpful. I was hoping someone could send me contact (email) info for either Olivia Rodriguez or Anel Torres. I have been working with Ramon, though he has been very helpful and\u00a0thorough with his responses, it seems to take a while to hear back from him (it has been 3 weeks,\u00a0I emailed him multiple times and still have not heard back yet). I am trying to book my wedding date for 5\/28\/12 as soon as possible since I do not have much time left for the STDs etc. The Royal has been very quick to respond so I may have to choose that resort. I wanted to give the Sapphire one last shot since some of you mentioned working with Olivia and Anel. Also anyone have opinions on The Sapphire Vs The Royal (which is better and why)\u00a0... Thanks Everyone!!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jessag314@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305591136,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-240088.bmp?_r=0","PhotoWidth":0,"PhotoHeight":0,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MrsJohns2be","Id":240088,"Name":"MrsJohns2be","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e861cb1baaf212b9a3ddcdbd8bb128ed","RawContent":"Olivia is very good about getting the wedding coordinators to contact you.  Her email is sales10.nosrc@nowresorts.com and she&#039;s the employee behind the Now Sapphire facebook page.  I&#039;ve found her to be excellent to deal with and very quick to respond.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]MrsJohns2be[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n hello Ladies!!!\n \n I hope all the wedding planning is going great and fun :) I finally came across this thread and so happy I did. I have been searching for reviews on the Sapphire and could not find any. Thanks for all the comments, they have been truly helpful. I was hoping someone could send me contact (email) info for either Olivia Rodriguez or Anel Torres. I have been working with Ramon, though he has been very helpful and thorough with his responses, it seems to take a while to hear back from him (it has been 3 weeks, I emailed him multiple times and still have not heard back yet). I am trying to book my wedding date for 5\/28\/12 as soon as possible since I do not have much time left for the STDs etc. The Royal has been very quick to respond so I may have to choose that resort. I wanted to give the Sapphire one last shot since some of you mentioned working with Olivia and Anel. Also anyone have opinions on The Sapphire Vs The Royal (which is better and why) ... Thanks Everyone!!!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1510563,"PostDate":1314222314,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Olivia is very good about getting the wedding coordinators to contact you.\u00a0 Her email is sales10.nosrc@nowresorts.c<wbr>om <\/wbr>and she's the employee behind the Now Sapphire facebook page.\u00a0 I've found her to be excellent to deal with and very quick to respond.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>MrsJohns2be<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> hello Ladies!!!<br \/> <br \/> I hope all the wedding planning is going great and fun <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> I finally came across this thread and so happy I did. I have been searching for reviews on the Sapphire and could not find any. Thanks for all the comments, they have been truly helpful. I was hoping someone could send me contact (email) info for either Olivia Rodriguez or Anel Torres. I have been working with Ramon, though he has been very helpful and\u00a0thorough with his responses, it seems to take a while to hear back from him (it has been 3 weeks,\u00a0I emailed him multiple times and still have not heard back yet). I am trying to book my wedding date for 5\/28\/12 as soon as possible since I do not have much time left for the STDs etc. The Royal has been very quick to respond so I may have to choose that resort. I wanted to give the Sapphire one last shot since some of you mentioned working with Olivia and Anel. Also anyone have opinions on The Sapphire Vs The Royal (which is better and why)\u00a0... Thanks Everyone!!!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lianeetodd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305064173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239838.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lianee","Id":239838,"Name":"lianee","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":30,"NextPage":40,"PreviousPage":20,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
