{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Id":76028,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"erobin223,\n\nkyoung090 has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"wedding plans\".\n\nkyoung090 said:\n======================================================================\nI just saw this I am sorry! I am using the band to play while everyone is seating, but we were going to bring our own music cause I have a song I would like to walk down the aisle to. We need to work on that though. We will use something like a speaker with bluetooth but i want to make sure its loud enough. We have a little bose speaker so we will see. My wedding is at the beach and the reception is at the preferred pool. We are doing our welcome party\/meet and greet on sunday, the day before my wedding in the lobby at that bar. We have about 40 in our group. I am still finalizing some things, it is coming quickly!! What about your wedding? where are you having everything held?\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=8798&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":279807,"Name":"kyoung090","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279807.jpg?_r=1425064124","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":228,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1427666180,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":8798},{"Id":70790,"Title":"has replied to a personal conversation","Message":"erobin223,\n\nCurlyKristen has replied to a personal conversation entitled \"Ceremony\".\n\nCurlyKristen said:\n======================================================================\nGood morning Erobin223! We used the guitar player that is included in the wedding package for our ceremony and he was wonderful from what I hear. I don't even remember seeing him in person but he is in my pictures <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Let me know if you have any other questions <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> And good luck planning! \n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=findMessage&topicID=8849&msgID=__firstUnread__\n","Sender":{"Id":276272,"Name":"CurlyKristen","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-276272.jpg?_r=1423510309","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1425562996,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":8849},{"Id":69289,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"erobin223,\n\nkyoung090 has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"wedding plans\".\n\nkyoung090 said:\n======================================================================\nhow are things coming along for you?? our weddings are coming so fast!\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=8798#msg16093\n","Sender":{"Id":279807,"Name":"kyoung090","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279807.jpg?_r=1425064124","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":228,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1425066640,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":8798},{"Id":69259,"Title":"started a new personal conversation with you","Message":"erobin223,\n\namydluna has sent you a new personal conversation entitled \"Lighting\".\n\namydluna said:\n======================================================================\nI saw on the forum that you had photos of the lighting provided by the resort. We are getting married in June 2015, on the beach terrace and i am bringing LED candles for the table but am still worried about having enough light for pictures and to see our food. Could you email me the pictures you have to amy.d.luna@gmail.com?\n\nthanks in advance!\namy\n======================================================================\n\nPLEASE DO NOT REPLY DIRECTLY TO THIS EMAIL!\nYou can reply to this personal conversation by following the link below:\n\nhttp:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=messaging&section=view&do=showConversation&topicID=8797#msg16091\n","Sender":{"Id":281638,"Name":"amydluna","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281638.jpg?_r=1420754457","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1425058618,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Conversation","RelatedItemId":8797},{"Id":65496,"Title":"approved your friend request","Message":"erobin223,\n\ndanimarieb has approved your friend request!\n\nLog in and then manage your friends: http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.php?app=members&module=profile&section=friends&do=list\n","Sender":{"Id":279263,"Name":"danimarieb","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279263.jpg?_r=1419118745","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":133,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"NotificationDate":1423345528,"IsRead":true,"RelatedItemType":"Profile","RelatedItemId":279263}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":"5","TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
