Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"539ed58a603eb62eda81013dd59fd086","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]almostmarried[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n is anyone going with the Now to Eternity package? Im having a hard time choosing from the menu for the reception. Any input?[\/quote] \n \n \n I am! We just tried to get something different at every stage. two hot and two cold apps, we did chicken and beef apps and fish for dinner. That way we can try a little of everything. Also if you have a large portion of people who are allergic to fish or something it might be easier to go with the chicken or beef. Thats really the only thought I put into it. I can&#039;t go down and sample the food so its pretty much a guessing game. I&#039;m hoping the atmosphere will be what people remember!","Attachments":[],"Id":1516580,"PostDate":1315491838,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>almostmarried<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> is anyone going with the Now to Eternity package? Im having a hard time choosing from the menu for the reception. Any input?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> I am! We just tried to get something different at every stage. two hot and two cold apps, we did chicken and beef apps and fish for dinner. That way we can try a little of everything. Also if you have a large portion of people who are allergic to fish or something it might be easier to go with the chicken or beef. Thats really the only thought I put into it. I can't go down and sample the food so its pretty much a guessing game. I'm hoping the atmosphere will be what people remember!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"magirl21@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.184.150.231","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276800205,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229273.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"magirl","Id":229273,"Name":"magirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb86ad894fdb8e2658ed2c2a625b6263","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; good point, its so hard to make a choice for everyone. I was wondering if we could mix hot and cold&amp;nbsp; hors d&#039;oeuvres , I&#039;m glad we can. When is your wedding, magirl?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1516941,"PostDate":1315521344,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> good point, its so hard to make a choice for everyone. I was wondering if we could mix hot and cold\u00a0 hors d'oeuvres , I'm glad we can. When is your wedding, magirl?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tayleaha@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315421025,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245009.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"almostmarried","Id":245009,"Name":"almostmarried","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9e209bac7e1d2a6883028168fdfad869","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Has anyone considered using the hotel photographer, or have any information on the hotel photographer?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1517902,"PostDate":1315682872,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Has anyone considered using the hotel photographer, or have any information on the hotel photographer?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"92818a3d1edf11ed27878ad59a7ff6ad","RawContent":"I&#039;m Considering the hotel photographer the photos they sent me via email look great and couldn&#039;t beat the price. Complete coverage including rehearsal dinner and trash the dress 200 plus pictures hard cover book with 40-80 pages ect. For 1500$","Attachments":[],"Id":1518223,"PostDate":1315767937,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I'm Considering the hotel photographer the photos they sent me via email look great and couldn't beat the price. Complete coverage including rehearsal dinner and trash the dress 200 plus pictures hard cover book with 40-80 pages ect. For 1500$\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moderncosmo1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304978447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239791.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moderncosmo1","Id":239791,"Name":"Moderncosmo1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d0f8adbd9106633c15adea5d1a75540d","RawContent":"I visited the Now Sapphire in the beginning of June.  My Fiance and I were there celebrating an anniversary so we got a private dinner on the beach.  The hotel photographer took pictures of us.  We viewed the pictures, and personally, I did not like any of them.  I felt that the pictures we took ourselves were better.  I was not impressed and for my wedding, we are hiring La Luna photography.  I like the photojournalistic approach though, and she did not seem to do that.  It may just be my personal preference.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Vanessa56[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Has anyone considered using the hotel photographer, or have any information on the hotel photographer?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1518241,"PostDate":1315770659,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I visited the Now Sapphire in the beginning of June. \u00a0My Fiance and I were there celebrating an anniversary so we got a private dinner on the beach. \u00a0The hotel photographer took pictures of us. \u00a0We viewed the pictures, and personally, I did not like any of them. \u00a0I felt that the pictures we took ourselves were better. \u00a0I was not impressed and for my wedding, we are hiring La Luna photography. \u00a0I like the photojournalistic approach though, and she did not seem to do that. \u00a0It may just be my personal preference.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Vanessa56<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border: 0px solid;\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Has anyone considered using the hotel photographer, or have any information on the hotel photographer?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"llkrik10@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"24.146.185.112","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1307928428,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241054.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Llkrik1010","Id":241054,"Name":"Llkrik1010","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50cceafcb15e37b197ac37cd86db7a3b","RawContent":"Hey Vanessa56, \n \n I am using the hotel photographer since I am getting the Divine Package and it comes with it.  My sister is a photographer and she will be attending my wedding there so she will be doing candid shots throughout the week and during the reception.  I will mainly use the hotel photographer for the ceremony.  I have seen some of their pics and I thought they were nice.  I guess it depends on your budget and what you expect out of the quanity of photos taken.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Vanessa56[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Has anyone considered using the hotel photographer, or have any information on the hotel photographer?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1518282,"PostDate":1315777512,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Vanessa56,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I am using the hotel photographer since I am getting the Divine Package and it comes with it.\u00a0 My sister is a photographer and she will be attending my wedding there so she will be doing candid shots throughout the week\u00a0and during the reception.\u00a0 I will mainly use the hotel photographer for the ceremony.\u00a0 I have seen some of their pics and I thought they were nice.\u00a0 I guess it depends on your budget and what you expect out of the quanity of photos taken.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Vanessa56<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" style=\"border-bottom: 0px solid; border-left: 0px solid; border-top: 0px solid; border-right: 0px solid\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Has anyone considered using the hotel photographer, or have any information on the hotel photographer?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3a60bba7cd7a0b5c065c99bf21774671","RawContent":"Ladies, Thanks so much for the feedback. We&#039;re trying to do the wedding on a tight budget, so the feedback is very helpful. We are also going with the Divine package, so we were considering using the hotel photographer to save some money. I guess we&#039;ll have to wait to see how many people are coming or work a photographer into the budget otherwise. I have also heard good things about La Luna photographers from some of the other ladies on the board.","Attachments":[],"Id":1518365,"PostDate":1315790580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Ladies, Thanks so much for the feedback. We're trying to do the wedding on a tight budget, so the feedback is very helpful. We are also going with the Divine package, so we were considering using the hotel photographer to save some money. I guess we'll have to wait to see how many people are coming or work a photographer into the budget otherwise. I have also heard good things about La Luna photographers from some of the other ladies on the board.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eb366e8ace553e71da75b231cc6c6020","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; we leave in 7 weeks!! so much to do, ours is Nov 4th.We leave on Oct 30th (jet blue rescheduled our flight for one day earlier, I shoudl call them its costing us another night at the hotel,,, in paradise but still its expensive!)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1518535,"PostDate":1315840218,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> we leave in 7 weeks!! so much to do, ours is Nov 4th.We leave on Oct 30th (jet blue rescheduled our flight for one day earlier, I shoudl call them its costing us another night at the hotel,,, in paradise but still its expensive!)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"magirl21@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.184.150.231","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276800205,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229273.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"magirl","Id":229273,"Name":"magirl","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9965467e6eb20edfb9b13f772a49cd89","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; How exciting! We will be there about a month after you.&amp;nbsp; Lucky you, an extra day! Too bad it will cost you...&amp;nbsp; are you planning on using the resorts photographers?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1518748,"PostDate":1315865032,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> How exciting! We will be there about a month after you.\u00a0 Lucky you, an extra day! Too bad it will cost you...\u00a0 are you planning on using the resorts photographers?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tayleaha@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315421025,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245009.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"almostmarried","Id":245009,"Name":"almostmarried","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1207083698c9ede872321769a41560b5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; yes b\/c it is included in our package but only 20 pics i think,., so we hired La Luna and are doing TTD with del sol!!!!!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m soooooo excited about the pics!!! that was my splurge!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1519067,"PostDate":1315926979,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> yes b\/c it is included in our package but only 20 pics i think,., so we hired La Luna and are doing TTD with del sol!!!!!\u00a0 I'm soooooo excited about the pics!!! that was my splurge!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"magirl21@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"71.184.150.231","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1276800205,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-229273.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"magirl","Id":229273,"Name":"magirl","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":50,"NextPage":60,"PreviousPage":40,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
