> Time: 1430178426 / Mon, 27 Apr 2015 23:47:06 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=62152&start=120&SessionId=94adac9f9af17367ad152e1a28e94cc2
> User erobin223 (278147)
Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28d13f2b783384afbec8365ae7331ac3","RawContent":"Hi Amy, \n Thanks, yes having a great time!! Not sure if they were supposed to, but they upgraded us to a Preferred oceanfront room -- very sweet!! The resort is really nice, and so far, we haven&#039;t had bad food at all. But this is my first all-inclusive so maybe I just have nothing to compare it to. \n \n As for &#039;substitutions&#039;, I didn&#039;t ask for any specific ones, other than using the resort photog at our welcome dinner tonight instead of at the wedding, since I have hired an outside one. They were more than fine with that, so I think if you can keep it along the same lines they may go for that (like no hair\/make-up maybe a facial or something spa-related, etc). \n \n I will say they seem more relaxed and lenient once you get here and go over your planning form in your meeting. If you can have that filled out very well, with picture samples pasted in the document, that will make things go smoothly. There are some things that I had thought were more expensive than what they ended up charging me, and Ramon did some work-arounds to save me some money -- in all we are $1000 under my estimate, although that doesn&#039;t include extending the reception by an hour (~$350-400). We decided to leave that off for now, and see how the party is going - if we can move to the lobby or night club, or go ahead and decide to extend at the time.\n   \n Hope that helps!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AmyG[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n 82turtles that&#039;s Awesome!  I hope you are having a great time!!!    [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif[\/img] \n My main question is are they allowing any &#039;substitutuions&#039; in the packages if you don&#039;t need a specific item....like hair, minister\/officiant, etc. \n \n Other than that I figured when I have a question I will email Anel.  Thanks!!! \n \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1545005,"PostDate":1320938091,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Amy,<\/p> <p> Thanks, yes having a great time!! Not sure if they were supposed to, but they upgraded us to a Preferred oceanfront room -- very sweet!! The resort is really nice, and so far, we haven't had bad food at all. But this is my first all-inclusive so maybe I just have nothing to compare it to.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As for 'substitutions', I didn't ask for any specific ones, other than using the resort photog at our welcome dinner tonight instead of at the wedding, since I have hired an outside one. They were more than fine with that, so I think if you can keep it along the same lines they may go for that (like no hair\/make-up maybe a facial or something spa-related, etc).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I will say they seem more relaxed and lenient once you get here and go over your planning form in your meeting. If you can have that filled out very well, with picture samples pasted in the document, that will make things go smoothly. There are some things that I had thought were more expensive than what they ended up charging me, and Ramon did some work-arounds to save me some money -- in all we are $1000 under my estimate, although that doesn't include extending the reception by an hour (~$350-400). We decided to leave that off for now, and see how the party is going - if we can move to the lobby or night club, or go ahead and decide to extend at the time.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope that helps!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AmyG<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> 82turtles that's Awesome!\u00a0 I hope you are having a great time!!!\u00a0\u00a0\u00a0 <span alt=\":cheers:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"18\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_8_1320888726367_151\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cheers.gif\" width=\"24\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> My main question is are they allowing any 'substitutuions' in the packages if you don't need a specific item....like hair, minister\/officiant, etc.<\/p> <p> <br \/> Other than that I figured when I have a question I will email Anel.\u00a0 Thanks!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahspencer15@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1281413134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231199.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"82turtles","Id":231199,"Name":"82turtles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4f679e07d808f69a99d7e751906339f","RawContent":"Thanks, we are having a great time! Getting really excited for the wedding!! Most of our family\/friends arrive today, so ready for the real fun to begin! \n \n Ah, nice, glad we missed out on the snow! Hopefully it&#039;s melted by the time we get back *fingers crossed*. Or maybe we should just stay here! [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cool.gif[\/img] \n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ps31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n 82turtles, I was just thinking about you this week!!  So excited for you that it&#039;s almost your day!!  I hope you are having a wonderful time. (you missed out on some snow here today;)) \n \n I can&#039;t wait to hear about your wedding and stay.  I&#039;m sure I&#039;ll have some questions for you when you get back;) \n \n Enjoy and Congrats! \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1545007,"PostDate":1320938461,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks, we are having a great time! Getting really excited for the wedding!! Most of our family\/friends arrive today, so ready for the real fun to begin!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ah, nice, glad we missed out on the snow! Hopefully it's melted by the time we get back *fingers crossed*. Or maybe we should just stay here! <span alt=\"8)\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_22_1320934521831_10\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cool.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_8_1320934521831_156\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cool.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ps31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> 82turtles, I was just thinking about you this week!!\u00a0 So excited for you that it's almost your day!!\u00a0 I hope you are having a wonderful time. (you missed out on some snow here today;))<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I can't wait to hear about your wedding and stay.\u00a0 I'm sure I'll have some questions for you when you get back;)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Enjoy and Congrats!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahspencer15@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1281413134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231199.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"82turtles","Id":231199,"Name":"82turtles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c00e1c51d26f133d311016eb9340ecfe","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; @82turtles Thanks for all the information and tips!&amp;nbsp; I hope you have a wonderful time, and congratulations!!&amp;nbsp; I can&#039;t wait to hear about it when you return!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1545053,"PostDate":1320945605,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> @82turtles Thanks for all the information and tips!\u00a0 I hope you have a wonderful time, and congratulations!!\u00a0 I can't wait to hear about it when you return!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lianeetodd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305064173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239838.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lianee","Id":239838,"Name":"lianee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b3b35bcad3709d4ef8a8e0a4010d9c1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; 82turtles, when we were there for our friends wedding we moved to Eclipse and it was a BLAST!&amp;nbsp; Just make sure they are going to open (even though the sign says they will be open) they weren&#039;t going to until we invaded the place!&amp;nbsp; We had a great time!!&amp;nbsp; Congrats and good luck.&amp;nbsp; The wedding we went to was gorgeous!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1545105,"PostDate":1320953268,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> 82turtles, when we were there for our friends wedding we moved to Eclipse and it was a BLAST!\u00a0 Just make sure they are going to open (even though the sign says they will be open) they weren't going to until we invaded the place!\u00a0 We had a great time!!\u00a0 Congrats and good luck.\u00a0 The wedding we went to was gorgeous!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"nicks3@cox.net","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1316812063,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245741.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"hansen6","Id":245741,"Name":"hansen6","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3dd07eb436eb5962a848c1969c47de95","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; 82turtles, That sounds great, thanks for the advice!&amp;nbsp; That is great that they upgraded you to preferred, such a special unexpected treat for you!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; That is so exciting that your guests are arriving and you are almost to your day.&amp;nbsp; ENJOY YOURSELF!!!!......and take a lot of photos!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m sure we all can&#039;t wait to get your review when you return!   &lt;span alt=\":woot:\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_22_1320951203562_9\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"27\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_8_1320951203562_176\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" width=\"42\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Amy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1545119,"PostDate":1320954968,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> 82turtles, That sounds great, thanks for the advice!\u00a0 That is great that they upgraded you to preferred, such a special unexpected treat for you!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> That is so exciting that your guests are arriving and you are almost to your day.\u00a0 ENJOY YOURSELF!!!!......and take a lot of photos!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm sure we all can't wait to get your review when you return!\u00a0\u00a0 <span alt=\":woot:\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_22_1320951203562_9\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"27\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_8_1320951203562_176\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/woot.gif\" width=\"42\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -Amy<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"05735bbdabd935e4c17f3cc0ee2e860a","RawContent":"82turtles, Congratulations! Enjoy your special day!","Attachments":[],"Id":1545690,"PostDate":1321067641,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                82turtles, Congratulations! Enjoy your special day!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3842eccaf09ce2aa30964da4ef854dc9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi fellow brides!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m getting in married at Now Jade&amp;nbsp;resort April 6th, but I&#039;m hoping to find another bride getting married April 4th, 7th, or 8th who still needs a photographer.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m planning on bringing Sara Gray but she&amp;nbsp;said that if I can find another wedding for her to shoot while she&#039;s in Mexico then she&#039;ll give us both a great deal.&amp;nbsp; PM me if you want more details!&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.saragrayphotography.com\/\"&gt;http:\/\/www.saragrayphotography.com\/&lt;\/a&gt;&amp;nbsp;She&#039;s been featured on some of my favorite blogs...style me pretty, wedding chicks, grey likes weddings, etc&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1546535,"PostDate":1321315672,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi fellow brides!\u00a0 I'm getting in married at Now Jade\u00a0resort April 6th, but I'm hoping to find another bride getting married April 4th, 7th, or 8th who still needs a photographer.\u00a0 I'm planning on bringing Sara Gray but she\u00a0said that if I can find another wedding for her to shoot while she's in Mexico then she'll give us both a great deal.\u00a0 PM me if you want more details!\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.saragrayphotography.com\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.saragrayphotography.com\/<\/a>\u00a0She's been featured on some of my favorite blogs...style me pretty, wedding chicks, grey likes weddings, etc<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ktseitz@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1312652444,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-243312.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kthun","Id":243312,"Name":"kthun","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a6883c71fdefe6ef9bd9f7edaa6ee8ea","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Has anyone had a problem with the original \"booking date\" of your wedding?&amp;nbsp; I am currently having some issues with the resort.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I filled out my paperwork and was promised a month and a half ago that my wedding was set for May 25th, 2012... Beach Ceremony and Tequilla Terrace for the reception at 4:00.&amp;nbsp; NOW... I am told that there is another wedding party on the Tequilla Terrace so I have to move my reception to the Beach Terrace.&amp;nbsp; I am not sure where the other bride is having her ceremony, but I know it is an hour after mine.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Isn&#039;t their \"rule\" you will never see another bride on your wedding day?&amp;nbsp; I am really confused and upset by all of this.&amp;nbsp; Wondering if anyone else has had any issues like this, or if it is just me. &lt;span alt=\":&#039;(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif\"&gt;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_4_1_8_1321481403847_161\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Does anyone know how far apart the Tequilla Terrace is from the Beach Terrace?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span alt=\":&#039;(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif\"&gt;Suggestions?!?!?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Heather&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1547454,"PostDate":1321485375,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Has anyone had a problem with the original \"booking date\" of your wedding?\u00a0 I am currently having some issues with the resort.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I filled out my paperwork and was promised a month and a half ago that my wedding was set for May 25th, 2012... Beach Ceremony and Tequilla Terrace for the reception at 4:00.\u00a0 NOW... I am told that there is another wedding party on the Tequilla Terrace so I have to move my reception to the Beach Terrace.\u00a0 I am not sure where the other bride is having her ceremony, but I know it is an hour after mine.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Isn't their \"rule\" you will never see another bride on your wedding day?\u00a0 I am really confused and upset by all of this.\u00a0 Wondering if anyone else has had any issues like this, or if it is just me. <span alt=\":'(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_8_1321481403847_161\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Does anyone know how far apart the Tequilla Terrace is from the Beach Terrace?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span alt=\":'(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif\">Suggestions?!?!?<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Heather<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hwessley@new.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317002945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245861.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HeatherViolet","Id":245861,"Name":"HeatherViolet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c87dfd2c63de1c31cb47ca821d6d2863","RawContent":"Hi HeatherViolet, \n \n   \n I booked my wedding back in February and when the new coordinators took over recently I confirmed my date\/time\/location with them to make sure...She did confirm it so I was okay, but I did hear from others that their booking date got screwed up. \n I was told they can have up to two weddings per day maximum, but the actual ceremonies would never be at the exact same time...perhaps an hour apart..  I was warned that it&#039;s possible I may see only one other bride.  Since other resorts tend to have a reputation of being a &#039;wedding factory&#039;, I was okay with this.  There are two beach ceremony locations based on where your reception location is.  If your reception is on the Tequila Terrace then your beach ceremony would be on the beach in front of the deck steps.  If your ceremony is on the Beach Terrace then your beach ceremony would be on the beach by the beach entrance closer to the pool.  \n I actually booked the Beach Terrace, it is located on the concrete area closer to the pool but right in front of the beach entrance.  From what I hear from other girls on here, it is far enough away from the Tequila Terrace so when two receptions are going on at the same time you won&#039;t even notice. \n \n Unfortunately I don&#039;t have any suggestions for you, I do feel bad that you have to have this stress in planning.  Are you going to stick with your planned date still?  I only hope that I don&#039;t have any &#039;curve balls&#039; such as this thrown at me as my date gets closer.  :-\/ \n \n -Amy \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]HeatherViolet[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Has anyone had a problem with the original \"booking date\" of your wedding?  I am currently having some issues with the resort. \n \n I filled out my paperwork and was promised a month and a half ago that my wedding was set for May 25th, 2012... Beach Ceremony and Tequilla Terrace for the reception at 4:00.  NOW... I am told that there is another wedding party on the Tequilla Terrace so I have to move my reception to the Beach Terrace.  I am not sure where the other bride is having her ceremony, but I know it is an hour after mine. \n \n Isn&#039;t their \"rule\" you will never see another bride on your wedding day?  I am really confused and upset by all of this.  Wondering if anyone else has had any issues like this, or if it is just me. [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif[\/img] \n \n Does anyone know how far apart the Tequilla Terrace is from the Beach Terrace? \n \n Suggestions?!?!? \n \n Heather[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1547597,"PostDate":1321507814,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi HeatherViolet,<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I booked my wedding back in February and when the new coordinators took over recently I confirmed my date\/time\/location with them to make sure...She did confirm it so I was okay, but I did hear from others that their booking date got screwed up.<\/p> <p> I was told they can have up to two weddings per day maximum, but the actual ceremonies would never be at the exact same time...perhaps an hour apart..\u00a0 I was warned that it's possible I may see only one other bride.\u00a0 Since other resorts tend to have a reputation of being a 'wedding factory', I was okay with this.\u00a0 There are two beach ceremony locations based on where your reception location is.\u00a0 If your reception is\u00a0on the Tequila Terrace then your beach\u00a0ceremony would be on the beach in front of the deck steps.\u00a0 If your ceremony is on the Beach Terrace then your beach ceremony would be on the beach by the beach entrance closer to the pool.\u00a0<\/p> <p> I actually booked the Beach Terrace, it is located on the concrete area closer to the pool but right in front of the beach entrance.\u00a0 From what I hear from other girls on here, it is far enough away from the Tequila Terrace so when two receptions are going on at the same time you won't even notice.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Unfortunately I don't have any suggestions for you, I do feel bad that you have to have this stress in planning.\u00a0 Are you going to stick with your planned date still?\u00a0 I only hope that I don't have any 'curve balls' such as this thrown at me as my date gets closer.\u00a0 :-\/<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -Amy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>HeatherViolet<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Has anyone had a problem with the original \"booking date\" of your wedding?\u00a0 I am currently having some issues with the resort.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I filled out my paperwork and was promised a month and a half ago that my wedding was set for May 25th, 2012... Beach Ceremony and Tequilla Terrace for the reception at 4:00.\u00a0 NOW... I am told that there is another wedding party on the Tequilla Terrace so I have to move my reception to the Beach Terrace.\u00a0 I am not sure where the other bride is having her ceremony, but I know it is an hour after mine.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Isn't their \"rule\" you will never see another bride on your wedding day?\u00a0 I am really confused and upset by all of this.\u00a0 Wondering if anyone else has had any issues like this, or if it is just me. <span alt=\":'(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_8_1321481403847_161\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Does anyone know how far apart the Tequilla Terrace is from the Beach Terrace?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span alt=\":'(\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/cry.gif\">Suggestions?!?!?<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Heather<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9904b82d56b617882de1e5a8239f49e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I am new to posting, but I thought I could share some insight. I just recently was at NOW Sapphire for vacation and as a possible wedding site. &amp;nbsp;There were many weddings going on while I was there. &amp;nbsp;The tequila terrace and the beach terrace are not far from each other. &amp;nbsp;Just separated by a walkway and the outside restaurant. &amp;nbsp;I witnessed two weddings around the same time both at those spots. &amp;nbsp;I do not think the brides could see each other because the beach terrace is farther back than the beach. &amp;nbsp;One thing you might want to consider about tequila terrace is that it is surrounded by three restaurants which will be open during your reception. &amp;nbsp;We actually sat 20ft from a reception one night outside. &amp;nbsp;The other restaurants our inside, but have lots of windows. The weddings were both beautiful that day, but were going on at the same time. &amp;nbsp;One reception on the beach and one on the terrace. &amp;nbsp;They both had DJ&#039;s, but the sound did not interfere (I think because of the wind). &amp;nbsp;Let me know if you have anymore questions. &amp;nbsp;I will post some pictures soon. &amp;nbsp;I took a lot of the different sites and weddings.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1547787,"PostDate":1321559656,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I am new to posting, but I thought I could share some insight. I just recently was at NOW Sapphire for vacation and as a possible wedding site. \u00a0There were many weddings going on while I was there. \u00a0The tequila terrace and the beach terrace are not far from each other. \u00a0Just separated by a walkway and the outside restaurant. \u00a0I witnessed two weddings around the same time both at those spots. \u00a0I do not think the brides could see each other because the beach terrace is farther back than the beach. \u00a0One thing you might want to consider about tequila terrace is that it is surrounded by three restaurants which will be open during your reception. \u00a0We actually sat 20ft from a reception one night outside. \u00a0The other restaurants our inside, but have lots of windows. The weddings were both beautiful that day, but were going on at the same time. \u00a0One reception on the beach and one on the terrace. \u00a0They both had DJ's, but the sound did not interfere (I think because of the wind). \u00a0Let me know if you have anymore questions. \u00a0I will post some pictures soon. \u00a0I took a lot of the different sites and weddings.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"molly.clodius@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1309908601,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241990.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":122,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Molly57","Id":241990,"Name":"Molly57","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":120,"NextPage":130,"PreviousPage":110,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
