{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5b6dafbffa23985e7a1720d39a70f61d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Has anyone inquired about day passes for wedding guests?&amp;nbsp; I know it states on their website if someone is not a guest at the resort they have to pay to get into the resort.&amp;nbsp; Does this apply to wedding guests that we have to pay for their meals\/drinks\/etc anyway?   I just have two guests staying off site.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1552285,"PostDate":1322697220,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Has anyone inquired about day passes for wedding guests?\u00a0 I know it states on their website if someone is not a guest at the resort they have to pay to get into the resort.\u00a0 Does this apply to wedding guests that we have to pay for their meals\/drinks\/etc anyway?\u00a0\u00a0 I just have two guests staying off site.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashirkey@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300687841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237999.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ps31","Id":237999,"Name":"ps31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bcf40bc36b8d712ddf34c01a59ac4f02","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Just had my wedding on the 2nd. I loved everything about it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1554706,"PostDate":1323285292,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just had my wedding on the 2nd. I loved everything about it!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tayleaha@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315421025,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245009.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"almostmarried","Id":245009,"Name":"almostmarried","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"714487d1fbadc4895e7a17091deafcbe","RawContent":"Congratulations!  Tell us everything!! \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]almostmarried[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Just had my wedding on the 2nd. I loved everything about it![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1554737,"PostDate":1323287968,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Congratulations! \u00a0Tell us everything!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>almostmarried<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Just had my wedding on the 2nd. I loved everything about it!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lianeetodd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305064173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239838.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lianee","Id":239838,"Name":"lianee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"64c4f624229abf9879f78a2585699c38","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It was more then I ever thought it was going to be. We went the the eternity package because we didnt really think we needed the extras included in the devine. ( we are also doing a reception back home) I worried that it wouldnt be enough but it was great. The food was the best I had the whole trip ( which I didn&#039;t have one bad meal). The servers were so attentive. We had our reception on the beach terrace and the wedding was on the beach right in front of it( which is right by the pool). We had a lot of on-lookers during the ceremony but didn&#039;t really notice after awhile. I guess thats to be expected, but we were left alone during the reception as it got too chilly and dark for people to be at the pool.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ramon was so sweet and helpful. He did a great job.&amp;nbsp; If there are any questions about the resort photographer and how good they are.. here is my slide show&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;h6 class=\"uiStreamMessage\" data-ft=\"{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:1}\"&gt; &lt;span class=\"messageBody\" data-ft=\"{&amp;quot;type&amp;quot;:3}\"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/\"&gt;&lt;span&gt;http:\/\/&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;wbr \/&gt;&lt;span&gt;112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphir&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;wbr \/&gt;e.adventurephotos.com.mx\/&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/h6&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1554782,"PostDate":1323295501,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It was more then I ever thought it was going to be. We went the the eternity package because we didnt really think we needed the extras included in the devine. ( we are also doing a reception back home) I worried that it wouldnt be enough but it was great. The food was the best I had the whole trip ( which I didn't have one bad meal). The servers were so attentive. We had our reception on the beach terrace and the wedding was on the beach right in front of it( which is right by the pool). We had a lot of on-lookers during the ceremony but didn't really notice after awhile. I guess thats to be expected, but we were left alone during the reception as it got too chilly and dark for people to be at the pool.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ramon was so sweet and helpful. He did a great job.\u00a0 If there are any questions about the resort photographer and how good they are.. here is my slide show<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <h6 class=\"uiStreamMessage\" data-ft=\"{\"type\":1}\"> <span class=\"messageBody\" data-ft=\"{\"type\":3}\"><a href='http:\/\/112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>http:\/\/<\/span><wbr \/><span>112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphir<\/span><wbr \/>e.adventurephotos.com.mx\/<\/a><\/span><\/h6>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tayleaha@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315421025,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245009.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"almostmarried","Id":245009,"Name":"almostmarried","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1d4f7534f9cbc34f55cbdb815e2e2ef0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congratulations! Everything looks beautiful! Did you use a DJ for your reception? and did you have your hair and makeup done at the spa? My wedding is in 2 months and those are the things I keep going back and forth on.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1554818,"PostDate":1323299523,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congratulations! Everything looks beautiful! Did you use a DJ for your reception? and did you have your hair and makeup done at the spa? My wedding is in 2 months and those are the things I keep going back and forth on.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kaitlinjackwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297294558,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236603.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kmm8984","Id":236603,"Name":"kmm8984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"53af01be7bdb6f7a26b4916015fe9d0a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; We did not use a dj. We arent big dancers so we just hooked our ipod up to the sound system&amp;nbsp; for background music. The spa did do my hair and make-up. I took a picture of what i wanted and it turned out fairly close. I was pretty happy with it all.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1554829,"PostDate":1323301831,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We did not use a dj. We arent big dancers so we just hooked our ipod up to the sound system\u00a0 for background music. The spa did do my hair and make-up. I took a picture of what i wanted and it turned out fairly close. I was pretty happy with it all.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tayleaha@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1315421025,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245009.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"almostmarried","Id":245009,"Name":"almostmarried","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9a58f0f55b07bf28db43059a15ad1b3d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Did you have to pay to use the sound systeme ?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1554835,"PostDate":1323302611,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Did you have to pay to use the sound systeme ?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pharandm@persona.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323302087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248431.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeunesse","Id":248431,"Name":"jeunesse","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"50a2c00b02e862ac4b5e3eed3b9e9484","RawContent":"Did you have to pay to use the sound system ?  Would is be loud enough to dance ? [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]almostmarried[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We did not use a dj. We arent big dancers so we just hooked our ipod up to the sound system  for background music. The spa did do my hair and make-up. I took a picture of what i wanted and it turned out fairly close. I was pretty happy with it all.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1554836,"PostDate":1323302823,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> <br \/> Did you have to pay to use the sound system ?\u00a0 Would is be loud enough to dance ?<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>almostmarried<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We did not use a dj. We arent big dancers so we just hooked our ipod up to the sound system\u00a0 for background music. The spa did do my hair and make-up. I took a picture of what i wanted and it turned out fairly close. I was pretty happy with it all.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"pharandm@persona.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1323302087,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-248431.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jeunesse","Id":248431,"Name":"jeunesse","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e35ba8feae7dff64e7cece001753f433","RawContent":"Hi almostmarried, \n \n   \n CONGRATULATIONS!!!!   Your pictures are beautiful!!  I am also using the resort photographer so this puts my mind at ease.  What exactly did you get in the eternity package fo photos\/photographer?  Did you have to pay more for more photos, time or slideshow? \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]almostmarried[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n We did not use a dj. We arent big dancers so we just hooked our ipod up to the sound system  for background music. The spa did do my hair and make-up. I took a picture of what i wanted and it turned out fairly close. I was pretty happy with it all.[\/quote] \n \n \n \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]almostmarried[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n It was more then I ever thought it was going to be. We went the the eternity package because we didnt really think we needed the extras included in the devine. ( we are also doing a reception back home) I worried that it wouldnt be enough but it was great. The food was the best I had the whole trip ( which I didn&#039;t have one bad meal). The servers were so attentive. We had our reception on the beach terrace and the wedding was on the beach right in front of it( which is right by the pool). We had a lot of on-lookers during the ceremony but didn&#039;t really notice after awhile. I guess thats to be expected, but we were left alone during the reception as it got too chilly and dark for people to be at the pool. \n \n Ramon was so sweet and helpful. He did a great job.  If there are any questions about the resort photographer and how good they are.. here is my slide show \n \n[b] [url=\"http:\/\/112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/\"]http:\/\/112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/[\/url][\/b]\n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1554912,"PostDate":1323316584,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi almostmarried,<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> CONGRATULATIONS!!!!\u00a0\u00a0 Your pictures are beautiful!!\u00a0 I am also using the resort photographer so this puts my mind at ease.\u00a0 What exactly did you get in the eternity package fo photos\/photographer?\u00a0 Did you have to pay more for more photos, time or slideshow?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>almostmarried<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> We did not use a dj. We arent big dancers so we just hooked our ipod up to the sound system\u00a0 for background music. The spa did do my hair and make-up. I took a picture of what i wanted and it turned out fairly close. I was pretty happy with it all.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>almostmarried<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> It was more then I ever thought it was going to be. We went the the eternity package because we didnt really think we needed the extras included in the devine. ( we are also doing a reception back home) I worried that it wouldnt be enough but it was great. The food was the best I had the whole trip ( which I didn't have one bad meal). The servers were so attentive. We had our reception on the beach terrace and the wedding was on the beach right in front of it( which is right by the pool). We had a lot of on-lookers during the ceremony but didn't really notice after awhile. I guess thats to be expected, but we were left alone during the reception as it got too chilly and dark for people to be at the pool.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ramon was so sweet and helpful. He did a great job.\u00a0 If there are any questions about the resort photographer and how good they are.. here is my slide show<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <h6 class=\"uiStreamMessage\" data-ft=\"{\"type\":1}\"> <span class=\"messageBody\" data-ft=\"{\"type\":3}\"><a href='http:\/\/112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>http:\/\/<\/span><wbr \/><span>112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphir<\/span><wbr \/>e.adventurephotos.com.mx\/<\/a><\/span><\/h6> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0ab838d4b4387b61b5f08cd721bb26a4","RawContent":"Gorgeous pictures!  This definitely puts my mind at ease about using the resort photographer.  So thank you for that! \n Also, I LOVE your flowers.  Are they purple roses with cala lilies?  Or are the purple ones something else?\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]almostmarried[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n It was more then I ever thought it was going to be. We went the the eternity package because we didnt really think we needed the extras included in the devine. ( we are also doing a reception back home) I worried that it wouldnt be enough but it was great. The food was the best I had the whole trip ( which I didn&#039;t have one bad meal). The servers were so attentive. We had our reception on the beach terrace and the wedding was on the beach right in front of it( which is right by the pool). We had a lot of on-lookers during the ceremony but didn&#039;t really notice after awhile. I guess thats to be expected, but we were left alone during the reception as it got too chilly and dark for people to be at the pool. \n \n Ramon was so sweet and helpful. He did a great job.  If there are any questions about the resort photographer and how good they are.. here is my slide show \n \n[b] [url=\"http:\/\/112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/\"]http:\/\/112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/[\/url][\/b]\n[\/quote]","Attachments":[{"Id":6000,"Name":"7bdc8dee2a9111e1abb01231381b65e3_7.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2011\/post-27758-13823787413.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_12_2011\/post-27758-13823787413_thumb.jpg","Width":612,"Height":612}],"Id":1555125,"PostDate":1323373420,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Gorgeous pictures! \u00a0This definitely puts my mind at ease about using the resort photographer. \u00a0So thank you for that!<\/p> <p> Also, I LOVE your flowers. \u00a0Are they purple roses with cala lilies? \u00a0Or are the purple ones something else?<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>almostmarried<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> It was more then I ever thought it was going to be. We went the the eternity package because we didnt really think we needed the extras included in the devine. ( we are also doing a reception back home) I worried that it wouldnt be enough but it was great. The food was the best I had the whole trip ( which I didn't have one bad meal). The servers were so attentive. We had our reception on the beach terrace and the wedding was on the beach right in front of it( which is right by the pool). We had a lot of on-lookers during the ceremony but didn't really notice after awhile. I guess thats to be expected, but we were left alone during the reception as it got too chilly and dark for people to be at the pool.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ramon was so sweet and helpful. He did a great job.\u00a0 If there are any questions about the resort photographer and how good they are.. here is my slide show<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <h6 class=\"uiStreamMessage\" data-ft=\"{\"type\":1}\"> <span class=\"messageBody\" data-ft=\"{\"type\":3}\"><a href='http:\/\/112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span>http:\/\/<\/span><wbr \/><span>112011corytayshawedd.nowsapphir<\/span><wbr \/>e.adventurephotos.com.mx\/<\/a><\/span><\/h6> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lianeetodd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305064173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239838.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lianee","Id":239838,"Name":"lianee","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":150,"NextPage":160,"PreviousPage":140,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
