{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a579275965c9ebb1ccee7480078a8f1d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; Hey Ladies,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; We are putting together our webinar schedule for BDW. &amp;nbsp;These webinars are great because not only can you get YOUR questions answered but also hear answers to questions from other brides that you may not have even though of :)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; Webinars are a great way to not only hear directly from the wedding department but see the wedding packages that they offer, ceremony\/reception pics, etc.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; I try to only limit the webinars to once every 2 weeks so we of course can not do all resorts.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; Please vote on which resorts you would like to have webinars on...you can choose more than 1.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24); font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; text-align: -webkit-auto; background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250); \"&gt; &lt;strong style=\"font-style: inherit; \"&gt;&lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/77383\/what-resort-webinars-would-you-like-to-see-on-bdw\"&gt;Vote for your Resort Webinar HERE&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1564269,"PostDate":1325799634,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> Hey Ladies,<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> We are putting together our webinar schedule for BDW. \u00a0These webinars are great because not only can you get YOUR questions answered but also hear answers to questions from other brides that you may not have even though of <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> Webinars are a great way to not only hear directly from the wedding department but see the wedding packages that they offer, ceremony\/reception pics, etc.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> I try to only limit the webinars to once every 2 weeks so we of course can not do all resorts.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> Please vote on which resorts you would like to have webinars on...you can choose more than 1.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(24, 24, 24);font-family: arial, helvetica, sans-serif;text-align: -webkit-auto;background-color: rgb(253, 252, 250)\"> <strong style=\"font-style: inherit; \"><a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/77383\/what-resort-webinars-would-you-like-to-see-on-bdw' class='bbc_url' title=''>Vote for your Resort Webinar HERE<\/a><\/strong><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137227820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac3537e64604cb1ac4ebb00e0c9991ac","RawContent":"Hi Vanessa56, \n \n   \n Yes I have had contact with the coordinator at the resort.  I had to change my ceremony time and I had a question about the wedding info document that they sent me.  Anel was very quick to respond to me and she was a great help.   \n How is your planning going?? \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Vanessa56[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Amy - you are sooner than I am, but I am feeling the same way. Have you had any contact with the resort? Other than reserving my date, I have not spoken to them at all. \n \n \n Quote: \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1564361,"PostDate":1325812820,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Vanessa56,<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Yes I have had contact with the coordinator at the resort.\u00a0 I had to change my ceremony time and I had a question about the wedding info document that they sent me.\u00a0 Anel was very quick to respond to me and she was a great help.\u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <p> How is your planning going??<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Vanessa56<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Amy - you are sooner than I am, but I am feeling the same way. Have you had any contact with the resort? Other than reserving my date, I have not spoken to them at all.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ce881bf80d42ed2a209b5f8752fb490d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It sounds like Anel has been pretty easy to work with.&amp;nbsp; I haven&#039;t had any contact with her as of yet.&amp;nbsp; My travel agent has done all of that for me.&amp;nbsp; I am starting a list of questions for Anel though that I will email closer to our wedding date in May.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do they have some decorations for the isle?&amp;nbsp; Are any of you using anything like that, or keeping it simple with what they provide?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1564685,"PostDate":1325881543,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It sounds like Anel has been pretty easy to work with.\u00a0 I haven't had any contact with her as of yet.\u00a0 My travel agent has done all of that for me.\u00a0 I am starting a list of questions for Anel though that I will email closer to our wedding date in May.<\/p> <p> Do they have some decorations for the isle?\u00a0 Are any of you using anything like that, or keeping it simple with what they provide?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hwessley@new.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317002945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245861.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HeatherViolet","Id":245861,"Name":"HeatherViolet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"966b806b1b5b7d9a37d2bc09fa4dc068","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Usually when I email Anel i get together a list of questions and it&#039;ll take her about 2 weeks to get back to me, at first I was frustrated with that but now I just don&#039;t expect a quick answer!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I think they do have stuff for the aisle but i&#039;m going to bring my own stuff down-flower petals, stuff to hang on the aisle seats. it&#039;ll defiitely save money bringing my own stuff&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1564733,"PostDate":1325885111,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Usually when I email Anel i get together a list of questions and it'll take her about 2 weeks to get back to me, at first I was frustrated with that but now I just don't expect a quick answer!<\/p> <p> I think they do have stuff for the aisle but i'm going to bring my own stuff down-flower petals, stuff to hang on the aisle seats. it'll defiitely save money bringing my own stuff<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kaitlinjackwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297294558,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236603.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kmm8984","Id":236603,"Name":"kmm8984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"803234fc693219aad09fbb47ca94b2f9","RawContent":"Anel&#039;s been kind of a hit and miss for me.  She&#039;ll normally replies in a timely manner, but if I answer multiple questions sometimes she only answers one question at a time.  So I&#039;ve had to ask the same question in a couple emails and it eventually gets answered. \n \n I&#039;m trying to keep the stuff I bring down to just one suitcase of wedding items[img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif[\/img]  My fiance keeps telling me we should let them take care of everything, I just like to save money more than him:)\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]kmm8984[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Usually when I email Anel i get together a list of questions and it&#039;ll take her about 2 weeks to get back to me, at first I was frustrated with that but now I just don&#039;t expect a quick answer! \n I think they do have stuff for the aisle but i&#039;m going to bring my own stuff down-flower petals, stuff to hang on the aisle seats. it&#039;ll defiitely save money bringing my own stuff[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1565745,"PostDate":1326099495,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anel's been kind of a hit and miss for me.\u00a0 She'll normally replies in a timely manner, but if I answer multiple questions sometimes she only answers one question at a time.\u00a0 So I've had to ask the same question in a couple emails and it eventually gets answered.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm trying to keep the stuff I bring down to just one suitcase of wedding items<span alt=\":mswink:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"19\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1326094597075_151\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/msnwink.gif\" width=\"19\" \/><\/span><\/span>\u00a0 My fiance keeps telling me we should let them take care of everything, I just like to save money more than him:)<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>kmm8984<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Usually when I email Anel i get together a list of questions and it'll take her about 2 weeks to get back to me, at first I was frustrated with that but now I just don't expect a quick answer!<\/p> <p> I think they do have stuff for the aisle but i'm going to bring my own stuff down-flower petals, stuff to hang on the aisle seats. it'll defiitely save money bringing my own stuff<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashirkey@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300687841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237999.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ps31","Id":237999,"Name":"ps31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9ac5bcc6f8516de8566c5aaf11406d8a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Anel has also been hit and miss for me. &amp;nbsp;I have a few big questions that are outstanding, especially regarding the photographer. &amp;nbsp;Since I leave on Sunday, I&#039;ve decided that I will just wait it out and talk about it once we&#039;re there. &amp;nbsp;My general feeling right now is, \"everything will work out in the end\"&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1565899,"PostDate":1326137252,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Anel has also been hit and miss for me. \u00a0I have a few big questions that are outstanding, especially regarding the photographer. \u00a0Since I leave on Sunday, I've decided that I will just wait it out and talk about it once we're there. \u00a0My general feeling right now is, \"everything will work out in the end\"<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"lianeetodd@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1305064173,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239838.JPG?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":220,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"lianee","Id":239838,"Name":"lianee","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"54e8e5937cc8fddbaac8c47ff12160dd","RawContent":"OH my gosh, your wedding is so close, how exciting!!!!   :-)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]lianee[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Anel has also been hit and miss for me.  I have a few big questions that are outstanding, especially regarding the photographer.  Since I leave on Sunday, I&#039;ve decided that I will just wait it out and talk about it once we&#039;re there.  My general feeling right now is, \"everything will work out in the end\"[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1566089,"PostDate":1326164462,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> OH my gosh, your wedding is so close, how exciting!!!!\u00a0\u00a0 :-)<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>lianee<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Anel has also been hit and miss for me. \u00a0I have a few big questions that are outstanding, especially regarding the photographer. \u00a0Since I leave on Sunday, I've decided that I will just wait it out and talk about it once we're there. \u00a0My general feeling right now is, \"everything will work out in the end\"<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> <br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"58c79692671c98ece5c5d5e0222a07e9","RawContent":"Hi ladies, thanks so much for all the great info! I&#039;m still trying to pick my spot and this thread has helped very much!","Attachments":[],"Id":1568612,"PostDate":1326659081,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Hi ladies, thanks so much for all the great info! I'm still trying to pick my spot and this thread has helped very much!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a.b.sherrod@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325897400,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249481.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mrsrepp","Id":249481,"Name":"mrsrepp","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c1dec29c33007cdff39e3d699fd387e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Does anyone have a copy of the planning form that they could send me? &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Also, what additional costs did you have outside of the package price? &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m curious how much additional people are spending and where. &amp;nbsp;LOL, I&#039;ve never gotten married before but it seems like the packages are pretty all-inclusive. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m assuming though that it&#039;s not so cut and dry. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1569044,"PostDate":1326747024,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Does anyone have a copy of the planning form that they could send me? \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, what additional costs did you have outside of the package price? \u00a0I'm curious how much additional people are spending and where. \u00a0LOL, I've never gotten married before but it seems like the packages are pretty all-inclusive. \u00a0I'm assuming though that it's not so cut and dry. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265688916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3f818a19cc90b25c947cc698ddffa550","RawContent":"Hi Traci7642, \n \n Do you mean the Word document that the wedding palnner sent out? \n \n I have that one. \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Traci7642[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Does anyone have a copy of the planning form that they could send me?   \n \n Also, what additional costs did you have outside of the package price?  I&#039;m curious how much additional people are spending and where.  LOL, I&#039;ve never gotten married before but it seems like the packages are pretty all-inclusive.  I&#039;m assuming though that it&#039;s not so cut and dry.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1569192,"PostDate":1326771819,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Hi Traci7642,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do you mean the Word document that the wedding palnner sent out?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have that one.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Traci7642<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Does anyone have a copy of the planning form that they could send me? \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, what additional costs did you have outside of the package price? \u00a0I'm curious how much additional people are spending and where. \u00a0LOL, I've never gotten married before but it seems like the packages are pretty all-inclusive. \u00a0I'm assuming though that it's not so cut and dry. \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":180,"NextPage":190,"PreviousPage":170,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
