> Time: 1430178445 / Mon, 27 Apr 2015 23:47:25 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=62152&start=190&SessionId=94adac9f9af17367ad152e1a28e94cc2
> User erobin223 (278147)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"eaa5d26ffdde9c325ff5f0e8ec562426","RawContent":"Hi Traci, \n While the resort&#039;s wedding package does include a lot (and in my opinion includes a lot more than a number of other resorts for the price), there are still a lot of items that can have additional costs, but it all depends on what you want and how many people you have. For example: \n - extra people over 25 will cost extra for the chair, dinner, cocktail hour, cake, and toast (roughly comes out to about $95-100 per person after tax and service). \n - decorations: the standard decor is in all white, it will cost extra if you want color chair ties, color linens for dinner, different chairs, table centerpieces, etc \n - flowers: your bouquet and his boutonniere are included, plus an extra bout or corsage dep on the wedding package but if you have a larger wedding party (or want smaller bouqets for your bridesmaids) or want flowers for parents this will cost extra\n - music: iPod system is included for the ceremony or the Divine package includes some ceremony music now I heard, but if you want other special music at the ceremony or music at the cocktail hour or reception, that will be extra (can either rent an iPod system which is what we did, or hire a DJ) \n - length of reception: there are 3 hours included (more or less 1 hr for dinner, 2 hours for dancing or whatever), but if you want it to go longer there is a change of $10 per person per hour plus tax, which can add up quickly if you have a lot of people and want a long reception \n - extras: they can provide you with additional lighting, tikki torches, paper luminaries, lounge furniture, and more, all for a fee of course \n \n Really it all depends on what you&#039;re looking for in your wedding! It can be easy to get carried away and spend much more than the package price. The number of people you have there is probably the biggest factor in additional costs, so be sure to factor that in when planning your budget and guest list!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Traci7642[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Does anyone have a copy of the planning form that they could send me?   \n \n Also, what additional costs did you have outside of the package price?  I&#039;m curious how much additional people are spending and where.  LOL, I&#039;ve never gotten married before but it seems like the packages are pretty all-inclusive.  I&#039;m assuming though that it&#039;s not so cut and dry.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1569878,"PostDate":1326916710,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Traci,<\/p> <p> While the resort's wedding package does include a lot (and in my opinion includes a lot more than a number of other resorts for the price), there are still a lot of items that can have additional costs, but it all depends on what you want and how many people you have. For example:<\/p> <p> - extra people over 25 will cost extra for the chair, dinner, cocktail hour, cake, and toast (roughly comes out to about $95-100 per person after tax and service).<\/p> <p> - decorations: the standard decor is in all white, it will cost extra\u00a0if you want color chair ties, color linens for dinner, different chairs, table centerpieces, etc<\/p> <p> - flowers: your bouquet and his boutonniere are included, plus an extra bout or corsage dep on the wedding package but if you have a larger\u00a0wedding party\u00a0(or want\u00a0smaller bouqets for your bridesmaids)\u00a0or want flowers for parents this will cost extra<br \/> - music: iPod system is included for the ceremony\u00a0or the Divine package includes some ceremony music now I heard, but if you want other special music at the ceremony or music at the cocktail hour or reception, that will be extra (can either rent an iPod system which is what we did, or hire a DJ)<\/p> <p> - length of reception: there are 3 hours included (more or less 1 hr for dinner, 2 hours for dancing or whatever), but if you want it to go longer there is a change of $10 per person per hour plus tax, which can add up quickly if you have a lot of people and want a long reception<\/p> <p> - extras: they can provide you with additional lighting, tikki torches, paper luminaries, lounge furniture, and more, all for a fee of course<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Really it all depends on what you're looking for in your wedding! It can be easy to get carried away and spend much more than the package price. The number of people you have there is probably the biggest factor in additional costs, so be sure to factor that in when planning your budget and guest list!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Traci7642<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Does anyone have a copy of the planning form that they could send me? \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Also, what additional costs did you have outside of the package price? \u00a0I'm curious how much additional people are spending and where. \u00a0LOL, I've never gotten married before but it seems like the packages are pretty all-inclusive. \u00a0I'm assuming though that it's not so cut and dry. \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahspencer15@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1281413134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231199.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"82turtles","Id":231199,"Name":"82turtles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e16dc92389ddf7ec4e6e1f6bd25f5a14","RawContent":"Tracy Some things I&#039;m upgrading is the cocktail furniture which is the white lounge sofas don&#039;t quote me but I wanna say $ 200 for 8 seats I&#039;m upgrading my center pieces to premium $ 250 each 4 total I&#039;m going to have 4 tables also goingnto use them for the aisle for ceremony 2 on each side Extra flowers like boutonniere and corsages for moms and dads depends on what level the price Canopy is 350 for draping with different color linens Doing bows on the back chairs only for ceremony 5$ each my dj is for 5 hours with dj doremixx for 800 plus resort fee 300 cuz outside vendor. Party is only 4 hours total 6-7 cocktail 7-10 party. So we have dj til 11 not getting the extra hr for bar and ect.. For guests don&#039;t seem like paying $ 10-15 more per person for an hour for drinks when you can just dance and go to club after there&#039;s so much you can upgrade but in reality it&#039;s on the beach and the setting alone is perfect","Attachments":[],"Id":1570478,"PostDate":1327012975,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Tracy Some things I'm upgrading is the cocktail furniture which is the white lounge sofas don't quote me but I wanna say $ 200 for 8 seats I'm upgrading my center pieces to premium $ 250 each 4 total I'm going to have 4 tables also goingnto use them for the aisle for ceremony 2 on each side Extra flowers like boutonniere and corsages for moms and dads depends on what level the price Canopy is 350 for draping with different color linens Doing bows on the back chairs only for ceremony 5$ each my dj is for 5 hours with dj doremixx for 800 plus resort fee 300 cuz outside vendor. Party is only 4 hours total 6-7 cocktail 7-10 party. So we have dj til 11 not getting the extra hr for bar and ect.. For guests don't seem like paying $ 10-15 more per person for an hour for drinks when you can just dance and go to club after there's so much you can upgrade but in reality it's on the beach and the setting alone is perfect\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moderncosmo1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304978447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239791.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moderncosmo1","Id":239791,"Name":"Moderncosmo1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7c1849e4f97a1753ddade9d2af8dbb7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Which centerpieces did you decide on?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1570504,"PostDate":1327016513,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Which centerpieces did you decide on?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"johnsoncnicole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1302373856,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238683.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cnicole51911","Id":238683,"Name":"Cnicole51911","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"91e51e83d58c993ff817c77916e51e20","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sorry...&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; ModernCosmo1, which centerpieces did you decide on? Did you choose any extra aisle decorations? Also what did you update the canopy with? I didn&#039;t receive alot of pictures from Ramon.....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1570505,"PostDate":1327016614,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sorry...<\/p> <p> ModernCosmo1, which centerpieces did you decide on? Did you choose any extra aisle decorations? Also what did you update the canopy with? I didn't receive alot of pictures from Ramon.....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"johnsoncnicole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1302373856,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238683.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cnicole51911","Id":238683,"Name":"Cnicole51911","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"0f82a688e8275b50153952ffe48ca5ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for all of the examples ladies. &amp;nbsp;Another question, when you purchase the Eternity or Devine package, is liquor included? &amp;nbsp;Obviously it&#039;s included during the cocktail hour but is it included during the dinner\/two hour reception, or do you have to purchase it a la carte for those hours? &amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t imagine my friends and family only wanting to drink during the 1-hour cocktail lol.   &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1570831,"PostDate":1327086897,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for all of the examples ladies. \u00a0Another question, when you purchase the Eternity or Devine package, is liquor included? \u00a0Obviously it's included during the cocktail hour but is it included during the dinner\/two hour reception, or do you have to purchase it a la carte for those hours? \u00a0I can't imagine my friends and family only wanting to drink during the 1-hour cocktail lol. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265688916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ebeb2c782e86f358de83ac2d4fe1a21c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Yep, alcohol is definitely included!! They brought us shots ALL night long! &lt;span alt=\"::)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1327086001406_151\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\" width=\"16\" \/&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And although the information doesn&#039;t say it, you get a private bar set-up right by your reception&amp;nbsp;if you do the Eternity or Divine package (included in the price), which is convenient for your guests and for the waiters.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Traci7642&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; Thanks for all of the examples ladies. &amp;nbsp;Another question, when you purchase the Eternity or Devine package, is liquor included? &amp;nbsp;Obviously it&#039;s included during the cocktail hour but is it included during the dinner\/two hour reception, or do you have to purchase it a la carte for those hours? &amp;nbsp;I can&#039;t imagine my friends and family only wanting to drink during the 1-hour cocktail lol.   &lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1570882,"PostDate":1327091015,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Yep, alcohol is definitely included!! They brought us shots ALL night long! <span alt=\"::)\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"16\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1327086001406_151\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rolleyes.gif\" width=\"16\" \/><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> And although the information doesn't say it, you get a private bar set-up right by your reception\u00a0if you do the Eternity or Divine package (included in the price), which is convenient for your guests and for the waiters.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>Traci7642<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks for all of the examples ladies. \u00a0Another question, when you purchase the Eternity or Devine package, is liquor included? \u00a0Obviously it's included during the cocktail hour but is it included during the dinner\/two hour reception, or do you have to purchase it a la carte for those hours? \u00a0I can't imagine my friends and family only wanting to drink during the 1-hour cocktail lol. \u00a0\u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sarahspencer15@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1281413134,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-231199.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"82turtles","Id":231199,"Name":"82turtles","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f7e5e6ea8fa7b6982ae867f72bd843a3","RawContent":"Nicole As of now I&#039;m going with premium #2 centerpiece and I think I&#039;m going to put them also on the aisle of ceremony. 2 in front and 2 in back of ceremony aisle and back row of ceremony chairs with sashes not bows If you give me your emaili can email you pics of some canopy draping picture to get ideas.","Attachments":[],"Id":1571045,"PostDate":1327106827,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Nicole As of now I'm going with premium #2 centerpiece and I think I'm going to put them also on the aisle of ceremony. 2 in front and 2 in back of ceremony aisle and back row of ceremony chairs with sashes not bows If you give me your emaili can email you pics of some canopy draping picture to get ideas.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moderncosmo1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304978447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239791.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moderncosmo1","Id":239791,"Name":"Moderncosmo1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e1cdc0ae45b4616f82bb4d2dbb96945","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies! Haven&#039;t been on in awhile, I was not doing much for the wedding until after Christmas when I realized that it was coming up really quick! Now it&#039;s only 8 weeks until we leave - eek!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Is anyone else having a small group? We will only be 21, maybe 22. I am just trying to figure out the reception, and for some reason it is stressing me out. I don&#039;t know if we should have dancing or not. There will be 5 parents, 4 kids, and then 12ish that are in their 30&#039;s and 40&#039;s. Should we just do eating, chatting casual, or traditional eating and dancing? Do we just do an iPod and then if people don&#039;t seem keen on dancing skip past that type of music? Or hire a DJ so they can hype people up? I just want everyone to have a good time. What are you guys doing?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1573375,"PostDate":1327546655,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi ladies! Haven't been on in awhile, I was not doing much for the wedding until after Christmas when I realized that it was coming up really quick! Now it's only 8 weeks until we leave - eek!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Is anyone else having a small group? We will only be 21, maybe 22. I am just trying to figure out the reception, and for some reason it is stressing me out. I don't know if we should have dancing or not. There will be 5 parents, 4 kids, and then 12ish that are in their 30's and 40's. Should we just do eating, chatting casual, or traditional eating and dancing? Do we just do an iPod and then if people don't seem keen on dancing skip past that type of music? Or hire a DJ so they can hype people up? I just want everyone to have a good time. What are you guys doing?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"720224e3c2d6afc12bab06c6448e57b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hola NOW Sapphire brides! You will love this resort... almost as much as I do working it! haha&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; It really is a fantastic location to shoot a wedding. Here is a link to my last wedding there:&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"NOW Sapphire 1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/703299\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"NOW Sapphire 2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/703301\/width\/400\/height\/600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"NOW Sapphire 3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/703303\/width\/400\/height\/600\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img alt=\"NOW Sapphire 4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/703305\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1574197,"PostDate":1327691048,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hola NOW Sapphire brides! You will love this resort... almost as much as I do working it! haha<\/p> <p> It really is a fantastic location to shoot a wedding. Here is a link to my last wedding there:\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"NOW Sapphire 1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/703299\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"NOW Sapphire 2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/703301\/width\/400\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"NOW Sapphire 3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/703303\/width\/400\/height\/600\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"NOW Sapphire 4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/703305\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280214260,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9994e5c8a6a3bfbb0117828ce15bc510","RawContent":"Hi Joda, \n \n My wedding is right before yours (March16) and I am also getting a little stressed out too trying to figure out what I am doing, lol.  I am having approx. 26 people, no kids.  I am going to use the dj that the resort uses because a lot of people in my group love to dance. How are your other plans coming along? \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]joda[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi ladies! Haven&#039;t been on in awhile, I was not doing much for the wedding until after Christmas when I realized that it was coming up really quick! Now it&#039;s only 8 weeks until we leave - eek! \n \n Is anyone else having a small group? We will only be 21, maybe 22. I am just trying to figure out the reception, and for some reason it is stressing me out. I don&#039;t know if we should have dancing or not. There will be 5 parents, 4 kids, and then 12ish that are in their 30&#039;s and 40&#039;s. Should we just do eating, chatting casual, or traditional eating and dancing? Do we just do an iPod and then if people don&#039;t seem keen on dancing skip past that type of music? Or hire a DJ so they can hype people up? I just want everyone to have a good time. What are you guys doing?[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1574674,"PostDate":1327791363,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Hi Joda,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My wedding is right before yours (March16) and I am also getting a little stressed out too trying to figure out what I am doing, lol.\u00a0 I am having approx. 26 people, no kids.\u00a0 I am going to use the dj that the resort uses because a lot of people in my group love to dance.\u00a0How are your other plans coming along?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>joda<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi ladies! Haven't been on in awhile, I was not doing much for the wedding until after Christmas when I realized that it was coming up really quick! Now it's only 8 weeks until we leave - eek!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Is anyone else having a small group? We will only be 21, maybe 22. I am just trying to figure out the reception, and for some reason it is stressing me out. I don't know if we should have dancing or not. There will be 5 parents, 4 kids, and then 12ish that are in their 30's and 40's. Should we just do eating, chatting casual, or traditional eating and dancing? Do we just do an iPod and then if people don't seem keen on dancing skip past that type of music? Or hire a DJ so they can hype people up? I just want everyone to have a good time. What are you guys doing?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":190,"NextPage":200,"PreviousPage":180,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
