{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2653384070c635c32c8fa7986e2ebc56","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Ladies , I wanted to send you a post ...I would be very happy toassist you with any questions you may have or any assistance you may need abut your wedding at Now Sapphire , I used tobe the wedding planner there and now I am on my own &amp;nbsp;, Please feel free to send me any questions you may have &amp;nbsp;, I will happy to assist you.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If you also need a busgeting advice I will be happy to assist you.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Sandy Planner&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1574836,"PostDate":1327822721,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Ladies , I wanted to send you a post ...I would be very happy toassist you with any questions you may have or any assistance you may need abut your wedding at Now Sapphire , I used tobe the wedding planner there and now I am on my own \u00a0, Please feel free to send me any questions you may have \u00a0, I will happy to assist you.<\/p> <p> If you also need a busgeting advice I will be happy to assist you.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sandy Planner<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"14ec9feabca1b58dad84ee8927fdd7c0","RawContent":"[quote name=\"joda\"]\n&lt;p&gt; Hi ladies! Haven&#039;t been on in awhile, I was not doing much for the wedding until after Christmas when I realized that it was coming up really quick! Now it&#039;s only 8 weeks until we leave - eek!&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Is anyone else having a small group? We will only be 21, maybe 22. I am just trying to figure out the reception, and for some reason it is stressing me out. I don&#039;t know if we should have dancing or not. There will be 5 parents, 4 kids, and then 12ish that are in their 30&#039;s and 40&#039;s. Should we just do eating, chatting casual, or traditional eating and dancing? Do we just do an iPod and then if people don&#039;t seem keen on dancing skip past that type of music? Or hire a DJ so they can hype people up? I just want everyone to have a good time. What are you guys doing?&lt;\/p&gt;[\/quote] I am also having a small wedding - probably about 20 people or so. Our guests are all over the spectrum in ages, and not a huge dancing group overall. I am considering a DJ, but I really do like the idea of keeping it more casual. One of the things I&#039;m struggling with is that I feel obligated to give the guests a complete \"wedding experience\". If I decide not todo the DJ, I am considering taking the guests on an excursion.","Attachments":[],"Id":1574913,"PostDate":1327857177,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"joda\" url=\"\/t\/74418\/now&#045;sapphire&#045;weddings&#045;formerly&#045;paradisus&#045;riviera\/190#post_1722943\"><p><p> Hi ladies! Haven't been on in awhile, I was not doing much for the wedding until after Christmas when I realized that it was coming up really quick! Now it's only 8 weeks until we leave - eek!<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> Is anyone else having a small group? We will only be 21, maybe 22. I am just trying to figure out the reception, and for some reason it is stressing me out. I don't know if we should have dancing or not. There will be 5 parents, 4 kids, and then 12ish that are in their 30's and 40's. Should we just do eating, chatting casual, or traditional eating and dancing? Do we just do an iPod and then if people don't seem keen on dancing skip past that type of music? Or hire a DJ so they can hype people up? I just want everyone to have a good time. What are you guys doing?<\/p><\/p><\/blockquote> I am also having a small wedding - probably about 20 people or so. Our guests are all over the spectrum in ages, and not a huge dancing group overall. I am considering a DJ, but I really do like the idea of keeping it more casual. One of the things I'm struggling with is that I feel obligated to give the guests a complete \"wedding experience\". If I decide not todo the DJ, I am considering taking the guests on an excursion.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ee14207c04a3207172d6bbd3d9ef008e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks ladies. We had a talk about it last night and I think we are going to go with a DJ. Even though we aren&#039;t big dancers, I just think having one to help with the flow (when to have dances, cut cake, etc) and to maybe get people up and moving is a good thing. If left to us, there will probably be no dancing and I worry people will be bored.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1574921,"PostDate":1327857911,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks ladies. We had a talk about it last night and I think we are going to go with a DJ. Even though we aren't big dancers, I just think having one to help with the flow (when to have dances, cut cake, etc) and to maybe get people up and moving is a good thing. If left to us, there will probably be no dancing and I worry people will be bored.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b5de7522d06bbcf02c91402c46d47082","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Oh, and AmyG, plans are starting to come together. We actually sat down last night and made quite a few decisions on things, which felt like a relief. I also ordered the outfits for FI and his BM, two big suitcases, and some decor item. I am feeling good that it feels like it is coming together, because there is not much the left! How are things going for you?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1574925,"PostDate":1327858123,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Oh, and AmyG, plans are starting to come together. We actually sat down last night and made quite a few decisions on things, which felt like a relief. I also ordered the outfits for FI and his BM, two big suitcases, and some decor item. I am feeling good that it feels like it is coming together, because there is not much the left! How are things going for you?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7375b63251dc47a89207960c436e0b51","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Hello all,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;It has been a long time since I posted but was just able to catch up on all of the new threads.&amp;nbsp; My Fianc\u00a9e and I was able to start on the planning document last night.&amp;nbsp; Were able to decide on 4 appetizers.&amp;nbsp; I am glad we received the info on the two locations for the reception, I wasn&#039;t aware that one of them was so close to the restaurants.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My Fiacee tells me that if they had a groomzilla show that I would be on it..&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575358,"PostDate":1327940688,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Hello all,<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">It has been a long time since I posted but was just able to catch up on all of the new threads.\u00a0 My Fianc\u00a9e and I was able to start on the planning document last night.\u00a0 Were able to decide on 4 appetizers.\u00a0 I am glad we received the info on the two locations for the reception, I wasn't aware that one of them was so close to the restaurants.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My Fiacee tells me that if they had a groomzilla show that I would be on it..<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d54db1fcce710e42f0deacb5c41aef02","RawContent":"It feels good to get some stuff done, doesn&#039;t it? But I have a question- what is this planning document people keep talking about? Is it just the \"wedding book\" you find online, or is it something they sent you specifically? Because my wedding is in 8 weeks, and they haven&#039;t sent me anything other than the booklet.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=2][color=black][font=arial]Hello all,[\/font][\/color][\/size] \n \n [size=2][color=black][font=arial]It has been a long time since I posted but was just able to catch up on all of the new threads.  My Fianc\u00a9e and I was able to start on the planning document last night.  Were able to decide on 4 appetizers.  I am glad we received the info on the two locations for the reception, I wasn&#039;t aware that one of them was so close to the restaurants.[\/font][\/color][\/size] \n \n My Fiacee tells me that if they had a groomzilla show that I would be on it..[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1575670,"PostDate":1327963519,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It feels good to get some stuff done, doesn't it? But I have a question- what is this planning document people keep talking about? Is it just the \"wedding book\" you find online, or is it something they sent you specifically? Because my wedding is in 8 weeks, and they haven't sent me anything other than the booklet.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Hello all,<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">It has been a long time since I posted but was just able to catch up on all of the new threads.\u00a0 My Fianc\u00a9e and I was able to start on the planning document last night.\u00a0 Were able to decide on 4 appetizers.\u00a0 I am glad we received the info on the two locations for the reception, I wasn't aware that one of them was so close to the restaurants.<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> My Fiacee tells me that if they had a groomzilla show that I would be on it..<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f976f2e3636c1adf770c5d8fa54774eb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; it&#039;s something they send you. I ended up emailing Anel because my wedding is so soon and I hadn&#039;t received it yet. She sent it right away&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[{"Id":6202,"Name":"sashes.jpg","Url":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2012\/post-30467-138237889063.jpg","ScaledUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/monthly_02_2012\/post-30467-138237889063_thumb.jpg","Width":720,"Height":480}],"Id":1575681,"PostDate":1327964045,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> it's something they send you. I ended up emailing Anel because my wedding is so soon and I hadn't received it yet. She sent it right away<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kaitlinjackwedding@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1297294558,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-236603.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"kmm8984","Id":236603,"Name":"kmm8984","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2876666c3233060c4d6c03c1044a9abb","RawContent":"They did send me a word document.  If you like you could send me your email address and I could send it to you. \n \n Thank you, \n \n Ryan\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]joda[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n It feels good to get some stuff done, doesn&#039;t it? But I have a question- what is this planning document people keep talking about? Is it just the \"wedding book\" you find online, or is it something they sent you specifically? Because my wedding is in 8 weeks, and they haven&#039;t sent me anything other than the booklet.\n   \n \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1575683,"PostDate":1327964134,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> They did send me a word document.\u00a0 If you like you could send me your email address and I could send it to you.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ryan<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>joda<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> It feels good to get some stuff done, doesn't it? But I have a question- what is this planning document people keep talking about? Is it just the \"wedding book\" you find online, or is it something they sent you specifically? Because my wedding is in 8 weeks, and they haven't sent me anything other than the booklet.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d64f68b4a29f59a94368cffec748b009","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;I have a question, are there only two options for the reception? Beach Terrace or Tequila Terrace?&amp;nbsp; I have read a few comments saying that people thought the Beach terrace was a better option because it wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t as close to the restaurants and that the beach terrace was a better location to dance.. what is everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s opinion?&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Thank you,&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 10pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"color: black\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\"&gt;Ryan&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575772,"PostDate":1327973879,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I have a question, are there only two options for the reception? Beach Terrace or Tequila Terrace?\u00a0 I have read a few comments saying that people thought the Beach terrace was a better option because it wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t as close to the restaurants and that the beach terrace was a better location to dance.. what is everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s opinion?<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Thank you,<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Ryan<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2c84fe5b3f5bf4a509b66e492c0cefd3","RawContent":"I just sent you my email by PM. Thanks a million!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n They did send me a word document.  If you like you could send me your email address and I could send it to you. \n \n Thank you, \n \n Ryan\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1575774,"PostDate":1327974096,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just sent you my email by PM. Thanks a million!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> They did send me a word document.\u00a0 If you like you could send me your email address and I could send it to you.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ryan<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":200,"NextPage":210,"PreviousPage":190,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
