Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7013be1e3769fcd03256fcd77c233525","RawContent":"As far as I know, those are the only private outdoor locations. Otherwise you have the ballroom indoors. We are doing the tequila terrace, which I think is more popular, based on what it looks like and that I have read people didn&#039;t notice other people. I think neither of them are perfect for privacy because the beach terrace I thought was right beside the pool? So there will still be people around. The beach terrace is better if the ladies want to wear heels (tequila has wooden slats, no good) and might be larger, although I am not sure about that. Hope that helps somewhat!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n [size=2][color=black][font=arial]I have a question, are there only two options for the reception? Beach Terrace or Tequila Terrace?  I have read a few comments saying that people thought the Beach terrace was a better option because it wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t as close to the restaurants and that the beach terrace was a better location to dance.. what is everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s opinion?[\/font][\/color][\/size] \n [size=2][color=black][font=arial]Thank you,[\/font][\/color][\/size] \n [size=2][color=black][font=arial]Ryan[\/font][\/color][\/size] \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1575781,"PostDate":1327974328,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> As far as I know, those are the only private outdoor locations. Otherwise you have the ballroom indoors. We are doing the tequila terrace, which I think is more popular, based on what it looks like and that I have read people didn't notice other people. I think neither of them are perfect for privacy because the beach terrace I thought was right beside the pool? So there will still be people around. The beach terrace is better if the ladies want to wear heels (tequila has wooden slats, no good) and might be larger, although I am not sure about that. Hope that helps somewhat!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">I have a question, are there only two options for the reception? Beach Terrace or Tequila Terrace?\u00a0 I have read a few comments saying that people thought the Beach terrace was a better option because it wasn\u00e2\u20ac\u2122t as close to the restaurants and that the beach terrace was a better location to dance.. what is everyone\u00e2\u20ac\u2122s opinion?<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Thank you,<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 10pt\"><span  style=\"color: black\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial, sans-serif\">Ryan<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"766f145a35b37f2867333c2587986351","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Any one doing a signature drink?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575898,"PostDate":1327984556,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Any one doing a signature drink?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"707a283ccbbfe31cad89fd64d7fb0269","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Rfinger, I suggest &amp;nbsp;you pick a signature drink that match your wedding colors , also if you include the recipe in the wedding planning form they may make an small tasting when you are there.It is nice touch to offer your guests that drink right after ceremony ...I also recommend something frozen &amp;nbsp;and refreshing!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1575931,"PostDate":1327985964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Rfinger, I suggest \u00a0you pick a signature drink that match your wedding colors , also if you include the recipe in the wedding planning form they may make an small tasting when you are there.It is nice touch to offer your guests that drink right after ceremony ...I also recommend something frozen \u00a0and refreshing!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e9c26670773a9f57741fcc25642d9401","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow, that is really nice Sandy.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Here is a dumb question.&amp;nbsp; If I bring my own paper luminaries that I am making, do I need to supply tealights, or will the resort give me some?&amp;nbsp; Are they free, or would that be another charge?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; With the colored ties for the chairs, if I would bring that (instead of them charging me $5 per chair, would the resort put them on the chairs for me, or would I have to have a friend or someone do that for me?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Heather&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1576139,"PostDate":1328034964,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow, that is really nice Sandy.<\/p> <p> Here is a dumb question.\u00a0 If I bring my own paper luminaries that I am making, do I need to supply tealights, or will the resort give me some?\u00a0 Are they free, or would that be another charge?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> With the colored ties for the chairs, if I would bring that (instead of them charging me $5 per chair, would the resort put them on the chairs for me, or would I have to have a friend or someone do that for me?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> Heather<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hwessley@new.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317002945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245861.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HeatherViolet","Id":245861,"Name":"HeatherViolet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"052235aebd0cedc8e10b4ece504dcad9","RawContent":"Thanks Sandy for the idea of putting it in the planning form. I am trying to come up with some purple drinks now (of course not the easiest!)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Sandy Planner[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Rfinger, I suggest  you pick a signature drink that match your wedding colors , also if you include the recipe in the wedding planning form they may make an small tasting when you are there.It is nice touch to offer your guests that drink right after ceremony ...I also recommend something frozen  and refreshing!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1576144,"PostDate":1328035277,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Sandy for the idea of putting it in the planning form. I am trying to come up with some purple drinks now (of course not the easiest!)<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Sandy Planner<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Rfinger, I suggest \u00a0you pick a signature drink that match your wedding colors , also if you include the recipe in the wedding planning form they may make an small tasting when you are there.It is nice touch to offer your guests that drink right after ceremony ...I also recommend something frozen \u00a0and refreshing!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"95adcb79e8fd2e408dce83dfd393839e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Let me know what you come up with maybe I will copy ;-) &amp;nbsp;Our colors are like an aqua blue and purple..&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Even though it is not our color I was thinking about doing the Olive Garden Strawberry Fresco but just having it called the Finger Fresco&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=u0Rp2xJ2KsA\"&gt;http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=u0Rp2xJ2KsA&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1576349,"PostDate":1328051059,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Let me know what you come up with maybe I will copy ;-) \u00a0Our colors are like an aqua blue and purple..<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Even though it is not our color I was thinking about doing the Olive Garden Strawberry Fresco but just having it called the Finger Fresco<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/watch?v=u0Rp2xJ2KsA' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.youtube.c...h?v=u0Rp2xJ2KsA<\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c437d2824f0b5024c38d9387245cc521","RawContent":"RFinger, will let you know. The fianc\u00a9 and I are going to have to do a little bartending and see what we like.&amp;nbsp;  &amp;nbsp;  The drink you posted looks really good! And I like the name :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1576486,"PostDate":1328067327,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                 RFinger, will let you know. The fianc\u00a9 and I are going to have to do a little bartending and see what we like.\u00a0  \u00a0  The drink you posted looks really good! And I like the name <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e8f512ccfbe6ba5d6110291ecb73bb08","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; After looking at the planning info it states this:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span style=\"font-size: 12pt\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family: arial narrow,sans-serif\"&gt;We offer during the cocktail hour OPEN BAR and everybody can order anything they want&amp;nbsp; for drinks , however sometimes the bride and groom would like have special drink(wedding signature drink) , Do you have&amp;nbsp; a signature&amp;nbsp; drink? , If you do what is it? What are the ingredients? &lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; With the word However, it makes me wonder do they still get open bar and can order everything they want, or would then they just serve the wedding sigature drink?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I think because of our colors we might use the Blue Valva as our signature drink since&#039;s its an aqua blue color.&amp;nbsp; This drink is gin, vodka, blue coraco, mixed and then served over sprite and ice.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1576490,"PostDate":1328067580,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> After looking at the planning info it states this:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial narrow,sans-serif\">We offer during the cocktail hour OPEN BAR and everybody can order anything they want\u00a0 for drinks , however sometimes the bride and groom would like have special drink(wedding signature drink) , Do you have\u00a0 a signature\u00a0 drink? , If you do what is it? What are the ingredients? <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> With the word However, it makes me wonder do they still get open bar and can order everything they want, or would then they just serve the wedding sigature drink?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I think because of our colors we might use the Blue Valva as our signature drink since's its an aqua blue color.\u00a0 This drink is gin, vodka, blue coraco, mixed and then served over sprite and ice.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"47868816e776d24ae0e6ddcb52a270c6","RawContent":"Dear Rfinger: Your guests will get the signature drink and the open bar , the signature drink is optional ...and by the way Blue Valva sounds great...\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n After looking at the planning info it states this: \n \n [size=3][font=arial narrow]We offer during the cocktail hour OPEN BAR and everybody can order anything they want  for drinks , however sometimes the bride and groom would like have special drink(wedding signature drink) , Do you have  a signature  drink? , If you do what is it? What are the ingredients? [\/font][\/size] \n \n With the word However, it makes me wonder do they still get open bar and can order everything they want, or would then they just serve the wedding sigature drink? \n \n I think because of our colors we might use the Blue Valva as our signature drink since&#039;s its an aqua blue color.  This drink is gin, vodka, blue coraco, mixed and then served over sprite and ice.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1576546,"PostDate":1328074221,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Dear Rfinger: Your guests will get the signature drink and the open bar , the signature drink is optional ...and by the way Blue Valva sounds great...<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> After looking at the planning info it states this:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span  style=\"font-size: 12pt\"><span  style=\"font-family: arial narrow,sans-serif\">We offer during the cocktail hour OPEN BAR and everybody can order anything they want\u00a0 for drinks , however sometimes the bride and groom would like have special drink(wedding signature drink) , Do you have\u00a0 a signature\u00a0 drink? , If you do what is it? What are the ingredients? <\/span><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> With the word However, it makes me wonder do they still get open bar and can order everything they want, or would then they just serve the wedding sigature drink?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I think because of our colors we might use the Blue Valva as our signature drink since's its an aqua blue color.\u00a0 This drink is gin, vodka, blue coraco, mixed and then served over sprite and ice.\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"059577ecefc451179c939180762639ee","RawContent":"Dear Heather : You can bring the luminaries with you but make sure bring tealights with you sometimes they dont have in stock ,Iam sure Ramon or Anel  will be happy to assist you with that , about the chairs  you may bring your own ribbons  , you can pay them for put it in the chairs  I think is $1 usd per chair , that money is paid to the staff to put it on the chairs... [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]HeatherViolet[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Wow, that is really nice Sandy. \n Here is a dumb question.  If I bring my own paper luminaries that I am making, do I need to supply tealights, or will the resort give me some?  Are they free, or would that be another charge? \n \n With the colored ties for the chairs, if I would bring that (instead of them charging me $5 per chair, would the resort put them on the chairs for me, or would I have to have a friend or someone do that for me?  \n \n Thanks! \n Heather[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1576548,"PostDate":1328074673,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Dear Heather : You can bring the luminaries with you but make sure bring tealights with you sometimes they dont have in stock ,Iam sure Ramon or Anel \u00a0will be happy to assist you with that , about the chairs \u00a0you may bring your own ribbons \u00a0, you can pay them for put it in the chairs \u00a0I think is $1 usd per chair , that money is paid to the staff to put it on the chairs...<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>HeatherViolet<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Wow, that is really nice Sandy.<\/p> <p> Here is a dumb question.\u00a0 If I bring my own paper luminaries that I am making, do I need to supply tealights, or will the resort give me some?\u00a0 Are they free, or would that be another charge?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> With the colored ties for the chairs, if I would bring that (instead of them charging me $5 per chair, would the resort put them on the chairs for me, or would I have to have a friend or someone do that for me?\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> Heather<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":210,"NextPage":220,"PreviousPage":200,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
