{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c6daed780a6dd320562af8a537cfcc41","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks Sandy for all of your help! We booked the tequila terrace, so I have already made it clear no heels. Hopefully the girls listen to me. Question for you. We were thinking of placing a bunch of tea lights on the table for the reception for ambience. Do you think they will stay lit, or is too windy? I know I can purchase the led candles, but I just don&#039;t like them as much as the real thing.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1577473,"PostDate":1328220755,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Sandy for all of your help! We booked the tequila terrace, so I have already made it clear no heels. Hopefully the girls listen to me. Question for you. We were thinking of placing a bunch of tea lights on the table for the reception for ambience. Do you think they will stay lit, or is too windy? I know I can purchase the led candles, but I just don't like them as much as the real thing.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d86deb6abdf8f389c8341981f19726dd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you for all of the information we are at the tequila terrace as well so I&#039;ll let people know its prolly not best idea to wear heels&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1577611,"PostDate":1328239953,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you for all of the information we are at the tequila terrace as well so I'll let people know its prolly not best idea to wear heels\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f3a886cbcc3b16f5fa7888e59697f224","RawContent":"Although the real candles looks soooo pretty I highly suggest take battery candles with you , wind never let the candles lighted :(........for decoration I suggest use battery candles...in both locations Tequila Terrace or Beach Terrace is windy . [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]joda[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks Sandy for all of your help! We booked the tequila terrace, so I have already made it clear no heels. Hopefully the girls listen to me. Question for you. We were thinking of placing a bunch of tea lights on the table for the reception for ambience. Do you think they will stay lit, or is too windy? I know I can purchase the led candles, but I just don&#039;t like them as much as the real thing. \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1577656,"PostDate":1328248773,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Although the real candles looks soooo pretty I highly suggest take battery candles with you , wind never let the candles lighted <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/sad.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':(' \/>........for decoration I suggest use battery candles...in both locations Tequila Terrace or Beach Terrace is windy .<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>joda<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks Sandy for all of your help! We booked the tequila terrace, so I have already made it clear no heels. Hopefully the girls listen to me. Question for you. We were thinking of placing a bunch of tea lights on the table for the reception for ambience. Do you think they will stay lit, or is too windy? I know I can purchase the led candles, but I just don't like them as much as the real thing.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2dbe8828b110213532cffe43afede8f8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hey guys,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thought I&#039;d join in.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m also thinking about Now Sapphire for my Hindu wedding in 2013.&amp;nbsp; I went with a TA from Destinationwedding.com.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m so frustrated with their lack of communication.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m so glad that I found this site.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s been more useful, so many ideas!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Was just wondering what some of your reasons for choosing this resort are.&amp;nbsp; I like the fact that they do private receptions and doesn&#039;t seem like other resorts do, or maybe at a totally outragious price.Would love to hear your thoughts:)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1578977,"PostDate":1328578097,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey guys,<\/p> <p> Thought I'd join in.\u00a0 I'm also thinking about Now Sapphire for my Hindu wedding in 2013.\u00a0 I went with a TA from Destinationwedding.com.\u00a0 I'm so frustrated with their lack of communication.\u00a0 I'm so glad that I found this site.\u00a0 It's been more useful, so many ideas!<\/p> <p> Was just wondering what some of your reasons for choosing this resort are.\u00a0 I like the fact that they do private receptions and doesn't seem like other resorts do, or maybe at a totally outragious price.Would love to hear your thoughts:)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"visha7867@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1328253560,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250915.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pink Parrot","Id":250915,"Name":"Pink Parrot","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4a585e5fd5ae93609858093229cfadd3","RawContent":"I chose NOW Sapphire for a variety of reasons. I like that their wedding package is \"all inclusive\" and that they&#039;re not trying to nickel and dime you (like some other resorts). I like that the price for the stay is reasonable for my guests, it&#039;s family friendly and it&#039;s a medium size resort, so I will be able to spend more time with\/see more of my guests.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Pink Parrot[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey guys, \n Thought I&#039;d join in.  I&#039;m also thinking about Now Sapphire for my Hindu wedding in 2013.  I went with a TA from Destinationwedding.com.  I&#039;m so frustrated with their lack of communication.  I&#039;m so glad that I found this site.  It&#039;s been more useful, so many ideas! \n Was just wondering what some of your reasons for choosing this resort are.  I like the fact that they do private receptions and doesn&#039;t seem like other resorts do, or maybe at a totally outragious price.Would love to hear your thoughts:) \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1579238,"PostDate":1328640791,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I chose NOW Sapphire for a variety of reasons. I like that their wedding package is \"all inclusive\" and that they're not trying to nickel and dime you (like some other resorts). I like that the price for the stay is reasonable for my guests, it's family friendly and it's a medium size resort, so I will be able to spend more time with\/see more of my guests.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Pink Parrot<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey guys,<\/p> <p> Thought I'd join in.\u00a0 I'm also thinking about Now Sapphire for my Hindu wedding in 2013.\u00a0 I went with a TA from Destinationwedding.com.\u00a0 I'm so frustrated with their lack of communication.\u00a0 I'm so glad that I found this site.\u00a0 It's been more useful, so many ideas!<\/p> <p> Was just wondering what some of your reasons for choosing this resort are.\u00a0 I like the fact that they do private receptions and doesn't seem like other resorts do, or maybe at a totally outragious price.Would love to hear your thoughts:)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cfd93fac5b8cfa12cb97f8f1e90f3bcf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sandy-&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I know they know how to \"Nickel and Dime\" you for flowers at the resort.&amp;nbsp; Do you have an suggestions on outside flower vendors?&amp;nbsp; Anyone that is more reasonable than $350 for a bouquet?&amp;nbsp; I know there are vendor fees.... but if you would go into town, or meet the florist at the gate, would the resort still charge that vendor fee?&amp;nbsp; Just trying to find better ways to save money on flowers.&amp;nbsp; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Heather&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1579340,"PostDate":1328647451,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sandy-<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I know they know how to \"Nickel and Dime\" you for flowers at the resort.\u00a0 Do you have an suggestions on outside flower vendors?\u00a0 Anyone that is more reasonable than $350 for a bouquet?\u00a0 I know there are vendor fees.... but if you would go into town, or meet the florist at the gate, would the resort still charge that vendor fee?\u00a0 Just trying to find better ways to save money on flowers.\u00a0 Thanks!<\/p> <p> Heather<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hwessley@new.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317002945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245861.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HeatherViolet","Id":245861,"Name":"HeatherViolet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"828ae9decb70aba05f938745dfc574bf","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sandy-&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I know they know how to \"Nickel and Dime\" you for flowers at the resort.&amp;nbsp; Do you have an suggestions on outside flower vendors?&amp;nbsp; Anyone that is more reasonable than $350 for a bouquet?&amp;nbsp; I know there are vendor fees.... but if you would go into town, or meet the florist at the gate, would the resort still charge that vendor fee?&amp;nbsp; Just trying to find better ways to save money on flowers.&amp;nbsp; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Heather&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1579344,"PostDate":1328647568,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sandy-<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I know they know how to \"Nickel and Dime\" you for flowers at the resort.\u00a0 Do you have an suggestions on outside flower vendors?\u00a0 Anyone that is more reasonable than $350 for a bouquet?\u00a0 I know there are vendor fees.... but if you would go into town, or meet the florist at the gate, would the resort still charge that vendor fee?\u00a0 Just trying to find better ways to save money on flowers.\u00a0 Thanks!<\/p> <p> Heather<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hwessley@new.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317002945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245861.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HeatherViolet","Id":245861,"Name":"HeatherViolet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a7f197f74aaee6fa3ebb034a13a8e02b","RawContent":"Just waiting to get on my flight to head to Now! Super excited, I&#039;ll let you girls (and guys) know how it goes;)","Attachments":[],"Id":1579760,"PostDate":1328721270,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Just waiting to get on my flight to head to Now! Super excited, I'll let you girls (and guys) know how it goes;)\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ashirkey@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1300687841,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237999.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":213,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ps31","Id":237999,"Name":"ps31","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a8eded87e4b2933d4bae4101da066ef6","RawContent":"Good luck! I am sure you will have an awesome wedding. Can&#039;t wait to hear all about it when you return!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ps31[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Just waiting to get on my flight to head to Now! Super excited, I&#039;ll let you girls (and guys) know how it goes;)[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1579809,"PostDate":1328728158,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Good luck! I am sure you will have an awesome wedding. Can't wait to hear all about it when you return!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ps31<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Just waiting to get on my flight to head to Now! Super excited, I'll let you girls (and guys) know how it goes;)<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4ef4baeabaa0163004811db3f06f3291","RawContent":"Dear Heather :  Yes , you are right ...If the florist drop directly to  YOU the flowers, it should NOT be a problem, if the centerpieces need to be \"set\" they may charge you for a vendor fee , but BELIEVE me even paying that vendor fee you would save a lot. \n \n I work with a floral designer  that only work for events and give very good pricing and  I love their flowers because they are good quality . Please feel free to email me sandy@ultimatemexicoweddings.com some of your bouquets and I can get a quotation for you.He is not  englsih speaker  , he usually is \"backstage\" for that reason, \n \n He gives good prices and good design.He studied many years in Mexico City . Iam so Lucky to have him. \n \n Sandy [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]HeatherViolet[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sandy- \n \n I know they know how to \"Nickel and Dime\" you for flowers at the resort.  Do you have an suggestions on outside flower vendors?  Anyone that is more reasonable than $350 for a bouquet?  I know there are vendor fees.... but if you would go into town, or meet the florist at the gate, would the resort still charge that vendor fee?  Just trying to find better ways to save money on flowers.  Thanks! \n Heather \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1579874,"PostDate":1328733157,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Dear Heather : \u00a0Yes , you are right ...If the florist drop directly to \u00a0YOU the flowers, it should NOT be a problem, if the centerpieces need to be \"set\" they may charge you for a vendor fee , but BELIEVE me even paying that vendor fee you would save a lot.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I work with a floral designer \u00a0that only work for events and give very good pricing and \u00a0I love their flowers because they are good quality . Please feel free to email me sandy@ultimatemexicoweddings.com some of your bouquets and I can get a quotation for you.He is not \u00a0englsih speaker \u00a0, he usually is \"backstage\" for that reason,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> He gives good prices and good design.He studied many years in Mexico City . Iam so Lucky to have him.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sandy<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>HeatherViolet<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sandy-<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I know they know how to \"Nickel and Dime\" you for flowers at the resort.\u00a0 Do you have an suggestions on outside flower vendors?\u00a0 Anyone that is more reasonable than $350 for a bouquet?\u00a0 I know there are vendor fees.... but if you would go into town, or meet the florist at the gate, would the resort still charge that vendor fee?\u00a0 Just trying to find better ways to save money on flowers.\u00a0 Thanks!<\/p> <p> Heather<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":230,"NextPage":240,"PreviousPage":220,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
