Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b4656a60b7dfc8c2036aa223150e28a1","RawContent":"Hello Pink Parrot: \n \n Congratulations for your upcoming wedding , you dont have idea How much I like the Hindu Weddings...I had the pleasure to work in the past with some weddings some very traditional ... \n \n Now is so pretty resort! How large  is your wedding? If you need assistance to select the wedding location at the Now , you let me know!! \n \n Please if you need any assistance  or need specific services like  Mahndi Ceremony(henna artist), Indian DJ  and most important GOOD Indian food let me know! I have worked with one of the best  Indian Chefs in town , he is so nice and patient his name is Gulab, and he  import all the spices for the food, overall he has wedding experience... It is very exciting!  \n \n \n Welcome again to the forum \n Sandy [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Pink Parrot[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hey guys, \n Thought I&#039;d join in.  I&#039;m also thinking about Now Sapphire for my Hindu wedding in 2013.  I went with a TA from Destinationwedding.com.  I&#039;m so frustrated with their lack of communication.  I&#039;m so glad that I found this site.  It&#039;s been more useful, so many ideas! \n Was just wondering what some of your reasons for choosing this resort are.  I like the fact that they do private receptions and doesn&#039;t seem like other resorts do, or maybe at a totally outragious price.Would love to hear your thoughts:) \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1579880,"PostDate":1328733619,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Hello Pink Parrot:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Congratulations for your upcoming wedding , you dont have idea How much I like the Hindu Weddings...I had the pleasure to work in the past with some weddings some very traditional ...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Now is so pretty resort! How large \u00a0is your wedding? If you need assistance to select the wedding location at the Now , you let me know!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Please if you need any assistance \u00a0or need specific services like \u00a0Mahndi Ceremony(henna artist), Indian DJ \u00a0and most important GOOD Indian food let me know! I have worked with one of the best \u00a0Indian Chefs in town , he is so nice and patient his name is Gulab, and he \u00a0import all the spices for the food, overall he has wedding experience... It is very exciting!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Welcome again to the forum<\/p> <p> Sandy<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Pink Parrot<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hey guys,<\/p> <p> Thought I'd join in.\u00a0 I'm also thinking about Now Sapphire for my Hindu wedding in 2013.\u00a0 I went with a TA from Destinationwedding.com.\u00a0 I'm so frustrated with their lack of communication.\u00a0 I'm so glad that I found this site.\u00a0 It's been more useful, so many ideas!<\/p> <p> Was just wondering what some of your reasons for choosing this resort are.\u00a0 I like the fact that they do private receptions and doesn't seem like other resorts do, or maybe at a totally outragious price.Would love to hear your thoughts:)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1ff0d9b17d06dfdd3c1dfdcc1115fb4b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Dear Heather: You will find alot of options IN Cancun that can sell you flowers not all of them are good or formal ...I will get you alist with the flowershops (GOOD and Punctual). My concern is that when you contact them sometimes their english is not very fluent.. Let me get you that list&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thank you&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1579885,"PostDate":1328733850,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Dear Heather: You will find alot of options IN Cancun that can sell you flowers not all of them are good or formal ...I will get you alist with the flowershops (GOOD and Punctual). My concern is that when you contact them sometimes their english is not very fluent.. Let me get you that list<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1941f8dd3609624b3364fd3ce4dea664","RawContent":"I agree!  Thanks for all the input Sandy.  Previous brides had wonderful things to say about you!  \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Sandy, \n \n Thank you for the information.  It is nice having you on the board so that we get our answers a little sooner. \n \n Thank you, \n \n Ryan \n \n \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1579988,"PostDate":1328742321,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I agree! \u00a0Thanks for all the input Sandy. \u00a0Previous brides had wonderful things to say about you! \u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Sandy,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you for the information. \u00a0It is nice having you on the board so that we get our answers a little sooner.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thank you,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Ryan<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265688916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"18a761dcf5c19f4024b3e129db262edc","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Heather - Have you thought about silk flowers? &amp;nbsp;I was in another thread and someone mentioned how amazing her silk flowers were from:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=\"http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/biz\/simply-classic-creations-noblesville\/website\/1ee97e2791be8445.html\"&gt;http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/biz\/simply-classic-creations-noblesville\/website\/1ee97e2791be8445.html&lt;\/a&gt;. &amp;nbsp;She said no one could tell they weren&#039;t real and best of all she got to keep them! &amp;nbsp;Not sure how well they would pack though.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1579994,"PostDate":1328742815,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Heather - Have you thought about silk flowers? \u00a0I was in another thread and someone mentioned how amazing her silk flowers were from:<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/www.weddingwire.com\/biz\/simply-classic-creations-noblesville\/website\/1ee97e2791be8445.html' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>http:\/\/www.weddingwi...2791be8445.html<\/a>. \u00a0She said no one could tell they weren't real and best of all she got to keep them! \u00a0Not sure how well they would pack though.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tdemoss6@aim.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1265688916,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-225447.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Traci7642","Id":225447,"Name":"Traci7642","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b75aed015470610964a9d31a574fcf23","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Sandy,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was begining to think that my dream tradional wedding was not looking so great.&amp;nbsp;How was i going to get all this stuff done&amp;nbsp;in mexico!&amp;nbsp;OMG, all my questions have been answered!&amp;nbsp; I&#039;m looking for all of the above....lol.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m sure most hindu weddings are really big, but I&#039;m estimating 25-30 ppl only. Cute and small:)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was also wondering if there is a place big enough to have some pre-wedding fun.&amp;nbsp; I don&#039;t know how to describe it, I guess&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s a big &amp;nbsp;traditional dance party....hahaha!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do you think i could get an indian chef? This is awesome! You are awesome!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;m so excited!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1580179,"PostDate":1328768195,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Sandy,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was begining to think that my dream tradional wedding was not looking so great.\u00a0How was i going to get all this stuff done\u00a0in mexico!\u00a0OMG, all my questions have been answered!\u00a0 I'm looking for all of the above....lol.\u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm sure most hindu weddings are really big, but I'm estimating 25-30 ppl only. Cute and small:)\u00a0<\/p> <p> I was also wondering if there is a place big enough to have some pre-wedding fun.\u00a0 I don't know how to describe it, I guess\u00a0 It's a big \u00a0traditional dance party....hahaha!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do you think i could get an indian chef? This is awesome! You are awesome!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm so excited!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"visha7867@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1328253560,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-250915.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Pink Parrot","Id":250915,"Name":"Pink Parrot","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3046e32ce7a57bb94e7e02bdd8bf04f0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It is my pleasure!!&lt;img id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1328765844488_202\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1580185,"PostDate":1328769760,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It is my pleasure!!<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1328765844488_202\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile29.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"acd0edfabc0b73d0a73f65ccd56bfe2c","RawContent":"Dear Pink Parrot: \n We had tha party once for 150 people at Now Sapphire...I guess their 2 main locations worked perfectly . \n \n I would recommend  the BEACH TERRACE  for  dancing because is concret floor, also  some brides like better the  TEQUILA for their wedding night, I guess for the roof. \n \n \n It is very important that if you will have another event  beside your wedding you  ask Ramon or Anel blocked the section ...eventhough  you dont have further details they should at least block the area for you. \n \n I also like alot the Pool Preffered area,,,it has a Bali beds  and enough area for dancing,...They rent that Pool...I love the  Bali Beds there ,,,you may use that area for your Mehndi  , I just love it. \n \n Sandy \n \n \n \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Pink Parrot[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Sandy, \n \n I was begining to think that my dream tradional wedding was not looking so great. How was i going to get all this stuff done in mexico! OMG, all my questions have been answered!  I&#039;m looking for all of the above....lol.  \n I&#039;m sure most hindu weddings are really big, but I&#039;m estimating 25-30 ppl only. Cute and small:)  \n I was also wondering if there is a place big enough to have some pre-wedding fun.  I don&#039;t know how to describe it, I guess  It&#039;s a big  traditional dance party....hahaha! \n \n Do you think i could get an indian chef? This is awesome! You are awesome! \n \n I&#039;m so excited![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1580190,"PostDate":1328771071,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Dear Pink Parrot:<\/p> <p> We had tha party once for 150 people at Now Sapphire...I guess their 2 main locations worked perfectly .<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I would recommend \u00a0the BEACH TERRACE \u00a0for \u00a0dancing because is concret floor, also \u00a0some brides like better the \u00a0TEQUILA for their wedding night, I guess for the roof.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It is very important that if you will have another event \u00a0beside your wedding you \u00a0ask Ramon or Anel blocked the section ...eventhough \u00a0you dont have further details they should at least block the area for you.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I also like alot the Pool Preffered area,,,it has a Bali beds \u00a0and enough area for dancing,...They rent that Pool...I love the \u00a0Bali Beds there ,,,you may use that area for your Mehndi \u00a0, I just love it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Sandy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Pink Parrot<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Sandy,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was begining to think that my dream tradional wedding was not looking so great.\u00a0How was i going to get all this stuff done\u00a0in mexico!\u00a0OMG, all my questions have been answered!\u00a0 I'm looking for all of the above....lol.\u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm sure most hindu weddings are really big, but I'm estimating 25-30 ppl only. Cute and small:)\u00a0<\/p> <p> I was also wondering if there is a place big enough to have some pre-wedding fun.\u00a0 I don't know how to describe it, I guess\u00a0 It's a big \u00a0traditional dance party....hahaha!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Do you think i could get an indian chef? This is awesome! You are awesome!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'm so excited!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"info@ultimatemexicoweddings.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1321993668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-247948.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":86,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Sandy Planner","Id":247948,"Name":"Sandy Planner","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd6c171562a9839ac23b12d394b701b0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello all&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Just wondering how this resort is with outside vendors&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1581572,"PostDate":1329094098,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello all<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just wondering how this resort is with outside vendors<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"matandnikkiswedding@hotmail.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1318544751,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246675.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"MissNikki","Id":246675,"Name":"MissNikki","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"20223712e2bc47d0c558b7e17765ffd3","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Sandy,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Maybe you could assist me with this as you have a lot of experience with the weddings at the Sapphire...I am filling out my Wedding Planning Form.&amp;nbsp; My ceremony time is for 5:00pm on the beach and it asks what time I want the cocktail and dinner reception to start, do you have any recommendations for the start times of each of them?&amp;nbsp; I would not want to go over an hour for the cocktails.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Amy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582175,"PostDate":1329191405,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Sandy,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Maybe you could assist me with this as you have a lot of experience with the weddings at the Sapphire...I am filling out my Wedding Planning Form.\u00a0 My ceremony time is for 5:00pm on the beach and it asks what time I want the cocktail and dinner reception to start, do you have any recommendations for the start times of each of them?\u00a0 I would not want to go over an hour for the cocktails.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Amy<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f121488cc02e319167d97b5b908cc0b7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Amy,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Not surprisingly I am at the same point as you. What I was thinking is ceremony at 4:30, should take us to 5 or almost. Then sparkling wine toast, hugs, some pictures, then cocktail hour 5:30-6:30. Then I was originally going to do reception 6:30-9:30 but I was advised it might be nice to give people a quick half hour break if they want to freshen up or grab something from the room. So now I am leaning to reception 7-10. But Sandy I would also love to hear your thoughts on this!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1582256,"PostDate":1329229764,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Amy,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Not surprisingly I am at the same point as you. What I was thinking is ceremony at 4:30, should take us to 5 or almost. Then sparkling wine toast, hugs, some pictures, then cocktail hour 5:30-6:30. Then I was originally going to do reception 6:30-9:30 but I was advised it might be nice to give people a quick half hour break if they want to freshen up or grab something from the room. So now I am leaning to reception 7-10. But Sandy I would also love to hear your thoughts on this!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":240,"NextPage":250,"PreviousPage":230,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
