Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d99c169d5a297eaff1214a4699a46d45","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I&#039;m sure.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it&#039;s a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport).&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1588803,"PostDate":1330607587,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I'm sure.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it's a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thomask122184@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325865744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249443.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":118,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ThomasK","Id":249443,"Name":"ThomasK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"79dd0e5deea8a4df2b21b9fcddfab021","RawContent":"Hi Thomas, \n \n It really depends on where you are flying out of.  I know that our travel agent didn&#039;t really book our flights people just booked their own.  She was able to get us a good rate on the rooms and was able to get 1 free room per 5 booked.  I went with a TA with Wright Travel Agency and she sends me updates when people book and has taken care of everything.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ThomasK[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy! \n \n We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person \n \n Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips? \n \n We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I&#039;m sure. \n \n Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it&#039;s a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport). \n \n What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding? \n \n \n Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips! \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1588863,"PostDate":1330618607,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Thomas,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It really depends on where you are flying out of. \u00a0I know that our travel agent didn't really book our flights people just booked their own. \u00a0She was able to get us a good rate on the rooms and was able to get 1 free room per 5 booked. \u00a0I went with a TA with Wright Travel Agency and she sends me updates when people book and has taken care of everything.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ThomasK<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I'm sure.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it's a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8e1b9aa7ca85f96f9d1c5e14ecbc9ad8","RawContent":"Thanks RF - we arent going until NEXT summer, so it is quite some time away, but our TA said he got us a \"guesstimate\" on the hotel and airfare. for everything per person its going to be just under 1500....is that around what you&#039;re paying (if you dont mind me asking) \n \n We&#039;re flying out of Pittsburgh - we have my fiances uncle with his wife and daughter caomnig from vegas and also my fiances best friend out of arizona but other than that we&#039;re all from Pittsburgh\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Thomas, \n \n It really depends on where you are flying out of.  I know that our travel agent didn&#039;t really book our flights people just booked their own.  She was able to get us a good rate on the rooms and was able to get 1 free room per 5 booked.  I went with a TA with Wright Travel Agency and she sends me updates when people book and has taken care of everything.\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1588906,"PostDate":1330623202,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Thanks RF - we arent going until NEXT summer, so it is quite some time away, but our TA said he got us a \"guesstimate\" on the hotel and airfare. for everything per person its going to be just under 1500....is that around what you're paying (if you dont mind me asking)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're flying out of Pittsburgh - we have my fiances uncle with his wife and daughter caomnig from vegas and also my fiances best friend out of arizona but other than that we're all from Pittsburgh<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Thomas,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It really depends on where you are flying out of. \u00a0I know that our travel agent didn't really book our flights people just booked their own. \u00a0She was able to get us a good rate on the rooms and was able to get 1 free room per 5 booked. \u00a0I went with a TA with Wright Travel Agency and she sends me updates when people book and has taken care of everything.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thomask122184@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325865744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249443.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":118,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ThomasK","Id":249443,"Name":"ThomasK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b9b4c6d688c4932ef2aacd7808f34664","RawContent":"Hey ThomasK, \n \n I did the same as RFinger and guests got their airline reservations on their own, especially since a lot were coming from different cities.  \n \n I was also given an &#039;estimate&#039; for airfare and it was about $300 off of what I actually paid....it was off not in my favor  :-( ....so beware that airline rates are going to be unpredictable and there is No Way a travel agent can predict it now since they are not available yet and since your guests are going to book their flights at all different times.  \n \n As far as the resort, my guests are payng $172\/night (that is tax included and transfers from the airport to resort and back).  I am not sure if that is considered a good deal or not compared to other people on here that are going but I was happy with the rates and my guests haven&#039;t seemed to complain. \n \n If you buy one of their wedding packages...the Eternity or Divine....then you will have a lot included in your wedding up to 25 guests (and then you just pay the difference for the rest of them). \n I am having my ceremony on the beach and cocktail hour and reception on the Beach terrace (the concrete area in between the pool and the beach).  The Tequila Terrace is what I think you are referring to and that seems to be a lovely location as well.  :-) \n \n I have not done any &#039;negotiations&#039; for our wedding.  I sent in all my documents to the wedding planner, Anel, and I am just waiting to hear back from her and possibly we can work out a few things but overall I am pleased with what I am getting for the cost I am paying.\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ThomasK[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy! \n \n We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person \n \n Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips? \n \n We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I&#039;m sure. \n \n Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it&#039;s a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport). \n \n What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding? \n \n \n Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips! \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1588958,"PostDate":1330627524,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Hey ThomasK,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I did the same as RFinger and guests got their airline reservations on their own, especially since a lot were coming from different cities.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was also\u00a0given an 'estimate' for airfare and it was about $300 off of what I actually paid....it was off not in my favor\u00a0 :-( ....so beware that airline rates are going to be unpredictable and there is No Way a travel agent can predict it now since they are not available yet and since\u00a0your guests are going to book their flights at all different times.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As far as the resort, my guests are payng $172\/night (that is tax included and transfers from the airport to resort and back).\u00a0 I am not sure if that is considered a good deal or not compared to other people on here that are going but I was happy with the rates and my guests haven't seemed to complain.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you buy one of their wedding packages...the Eternity or Divine....then you will have a\u00a0lot included in your wedding up to 25 guests (and then you just pay the difference for the rest of them).<\/p> <p> I am having my ceremony on the beach and cocktail hour and reception on the Beach terrace (the concrete area in between the pool and the beach).\u00a0 The Tequila Terrace is what I think you are referring to and that seems to be a lovely location as well.\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I have not done any 'negotiations' for our wedding.\u00a0 I sent in all my documents to the wedding planner, Anel, and I am just waiting to hear back from her and possibly we can work out a few things but overall I am pleased with what I am getting for the cost I am paying.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ThomasK<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I'm sure.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it's a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"42ab36bba6ea864bc93ec16f251e2bdc","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ThomasK[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy! \n \n We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person \n \n Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips? \n \n We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I&#039;m sure. \n \n Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it&#039;s a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport). \n \n [b]What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding?[\/b] \n \n \n Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips! \n[\/quote] \n depends on where you are flying from, travel dates, etc...there are many variables that can affect the rates","Attachments":[],"Id":1588966,"PostDate":1330627986,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ThomasK<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I'm sure.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it's a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <strong>What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding?<\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> depends on where you are flying from, travel dates, etc...there are many variables that can affect the rates<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137227820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b8d6a62bac95f075a64dd29bbef27e36","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Thomas, \n \n It really depends on where you are flying out of.  I know that our travel agent didn&#039;t really book our flights people just booked their own.  She was able to get us a good rate on the rooms and was able to get 1 free room per 5 booked.  I went with a TA with Wright Travel Agency and she sends me updates when people book and has taken care of everything.\n   \n[\/quote] \n you  [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif[\/img]for using WTA! \n \n RFinger is right though.  some people want to book a package and be done with it.  others want some flexibility and are only ready to book rooms or they want to use frequent flier miles for airfare.  Usually a TA will work with you to figure out what is the best way to book you and your guests.","Attachments":[],"Id":1588967,"PostDate":1330628035,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <br \/> <br \/> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Thomas,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> It really depends on where you are flying out of. \u00a0I know that our travel agent didn't really book our flights people just booked their own. \u00a0She was able to get us a good rate on the rooms and was able to get 1 free room per 5 booked. \u00a0I went with a TA with Wright Travel Agency and she sends me updates when people book and has taken care of everything.<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> you \u00a0<span alt=\":rockon:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1330624364633_162\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/rockon.gif\" \/><\/span>for using WTA!<\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> RFinger is right though. \u00a0some people want to book a package and be done with it. \u00a0others want some flexibility and are only ready to book rooms or they want to use frequent flier miles for airfare. \u00a0Usually a TA will work with you to figure out what is the best way to book you and your guests.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137227820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4471cbe6866590aa8e2c192c344c319","RawContent":"This is what we were paying for the resort: \n \n [color=#777777][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [b]Single:[\/b] $516 for 3 nights; $160 each additional night[\/font][\/color] [color=#777777][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [b]Double:[\/b] $403 pp for 3 nights; $123 pp each additional night[\/font][\/color] [color=#777777][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [b]Triple: [\/b]$393 pp for 3 nights; $119 pp each additional night[\/font][\/color] [color=#777777][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [b]Children 3 - 12: [\/b]$185 for  3 nights; $50 each additional night[\/font][\/color] [color=#777777][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [b]Children 2 and under:[\/b] $38 for the whole time.[\/font][\/color] \n [color=#777777][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n WE did have one guy that booked that had our TA book the hotel and his flight.  [\/font][\/color] [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ThomasK[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n Thanks RF - we arent going until NEXT summer, so it is quite some time away, but our TA said he got us a \"guesstimate\" on the hotel and airfare. for everything per person its going to be just under 1500....is that around what you&#039;re paying (if you dont mind me asking) \n \n We&#039;re flying out of Pittsburgh - we have my fiances uncle with his wife and daughter caomnig from vegas and also my fiances best friend out of arizona but other than that we&#039;re all from Pittsburgh\n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1588995,"PostDate":1330629824,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> This is what we were paying for the resort:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Single:<\/strong>\u00a0$516 for 3 nights; $160 each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Double:<\/strong>\u00a0$403 pp for 3 nights; $123 pp each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Triple:\u00a0<\/strong>$393 pp for 3 nights; $119 pp each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Children 3 - 12:\u00a0<\/strong>$185 for \u00a03 nights; $50 each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Children 2 and under:<\/strong>\u00a0$38 for the whole time.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> WE did have one guy that booked that had our TA book the hotel and his flight. \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ThomasK<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Thanks RF - we arent going until NEXT summer, so it is quite some time away, but our TA said he got us a \"guesstimate\" on the hotel and airfare. for everything per person its going to be just under 1500....is that around what you're paying (if you dont mind me asking)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We're flying out of Pittsburgh - we have my fiances uncle with his wife and daughter caomnig from vegas and also my fiances best friend out of arizona but other than that we're all from Pittsburgh<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"725e7a2c8e093a909768767bd886af45","RawContent":"Is that definite about the children?MY godson who will be 2 next year, and my fiances little sister and cousin will be 10...my TA told me just today that children 12 (maybe 11) and under stay at the resort [b][u]free[\/u][\/b] (minus airfare and passfort ofcourse). \n \n Did you confirm those numbers regardnig children staying??\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n This is what we were paying for the resort: \n \n [color=rgb(119,119,119)][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [b]Single:[\/b] $516 for 3 nights; $160 each additional night[\/font][\/color] [color=rgb(119,119,119)][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [b]Double:[\/b] $403 pp for 3 nights; $123 pp each additional night[\/font][\/color] [color=rgb(119,119,119)][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [b]Triple: [\/b]$393 pp for 3 nights; $119 pp each additional night[\/font][\/color] [color=rgb(119,119,119)][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [color=#b22222][b]Children 3 - 12: $185 for  3 nights; $50 each additional night[\/b][\/color][\/font][\/color] [color=rgb(119,119,119)][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n [color=#b22222][b]Children 2 and under: $38 for the whole time.[\/b][\/color][\/font][\/color] \n [color=rgb(119,119,119)][font=&#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;]\n WE did have one guy that booked that had our TA book the hotel and his flight.  [\/font][\/color] \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1589100,"PostDate":1330638665,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Is that definite about the children?MY godson who will be 2 next year, and my fiances little sister and cousin will be 10...my TA told me just today that children 12 (maybe 11) and under stay at the resort <strong><u>free<\/u><\/strong> (minus airfare and passfort ofcourse).<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Did you confirm those numbers regardnig children staying??<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> This is what we were paying for the resort:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(119,119,119)\"> <strong>Single:<\/strong>\u00a0$516 for 3 nights; $160 each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(119,119,119)\"> <strong>Double:<\/strong>\u00a0$403 pp for 3 nights; $123 pp each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(119,119,119)\"> <strong>Triple:\u00a0<\/strong>$393 pp for 3 nights; $119 pp each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(119,119,119)\"> <span  style=\"color: #b22222\"><strong>Children 3 - 12:\u00a0$185 for \u00a03 nights; $50 each additional night<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(119,119,119)\"> <span  style=\"color: #b22222\"><strong>Children 2 and under:\u00a0$38 for the whole time.<\/strong><\/span><\/p> <p  style=\"font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(119,119,119)\"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; color: rgb(119,119,119)\"> WE did have one guy that booked that had our TA book the hotel and his flight. \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thomask122184@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325865744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249443.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":118,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ThomasK","Id":249443,"Name":"ThomasK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b1d75059a3dcb4a8b474161f6555b9b9","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; \n Quote:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;ThomasK&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; \n Is that definite about the children?MY godson who will be 2 next year, and my fiances little sister and cousin will be 10...&lt;strong&gt;my TA told me just today that children 12 (maybe 11) and under stay at the resort &lt;u&gt;free&lt;\/u&gt; (minus airfare and passfort ofcourse).&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Did you confirm those numbers regardnig children staying??\n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n this isn&#039;t 100% true. &amp;nbsp;Yes, sometimes Dreams runs Children Free promos but they have restrictions and blackout dates so they do not apply all year round. &amp;nbsp;Usually it is only valid from mid-august to december. &amp;nbsp;I do not think it has been extended for 2013 yet.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; this is from the agent site:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; Quote: &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt;  &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 15px; text-align: -webkit-auto; \"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;2012&lt;\/strong&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 15px; text-align: -webkit-auto; \"&gt; The 2012 Kids Stay Free is valid on all new reservations made at Now Resorts &amp;amp; Spas for travel from August 18, 2012 through December 21, 2012.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 15px; text-align: -webkit-auto; \"&gt; This offer can be combined with other discounts or offers, with the exception of group&#039;s promotions. Blackout dates and holiday restrictions may apply. Kids free promotion is subject to availability and can modified at any time. Advance reservations are required and can be made through leading travel professionals.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85); font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif; font-size: 11px; line-height: 15px; text-align: -webkit-auto; \"&gt; Restrictions and blackout dates may apply. This entire offer is based on availability and can be modified at any time.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;  &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1589120,"PostDate":1330640841,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Quote:<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>ThomasK<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> Is that definite about the children?MY godson who will be 2 next year, and my fiances little sister and cousin will be 10...<strong>my TA told me just today that children 12 (maybe 11) and under stay at the resort <u>free<\/u> (minus airfare and passfort ofcourse).<\/strong><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Did you confirm those numbers regardnig children staying??<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <p> <br \/> this isn't 100% true. \u00a0Yes, sometimes Dreams runs Children Free promos but they have restrictions and blackout dates so they do not apply all year round. \u00a0Usually it is only valid from mid-august to december. \u00a0I do not think it has been extended for 2013 yet.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> this is from the agent site:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> Quote: <div class=\"quote-block\">  <p  style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 11px;text-align: -webkit-auto\"> <strong>2012<\/strong><\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 11px;text-align: -webkit-auto\"> The 2012 Kids Stay Free is valid on all new reservations made at Now Resorts & Spas for travel from August 18, 2012 through December 21, 2012.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 11px;text-align: -webkit-auto\"> This offer can be combined with other discounts or offers, with the exception of group's promotions. Blackout dates and holiday restrictions may apply. Kids free promotion is subject to availability and can modified at any time. Advance reservations are required and can be made through leading travel professionals.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(85, 85, 85);font-family: Verdana, Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;font-size: 11px;text-align: -webkit-auto\"> Restrictions and blackout dates may apply. This entire offer is based on availability and can be modified at any time.\u00a0<\/p>  <\/div> <\/div> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137227820,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3c71fc941c84d816c50262326aaf7849","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ThomasK\"]\n&lt;p&gt; Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy!&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips?&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I&#039;m sure.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it&#039;s a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport).&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding?&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips!&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;[\/quote] My guests are paying just about the same price as what your quoted just about 100$ cheaper and that includes also round trip transfers to the hotel from airport. I&#039;m getting married in october cocktail hr at tequila terrace love the wooden decking and being so close to the water and dinner\/reception at the same location","Attachments":[],"Id":1589302,"PostDate":1330666847,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"ThomasK\" url=\"\/t\/74418\/now&#045;sapphire&#045;weddings&#045;formerly&#045;paradisus&#045;riviera\/260#post_1738371\"><p><p> Thank you for all of this helpful information Amy and Tammy!<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> We actually heard from our TA right after I posted this yesterday and he got us a deal for airfare, tax includ. and hotel stay for 7 nights at $2959\/couple which = $1479.50\/person<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> Is that a good deal in terms of what all you other brides\/groom(s) got negotiated for your trips?<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> We have not been in touch with the WC yet (other than me just emailed an inquiry and Anel responded) but will be in the coming weeks I'm sure.<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> Where have any\/all of you had\/plan to have your receptions at the resort? Jess (my fiance) and I both feel in love with the pictures we have seen of that outside deck area (I think it's a restaraunt) for a possible reception, though we fear something like that, for 30-40 people will severly increase our budget we want to spend on this wedding (actually \"ceremony\" as we will be officially married here in front of a JP just so all of our information is the same when my fiance gets her passport).<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> What all were you able to negotiate price-wise for your wedding\/future wedding?<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> Thanks again everyone for the helpful tips!<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><\/p><\/blockquote> My guests are paying just about the same price as what your quoted just about 100$ cheaper and that includes also round trip transfers to the hotel from airport. I'm getting married in october cocktail hr at tequila terrace love the wooden decking and being so close to the water and dinner\/reception at the same location\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moderncosmo1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304978447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239791.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moderncosmo1","Id":239791,"Name":"Moderncosmo1","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":270,"NextPage":280,"PreviousPage":260,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
