Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"93596e59bc4b9c08f35c4543072202c4","RawContent":"@ Tammy - thanks for the info, that&#039;s helping me better understand! \n \n \n \n @ Modern - is that what that deck area is called then - \"Tequila terrace\"? I really like it and with how open it is I think especially if its a beautiful night that would make one rememorable evening for our guest as well as us! \n \n That;s comforting Im at least in the ballpark round figure..I was seriously wondering if my TA was just blowing smoke about \"negotiating\" or if anyone could get the prices he could get. \n \n \n If you dont mind me asking, what as the total amounted to for your entire wedding i.e. trip\/stay\/ceremony\/reception. \n \n How many guest do you have attending and what type of \"package\" did you choose. I have a bad feeling this may end up costing us quite a bit since we&#039;re having so many people commited to traveling with us.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Moderncosmo1[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n My guests are paying just about the same price as what your quoted just about 100$ cheaper and that includes also round trip transfers to the hotel from airport.\n I&#039;m getting married in october cocktail hr at tequila terrace love the wooden decking and being so close to the water and dinner\/reception at the same location[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1589369,"PostDate":1330702058,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> @ Tammy - thanks for the info, that's helping me better understand!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> @ Modern - is that what that deck area is called then - \"Tequila terrace\"? I really like it and with how open it is I think especially if its a beautiful night that would make one rememorable evening for our guest as well as us!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> That;s comforting Im at least in the ballpark round figure..I was seriously wondering if my TA was just blowing smoke about \"negotiating\" or if anyone could get the prices he could get.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you dont mind me asking, what as the total amounted to for your entire wedding i.e. trip\/stay\/ceremony\/reception.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How many guest do you have attending and what type of \"package\" did you choose. I have a bad feeling this may end up costing us quite a bit since we're having so many people commited to traveling with us.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Moderncosmo1<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> My guests are paying just about the same price as what your quoted just about 100$ cheaper and that includes also round trip transfers to the hotel from airport.<br \/> I'm getting married in october cocktail hr at tequila terrace love the wooden decking and being so close to the water and dinner\/reception at the same location<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thomask122184@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325865744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249443.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":118,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ThomasK","Id":249443,"Name":"ThomasK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3d9d2a3e2989e54aa5182442fec55a7f","RawContent":"We chose the Divine Package which includes the wedding cake, cocktail hour, reception dinner for up to 25 people.  We have 28 people going so it will be around I believe $105 each person over 25 that we have to pay which isn&#039;t too bad for us... However if you are having a lot more than 50 people go then the prices could add up really fast.   \n \n The nice part is that we will basically be paying nothing for our room as it will be one of the free rooms.  Our airfare ended up being $810 for the both of us.  \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]ThomasK[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n @ Tammy - thanks for the info, that&#039;s helping me better understand! \n \n \n \n @ Modern - is that what that deck area is called then - \"Tequila terrace\"? I really like it and with how open it is I think especially if its a beautiful night that would make one rememorable evening for our guest as well as us! \n \n That;s comforting Im at least in the ballpark round figure..I was seriously wondering if my TA was just blowing smoke about \"negotiating\" or if anyone could get the prices he could get. \n \n \n If you dont mind me asking, what as the total amounted to for your entire wedding i.e. trip\/stay\/ceremony\/reception. \n \n How many guest do you have attending and what type of \"package\" did you choose. I have a bad feeling this may end up costing us quite a bit since we&#039;re having so many people commited to traveling with us.\n \n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1589408,"PostDate":1330707804,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> We chose the Divine Package which includes the wedding cake, cocktail hour, reception dinner for up to 25 people. \u00a0We have 28 people going so it will be around I believe $105 each person over 25 that we have to pay which isn't too bad for us... However if you are having a lot more than 50 people go then the prices could add up really fast. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The nice part is that we will basically be paying nothing for our room as it will be one of the free rooms. \u00a0Our airfare ended up being $810 for the both of us. \u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>ThomasK<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> @ Tammy - thanks for the info, that's helping me better understand!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> @ Modern - is that what that deck area is called then - \"Tequila terrace\"? I really like it and with how open it is I think especially if its a beautiful night that would make one rememorable evening for our guest as well as us!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> That;s comforting Im at least in the ballpark round figure..I was seriously wondering if my TA was just blowing smoke about \"negotiating\" or if anyone could get the prices he could get.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If you dont mind me asking, what as the total amounted to for your entire wedding i.e. trip\/stay\/ceremony\/reception.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How many guest do you have attending and what type of \"package\" did you choose. I have a bad feeling this may end up costing us quite a bit since we're having so many people commited to traveling with us.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ca694c3c373adcc9843285bb1c17e99a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks for that info RF!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Hello again all.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I wanted to make this a new thread on the entire website but Im not sure how to do so (lol), but has anyone here decided to go with a boat\/yacht rental for a wedding reception?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; If so, who did you go through? Even if not, what places did you look in to??&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks again for all of your help\/info!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Best regards&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1590539,"PostDate":1330999756,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks for that info RF!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hello again all.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I wanted to make this a new thread on the entire website but Im not sure how to do so (lol), but has anyone here decided to go with a boat\/yacht rental for a wedding reception?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> If so, who did you go through? Even if not, what places did you look in to??<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks again for all of your help\/info!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Best regards<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"thomask122184@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1325865744,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-249443.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":118,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ThomasK","Id":249443,"Name":"ThomasK","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c05f0915a390bf95d96fead1894363f5","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Just wanted you all to know that I am leaving for the airport in 7 hours....it has FINALLY arrived.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll let you all know how it goes!!!&amp;nbsp; &lt;span alt=\":smile159:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"54\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1331518878589_170\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" width=\"60\" \/&gt;   Byeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1593385,"PostDate":1331522723,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Just wanted you all to know that I am leaving for the airport in 7 hours....it has FINALLY arrived.\u00a0 I'll let you all know how it goes!!!\u00a0 <span alt=\":smile159:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"54\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1331518878589_170\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" width=\"60\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 Byeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!!!<\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d11b0a9259186060880233ae44d91f6d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Congratulations Amy!!!! You will have a great time!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1593449,"PostDate":1331564720,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Congratulations Amy!!!! You will have a great time!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e4045252e0d97f3d167c02ef35bf926e","RawContent":"Good Luck hope all goes well\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AmyG[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Just wanted you all to know that I am leaving for the airport in 7 hours....it has FINALLY arrived.  I&#039;ll let you all know how it goes!!!  [img]http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif[\/img]   Byeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1593472,"PostDate":1331566296,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Good Luck hope all goes well<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AmyG<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Just wanted you all to know that I am leaving for the airport in 7 hours....it has FINALLY arrived.\u00a0 I'll let you all know how it goes!!!\u00a0 <span alt=\":smile159:\" rel=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"54\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1331518878589_170\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" width=\"60\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 Byeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!!!<\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8f737c0e13d77298ca06183b850b73ce","RawContent":"Congrats Amy! I can&#039;t believe our weddings are almost here! Time has flown by, especially in the past couple of months. I am sure everything will be awesome, and I can&#039;t wait to chat about our weddings once I am back as well. [quote name=\"AmyG\"]\n&lt;p&gt; Just wanted you all to know that I am leaving for the airport in 7 hours....it has FINALLY arrived.&amp;nbsp; I&#039;ll let you all know how it goes!!!&amp;nbsp; &lt;span alt=\"&#58;smile159&#58;\" rel=\"http&#58;\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\"&gt;&lt;img height=\"54\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1331518878589_170\" src=\"http&#58;\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" width=\"60\" \/&gt;   Byeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!!!&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1593553,"PostDate":1331577070,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Congrats Amy! I can't believe our weddings are almost here! Time has flown by, especially in the past couple of months. I am sure everything will be awesome, and I can't wait to chat about our weddings once I am back as well. <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"AmyG\" url=\"\/t\/74418\/now&#045;sapphire&#045;weddings&#045;formerly&#045;paradisus&#045;riviera\/280#post_1742953\"><p><p> Just wanted you all to know that I am leaving for the airport in 7 hours....it has FINALLY arrived.\u00a0 I'll let you all know how it goes!!!\u00a0 <span alt=\"&#58;smile159&#58;\" rel=\"http&#58;\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\"><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' height=\"54\" id=\"yui_3_4_1_2_1331518878589_170\" src=\"http&#58;\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile159.gif\" width=\"60\" \/><\/span>\u00a0\u00a0 Byeeeeeeeeeeeeeee!!!<\/span><\/p><\/p><\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"432b4774dc1e08d77645e84483b5c532","RawContent":"[quote name=\"ThomasK\"]\n&lt;p&gt;@ Tammy - thanks for the info, that&#039;s helping me better understand!&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;@ Modern - is that what that deck area is called then - \"Tequila terrace\"? I really like it and with how open it is I think especially if its a beautiful night that would make one rememorable evening for our guest as well as us!&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;That;s comforting Im at least in the ballpark round figure..I was seriously wondering if my TA was just blowing smoke about \"negotiating\" or if anyone could get the prices he could get.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;If you dont mind me asking, what as the total amounted to for your entire wedding i.e. trip\/stay\/ceremony\/reception.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;How many guest do you have attending and what type of \"package\" did you choose. I have a bad feeling this may end up costing us quite a bit since we&#039;re having so many people commited to traveling with us.\n\n &lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;[\/quote] Yes I love the tequila terrace location seems the most private to me and more intimate . A little concerned with the wooden decking with heels but it didnt make or break my decision choosing this location I have about 32 total including us going I limited who I sent invites to because it does get costly for each additional person after 25 I haven&#039;t really sat down and go over the exact amounts but around $100 dollars a person over 25 guests so about 700-800$ for more people My room is free for the week cuz of the incentives on how many rooms booked ect.. Airfare from az is max 1200$ plus baggage fees. We got that free cuz we are using our credit card miles :) Everyone that is coming is from ny roughly 500-575 round trip airfare free bags with jet blue The package I chosen was the divine 3000$ Plus 800 for added guests Plus I upgraded video. And photography which is another 2000 Flowers upgraded centerpieces 1000 Plus another 500 extra flowers for aisle ect Gazebo 350-600 Dj doremixx for 5 hrs 800 plus 300 resort fee tips fo wait staff and coordinator I wanna high ball it and say $ 12000 and our airfare and stay for week is free That number doesn&#039;t include all the nit nacks I&#039;m bringing with me like place cards petal cones welcome bags ect...","Attachments":[],"Id":1594258,"PostDate":1331674731,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"ThomasK\" url=\"\/t\/74418\/now&#045;sapphire&#045;weddings&#045;formerly&#045;paradisus&#045;riviera\/270#post_1738937\"><p><p>@ Tammy - thanks for the info, that's helping me better understand!<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>@ Modern - is that what that deck area is called then - \"Tequila terrace\"? I really like it and with how open it is I think especially if its a beautiful night that would make one rememorable evening for our guest as well as us!<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>That;s comforting Im at least in the ballpark round figure..I was seriously wondering if my TA was just blowing smoke about \"negotiating\" or if anyone could get the prices he could get.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>If you dont mind me asking, what as the total amounted to for your entire wedding i.e. trip\/stay\/ceremony\/reception.<\/p><p>\u00a0<\/p><p>How many guest do you have attending and what type of \"package\" did you choose. I have a bad feeling this may end up costing us quite a bit since we're having so many people commited to traveling with us.<br \/>\n<br \/>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p><\/p><\/blockquote> Yes I love the tequila terrace location seems the most private to me and more intimate . A little concerned with the wooden decking with heels but it didnt make or break my decision choosing this location I have about 32 total including us going I limited who I sent invites to because it does get costly for each additional person after 25 I haven't really sat down and go over the exact amounts but around $100 dollars a person over 25 guests so about 700-800$ for more people My room is free for the week cuz of the incentives on how many rooms booked ect.. Airfare from az is max 1200$ plus baggage fees. We got that free cuz we are using our credit card miles <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/> Everyone that is coming is from ny roughly 500-575 round trip airfare free bags with jet blue The package I chosen was the divine 3000$ Plus 800 for added guests Plus I upgraded video. And photography which is another 2000 Flowers upgraded centerpieces 1000 Plus another 500 extra flowers for aisle ect Gazebo 350-600 Dj doremixx for 5 hrs 800 plus 300 resort fee tips fo wait staff and coordinator I wanna high ball it and say $ 12000 and our airfare and stay for week is free That number doesn't include all the nit nacks I'm bringing with me like place cards petal cones welcome bags ect...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moderncosmo1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304978447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239791.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moderncosmo1","Id":239791,"Name":"Moderncosmo1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7c3bb8c07aa9ec300d8baa95fc867279","RawContent":"Hey Moderncosmo1~ \n I&#039;m from AZ too (well, I live here now ~ not FROM here ~ anyway) my fiance and I are planning on booking our wedding at Now Sapphire too! We are planning for 4\/13. \n Who did you use for a travel agent that you were able to get your room for free?? We are still trying to decided whether we should use a TA or just book through Travelocity. \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Moderncosmo1[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Yes I love the tequila terrace location seems the most private to me and more intimate . A little concerned with the wooden decking with heels but it didnt make or break my decision choosing this location\n I have about 32 total including us going I limited who I sent invites to because it does get costly for each additional person after 25 I haven&#039;t really sat down and go over the exact amounts but around $100 dollars a person over 25 guests so about 700-800$ for more people\n My room is free for the week cuz of the incentives on how many rooms booked ect..\n Airfare from az is max 1200$ plus baggage fees. We got that free cuz we are using our credit card miles :)\n Everyone that is coming is from ny roughly 500-575 round trip airfare free bags with jet blue\n The package I chosen was the divine 3000$\n Plus 800 for added guests\n Plus I upgraded video. And photography which is another 2000\n Flowers upgraded centerpieces 1000\n Plus another 500 extra flowers for aisle ect\n Gazebo 350-600\n Dj doremixx for 5 hrs 800 plus 300 resort fee\n tips fo wait staff and coordinator\n I wanna high ball it and say $ 12000 and our airfare and stay for week is free\n That number doesn&#039;t include all the nit nacks I&#039;m bringing with me like place cards petal cones welcome bags ect...[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1595069,"PostDate":1331766050,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hey Moderncosmo1~<\/p> <p> I'm from AZ too (well, I live here now ~ not FROM here ~ anyway) my fiance and I are planning on booking our wedding at Now Sapphire too! We are planning for 4\/13.<\/p> <p> Who did you use for a travel agent that you were able to get your room for free?? We are still trying to decided whether we should use a TA or just book through Travelocity.\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Moderncosmo1<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Yes I love the tequila terrace location seems the most private to me and more intimate . A little concerned with the wooden decking with heels but it didnt make or break my decision choosing this location<br \/> I have about 32 total including us going I limited who I sent invites to because it does get costly for each additional person after 25 I haven't really sat down and go over the exact amounts but around $100 dollars a person over 25 guests so about 700-800$ for more people<br \/> My room is free for the week cuz of the incentives on how many rooms booked ect..<br \/> Airfare from az is max 1200$ plus baggage fees. We got that free cuz we are using our credit card miles <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> Everyone that is coming is from ny roughly 500-575 round trip airfare free bags with jet blue<br \/> The package I chosen was the divine 3000$<br \/> Plus 800 for added guests<br \/> Plus I upgraded video. And photography which is another 2000<br \/> Flowers upgraded centerpieces 1000<br \/> Plus another 500 extra flowers for aisle ect<br \/> Gazebo 350-600<br \/> Dj doremixx for 5 hrs 800 plus 300 resort fee<br \/> tips fo wait staff and coordinator<br \/> I wanna high ball it and say $ 12000 and our airfare and stay for week is free<br \/> That number doesn't include all the nit nacks I'm bringing with me like place cards petal cones welcome bags ect...<\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>~Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>4.27.13<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>54 Booked + The Bride & Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grassif@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319096283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246906.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":173,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LTLFAITHY","Id":246906,"Name":"LTLFAITHY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8ae9b04f83eaec1e19d635094366f87a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I&#039;m on day 3 and this place is AMAZING!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!   My guests must have all thanked me at least once a day for choosing such a remarkable place to celebrate.....stay tuned....&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595600,"PostDate":1331861241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I'm on day 3 and this place is AMAZING!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!\u00a0\u00a0 My guests must have all thanked me at least once a day for choosing such a remarkable place to celebrate.....stay tuned....<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":280,"NextPage":290,"PreviousPage":270,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
