{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63a0a2b73e8f1c352dc7a89714817416","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Brides (and Grooms)~&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; So, my fiance and I have been looking and looking (and looking and looking) and we have FINALLY decided on a location for our destination wedding! We are both super excited about getting married at Now Sapphire ~ 4\/27\/13. I&#039;ll admit that I read all 29 pages of this thread today, and I am so excited to have such a fantastic resource! I feel so much better knowing that there are other Now Sapphire brides I&#039;ll be able to communicate with over the next year of planning!! &amp;nbsp;   &lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1595608,"PostDate":1331862291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Brides (and Grooms)~<\/p> <p> So, my fiance and I have been looking and looking (and looking and looking) and we have FINALLY decided on a location for our destination wedding! We are both super excited about getting married at Now Sapphire ~ 4\/27\/13. I'll admit that I read all 29 pages of this thread today, and I am so excited to have such a fantastic resource! I feel so much better knowing that there are other Now Sapphire brides I'll be able to communicate with over the next year of planning!! \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>~Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>4.27.13<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>54 Booked + The Bride & Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grassif@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319096283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246906.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":173,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LTLFAITHY","Id":246906,"Name":"LTLFAITHY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"233701abac71babbfb637527c56dc18c","RawContent":"[quote name=\"LTLFAITHY\"]\n&lt;p&gt;Hey Moderncosmo1~&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m from AZ too (well, I live here now ~ not FROM here ~ anyway) my fiance and I are planning on booking our wedding at Now Sapphire too! We are planning for 4\/13.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Who did you use for a travel agent that you were able to get your room for free?? We are still trying to decided whether we should use a TA or just book through Travelocity. \n &lt;\/p&gt;\n\n&lt;p&gt; &lt;\/p&gt;[\/quote] Where are you from? I&#039;m from NYC been in az 3 1\/2 yrs so far My travel agent is vacations for less her name is Teresa Basically you can get rooms free by how many you book for every 6 rooms booked you get a room free for every 10 or something you get an upgrade","Attachments":[],"Id":1595716,"PostDate":1331876034,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"LTLFAITHY\" url=\"\/t\/74418\/now&#045;sapphire&#045;weddings&#045;formerly&#045;paradisus&#045;riviera\/280#post_1744637\"><p><p>Hey Moderncosmo1~<\/p><p>I'm from AZ too (well, I live here now ~ not FROM here ~ anyway) my fiance and I are planning on booking our wedding at Now Sapphire too! We are planning for 4\/13.<\/p><p>Who did you use for a travel agent that you were able to get your room for free?? We are still trying to decided whether we should use a TA or just book through Travelocity.\u00a0<br \/>\n\u00a0<\/p>\n<br \/>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p><\/p><\/blockquote> Where are you from? I'm from NYC been in az 3 1\/2 yrs so far My travel agent is vacations for less her name is Teresa Basically you can get rooms free by how many you book for every 6 rooms booked you get a room free for every 10 or something you get an upgrade\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"moderncosmo1@aol.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1304978447,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-239791.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moderncosmo1","Id":239791,"Name":"Moderncosmo1","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDa