te a full review and my planning thread.  Please feel free to ask me any questions about the resort!!  I Loved it!! \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777255\/width\/467\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777257\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777259\/width\/467\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777261\/width\/467\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777264\/width\/467\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777266\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777268\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777283\/width\/467\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777285\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777287\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777289\/width\/600\/height\/401[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777291\/width\/600\/height\/401[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777293\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777295\/width\/467\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777297\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777299\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777303\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777305\/width\/467\/height\/700[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777307\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777309\/width\/600\/height\/399[\/img][img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777311\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img] \n \n \n \n \n \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1600092,"PostDate":1332932177,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Amy - everything looks absolutely amazing! I can't wait to hear more!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks for sharing!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AmyG<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hey all,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I've been back for\u00a0a few days now\u00a0but I have not had any time to write a review or post pics....here are a few pics for now but I plan to write a full review and my planning thread.\u00a0 Please feel free to ask me any questions about the resort!!\u00a0 I Loved it!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777255\/width\/467\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"2.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777257\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"3.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777259\/width\/467\/height\/700\" \/><\/span><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"4.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/777261\/width\/467\/height\/7