> Time: 1430178487 / Mon, 27 Apr 2015 23:48:07 +0000
> URL: /index.php?/REST/Forums/topic/getPosts?topicId=62152&start=340&SessionId=94adac9f9af17367ad152e1a28e94cc2
> User erobin223 (278147)
Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8d9e4e6f7ed8be3458c6ab793e99b6e2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; \n That&#039;s Awesome you sent in your form....it gets so exciting!!   :-)))&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I&#039;d love to hear other comments on Preferred Club but here are my comments from my experience:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 1)&amp;nbsp; It was nice to have WiFi in my room so I could use my laptop at any time.&amp;nbsp; You do not have the Wifi access in the other rooms at all....if you want to use internet you have to pay for it and use the computer room located next to the lobby.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 2)&amp;nbsp; With the Preferred you get to reserve the bali beds at the main pool.&amp;nbsp; This worked out great because we reserved one almost everyday and we had a place to lay all day for me and some of my guests.&amp;nbsp; A waiter kept the drinks coming all day.&amp;nbsp; You are also able to reserve lounge chairs on the beach which is nice so you know you have a great spot.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 3)&amp;nbsp; The balconies had awesome views and a big jacuzzi... :-)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 4)&amp;nbsp; One of the restaurants serves breakfast exclusively for Preferred Club...you can eat breakfast&amp;nbsp;on a deck next to the ocean...very pretty!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 5)&amp;nbsp; The room itself is gorgeous with an upgraded bathroom.&amp;nbsp; All of the other rooms are great too, but the Preferred one is nicer.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; 6)&amp;nbsp; We went in the Preferred lounge a few times and grabbed a snack and a drink, it was nice but i&#039;d rather be out by the pool bar or the beach bar.  : ) ....I was able to use the printer in there though to print my boarding pass the day before we left so that was helpful.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I never even really went to the adults preferred pool because I was always doing something else or hanging out with my guests....none of my guests got Preferred so me and my husband were the only ones.&amp;nbsp; I bet if more of my guests got Preferred then we would hung out at the adults pool more.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The resort does not serve Captain Morgan&amp;nbsp;at all....I know this because that is our favorite drink as well and we asked for it on day one.....they do however have an alternative to Captain which is called Flor de Cana.&amp;nbsp; It is excellent...we liked it so much we actually bought a bottle.&amp;nbsp; :-)&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; The chair sashes are not included in any of the wedding packages...you can either purchase them per chair or bring them yourself.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Taking a trip down there would be awesome!!&amp;nbsp; I hope you can do that!!   :-)   You are going to Love it there.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Happy Planning!!!!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; -Amy&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;Shelgal&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; I just want to say thank you to all of you. I just turned in my papers and deposit for my wedding. We will be getting married on Feb 15, 2013. Now just waiting on getting our TA to call and say our pricing is done. She said it wont be until end of May. FI wants to know how is perferred club? A lot of our guests drink Captain do we have to get perferred club because of this. Also are chair sahes included with ungraded packages. Thank you in advance. Hopefully might take a trip down there when FI isn&#039;t in the fields.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; \n \n &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1603712,"PostDate":1333568419,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> That's Awesome you sent in your form....it gets so exciting!!\u00a0\u00a0 :-)))<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'd love to hear other comments on Preferred Club but here are my comments from my experience:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 1)\u00a0 It was nice to have WiFi in my room so I could use my laptop at any time.\u00a0 You do not have the Wifi access in the other rooms at all....if you want to use internet you have to pay for it and use the computer room located next to the lobby.<\/p> <p> 2)\u00a0 With the Preferred you get to reserve the bali beds at the main pool.\u00a0 This worked out great because we reserved one almost everyday and we had a place to lay all day for me and some of my guests.\u00a0 A waiter kept the drinks coming all day.\u00a0 You are also able to reserve lounge chairs on the beach which is nice so you know you have a great spot.<\/p> <p> 3)\u00a0 The balconies had awesome views and a big jacuzzi... :-)<\/p> <p> 4)\u00a0 One of the restaurants serves breakfast exclusively for Preferred Club...you can eat breakfast\u00a0on a deck next to the ocean...very pretty!<\/p> <p> 5)\u00a0 The room itself is gorgeous with an upgraded bathroom.\u00a0 All of the other rooms are great too, but the Preferred one is nicer.<\/p> <p> 6)\u00a0 We went in the Preferred lounge a few times and grabbed a snack and a drink, it was nice but i'd rather be out by the pool bar or the beach bar.\u00a0\u00a0: ) ....I was able to use the printer in there though to print my boarding pass the day before we left so that was helpful.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I never even really went to the adults preferred pool because I was always doing something else or hanging out with my guests....none of my guests got Preferred so me and my husband were the only ones.\u00a0 I bet if more of my guests got Preferred then we would hung out at the adults pool more.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The resort does not serve Captain Morgan\u00a0at all....I know this because that is our favorite drink as well and we asked for it on day one.....they do however have an alternative to Captain which is called Flor de Cana.\u00a0 It is excellent...we liked it so much we actually bought a bottle.\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The chair sashes are not included in any of the wedding packages...you can either purchase them per chair or bring them yourself.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Taking a trip down there would be awesome!!\u00a0 I hope you can do that!!\u00a0\u00a0 :-)\u00a0\u00a0 You are going to Love it there.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!!!!!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -Amy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-container\"> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>Shelgal<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I just want to say thank you to all of you. I just turned in my papers and deposit for my wedding. We will be getting married on Feb 15, 2013. Now just waiting on getting our TA to call and say our pricing is done. She said it wont be until end of May. FI wants to know how is perferred club? A lot of our guests drink Captain do we have to get perferred club because of this. Also are chair sahes included with ungraded packages. Thank you in advance. Hopefully might take a trip down there when FI isn't in the fields.<\/p> <\/div> <\/div> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a3f52d6ae34cfd668488cc7a0ddf7f2b","RawContent":"Thank you!!!!!!! \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AmyG[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n LTLFAITHY, \n \n No problem! \n \n Below is a link to my slideshow from the resort photographer that has a lot of pics.....  :-) \n \n [url=\"http:\/\/amy-burdell.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/\"][color=#0000ff]http:\/\/amy-burdell.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/[\/color][\/url] \n \n \n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1603715,"PostDate":1333568620,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thank you!!!!!!!\u00a0<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AmyG<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> LTLFAITHY,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> No problem!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Below is a link to my slideshow from the resort photographer that has a lot of pics.....\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/amy-burdell.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1333562745_0\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">http:\/\/amy-burdell.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/<\/font><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>~Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>4.27.13<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>54 Booked + The Bride & Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grassif@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319096283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246906.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":173,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LTLFAITHY","Id":246906,"Name":"LTLFAITHY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"501715ca1d44bbc68404893354bddcd8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; thanks for the picture link and the helpful info! Can&#039;t wait to check out the pictures!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1603851,"PostDate":1333582563,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> thanks for the picture link and the helpful info! Can't wait to check out the pictures!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tpsmithslp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"168.216.83.100","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1331500985,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252586.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TauruSmith","Id":252586,"Name":"TauruSmith","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7911265fa4316514a1a281bb701115ad","RawContent":"I liked having preferred, but it is definitely not necessary. Although things were slightly different for us as we have a two year old, and he kind of cramped our style sometimes, haha. \n \n But here are my comments: \n \n 1 - I also liked having wifi in the room. But we spent time on our balcony each day while our son napped, so it was a nice bonus to use that time to check emails, etc \n 2 - Because we spent so much time on our balcony, it was REALLY nice to have a nice big balcony looking over the beach and ocean. At least it still felt like we were on vacation and we could enjoy the breeze, sounds of the ocean, music from the pool. \n 3 - We reserved chairs on the beach every day. We didn&#039;t use them all the time, but it was nice to know they were there. Especially as sometimes we couldn&#039;t use them until the afternoon, and by then all chairs at the pool and beach are taken. \n 4 - We actually only had the preferred breakfast twice because we forgot about it until the end of our trip, but it was nice having breakfast out on the deck. \n 5 - The day after the wedding, family had our son, so we went to the preferred pool to \"hide\" for a bit, and spend time alone without running into him. The pool is smaller, but nice and quiet, and we enjoyed it. \n \n Hope that helps!\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AmyG[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n That&#039;s Awesome you sent in your form....it gets so exciting!!   :-))) \n \n I&#039;d love to hear other comments on Preferred Club but here are my comments from my experience: \n \n 1)  It was nice to have WiFi in my room so I could use my laptop at any time.  You do not have the Wifi access in the other rooms at all....if you want to use internet you have to pay for it and use the computer room located next to the lobby. \n 2)  With the Preferred you get to reserve the bali beds at the main pool.  This worked out great because we reserved one almost everyday and we had a place to lay all day for me and some of my guests.  A waiter kept the drinks coming all day.  You are also able to reserve lounge chairs on the beach which is nice so you know you have a great spot. \n 3)  The balconies had awesome views and a big jacuzzi... :-) \n 4)  One of the restaurants serves breakfast exclusively for Preferred Club...you can eat breakfast on a deck next to the ocean...very pretty! \n 5)  The room itself is gorgeous with an upgraded bathroom.  All of the other rooms are great too, but the Preferred one is nicer. \n 6)  We went in the Preferred lounge a few times and grabbed a snack and a drink, it was nice but i&#039;d rather be out by the pool bar or the beach bar.  : ) ....I was able to use the printer in there though to print my boarding pass the day before we left so that was helpful. \n \n I never even really went to the adults preferred pool because I was always doing something else or hanging out with my guests....none of my guests got Preferred so me and my husband were the only ones.  I bet if more of my guests got Preferred then we would hung out at the adults pool more. \n \n The resort does not serve Captain Morgan at all....I know this because that is our favorite drink as well and we asked for it on day one.....they do however have an alternative to Captain which is called Flor de Cana.  It is excellent...we liked it so much we actually bought a bottle.  :-) \n \n The chair sashes are not included in any of the wedding packages...you can either purchase them per chair or bring them yourself. \n \n Taking a trip down there would be awesome!!  I hope you can do that!!   :-)   You are going to Love it there. \n \n Happy Planning!!!!!!!! \n \n -Amy \n \n \n \n Quote: \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1603888,"PostDate":1333589199,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I liked having preferred, but it is definitely not necessary. Although things were slightly different for us as we have a two year old, and he kind of cramped our style sometimes, haha.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> But here are my comments:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 1 - I also liked having wifi in the room. But we spent time on our balcony each day while our son napped, so it was a nice bonus to use that time to check emails, etc<\/p> <p> 2 - Because we spent so much time on our balcony, it was REALLY nice to have a nice big balcony looking over the beach and ocean. At least it still felt like we were on vacation and we could enjoy the breeze, sounds of the ocean, music from the pool.<\/p> <p> 3 - We reserved chairs on the beach every day. We didn't use them all the time, but it was nice to know they were there. Especially as sometimes we couldn't use them until the afternoon, and by then all chairs at the pool and beach are taken.<\/p> <p> 4 - We actually only had the preferred breakfast twice because we forgot about it until the end of our trip, but it was nice having breakfast out on the deck.<\/p> <p> 5 - The day after the wedding, family had our son, so we went to the preferred pool to \"hide\" for a bit, and spend time alone without running into him. The pool is smaller, but nice and quiet, and we enjoyed it.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hope that helps!<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AmyG<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> That's Awesome you sent in your form....it gets so exciting!!\u00a0\u00a0 :-)))<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I'd love to hear other comments on Preferred Club but here are my comments from my experience:<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> 1)\u00a0 It was nice to have WiFi in my room so I could use my laptop at any time.\u00a0 You do not have the Wifi access in the other rooms at all....if you want to use internet you have to pay for it and use the computer room located next to the lobby.<\/p> <p> 2)\u00a0 With the Preferred you get to reserve the bali beds at the main pool.\u00a0 This worked out great because we reserved one almost everyday and we had a place to lay all day for me and some of my guests.\u00a0 A waiter kept the drinks coming all day.\u00a0 You are also able to reserve lounge chairs on the beach which is nice so you know you have a great spot.<\/p> <p> 3)\u00a0 The balconies had awesome views and a big jacuzzi... :-)<\/p> <p> 4)\u00a0 One of the restaurants serves breakfast exclusively for Preferred Club...you can eat breakfast\u00a0on a deck next to the ocean...very pretty!<\/p> <p> 5)\u00a0 The room itself is gorgeous with an upgraded bathroom.\u00a0 All of the other rooms are great too, but the Preferred one is nicer.<\/p> <p> 6)\u00a0 We went in the Preferred lounge a few times and grabbed a snack and a drink, it was nice but i'd rather be out by the pool bar or the beach bar.\u00a0\u00a0: ) ....I was able to use the printer in there though to print my boarding pass the day before we left so that was helpful.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I never even really went to the adults preferred pool because I was always doing something else or hanging out with my guests....none of my guests got Preferred so me and my husband were the only ones.\u00a0 I bet if more of my guests got Preferred then we would hung out at the adults pool more.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The resort does not serve Captain Morgan\u00a0at all....I know this because that is our favorite drink as well and we asked for it on day one.....they do however have an alternative to Captain which is called Flor de Cana.\u00a0 It is excellent...we liked it so much we actually bought a bottle.\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The chair sashes are not included in any of the wedding packages...you can either purchase them per chair or bring them yourself.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Taking a trip down there would be awesome!!\u00a0 I hope you can do that!!\u00a0\u00a0 :-)\u00a0\u00a0 You are going to Love it there.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Happy Planning!!!!!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> -Amy<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02ddefc58c9aacc66aa0a22752f48ba5","RawContent":"Amy, thanks for sharing more of your photos! They look great. and you looked beautiful :) \n \n As for me, I am still (impatiently) waiting...\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]AmyG[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n LTLFAITHY, \n \n No problem! \n \n Below is a link to my slideshow from the resort photographer that has a lot of pics.....  :-) \n \n [url=\"http:\/\/amy-burdell.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/\"][color=#0000ff]http:\/\/amy-burdell.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/[\/color][\/url] \n \n \n   \n \n \n[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1603893,"PostDate":1333589603,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Amy, thanks for sharing more of your photos! They look great. and you looked beautiful <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> As for me, I am still (impatiently) waiting...<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>AmyG<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> <br \/> LTLFAITHY,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> No problem!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Below is a link to my slideshow from the resort photographer that has a lot of pics.....\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <a href='http:\/\/amy-burdell.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'><span class=\"yshortcuts\" id=\"lw_1333562745_0\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">http:\/\/amy-burdell.nowsapphire.adventurephotos.com.mx\/<\/font><\/span><\/a><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbf2dfbec46da0c56accc4db8d630d66","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just looked through your slideshow AmyG ~ Thank you SO much for posting that!! Your wedding looked beautiful, as did you :)&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Ahhhhhhhhhhh, I wish I didn&#039;t have to wait a year to be there!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1603991,"PostDate":1333606095,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just looked through your slideshow AmyG ~ Thank you SO much for posting that!! Your wedding looked beautiful, as did you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p> <p> Ahhhhhhhhhhh, I wish I didn't have to wait a year to be there!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>~Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>4.27.13<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>54 Booked + The Bride & Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grassif@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319096283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246906.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":173,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LTLFAITHY","Id":246906,"Name":"LTLFAITHY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5a6287c7ef49715b9edb403348c389b2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks Amy and Joda. This really helps. I don&#039;t think we are going with perferred. If we get upgraded that is ok but I don&#039;t think we really need it.&amp;nbsp;The wifi would be nice.&amp;nbsp;If that captain look alike is in with the reg drinks we will be fine. The only other one we would have to worry about is Beam. I just want to have a good time. Hopefully we can get away for a mini vaca without the kids before the wedding.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1604528,"PostDate":1333726526,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Amy and Joda. This really helps. I don't think we are going with perferred. If we get upgraded that is ok but I don't think we really need it.\u00a0The wifi would be nice.\u00a0If that captain look alike is in with the reg drinks we will be fine. The only other one we would have to worry about is Beam. I just want to have a good time. Hopefully we can get away for a mini vaca without the kids before the wedding.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shellee2374@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1333252640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253436.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shelgal","Id":253436,"Name":"Shelgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"63761f8dfa7b586dca75401fb1e77e5a","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Question: Does the white gauze over the wedding arch (for a beach wedding) come with all the packages??&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1604767,"PostDate":1333767944,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Question: Does the white gauze over the wedding arch (for a beach wedding) come with all the packages??\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>~Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>4.27.13<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>54 Booked + The Bride & Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grassif@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319096283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246906.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":173,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LTLFAITHY","Id":246906,"Name":"LTLFAITHY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5675c370ca6ee21f5698f1e68868066b","RawContent":"I had Divine and the white fabric I had came with my package....not sure if you could see it well with my photos. I am not sure if it comes with all of the packages.  The white covered chairs came with it too.\n \n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LTLFAITHY[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Question: Does the white gauze over the wedding arch (for a beach wedding) come with all the packages??[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1604770,"PostDate":1333769270,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I had Divine and the white fabric I had came with my package....not sure if you could see it well with my photos. I am not sure if it comes with all of the packages.\u00a0 The white covered chairs came with it too.<br \/> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LTLFAITHY<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Question: Does the white gauze over the wedding arch (for a beach wedding) come with all the packages??\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2f44dc1f923f851c2c6ca0e8ed694206","RawContent":"Thank You!!!!! :-)) \n \n Don&#039; worry your year will fly by!  :-)\n   [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LTLFAITHY[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I just looked through your slideshow AmyG ~ Thank you SO much for posting that!! Your wedding looked beautiful, as did you :)  \n Ahhhhhhhhhhh, I wish I didn&#039;t have to wait a year to be there!![\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1604771,"PostDate":1333769330,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> <br \/> Thank You!!!!!\u00a0:-))<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Don' worry your year will fly by!\u00a0 :-)<br \/> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LTLFAITHY<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I just looked through your slideshow AmyG ~ Thank you SO much for posting that!! Your wedding looked beautiful, as did you <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/>\u00a0<\/p> <p> Ahhhhhhhhhhh, I wish I didn't have to wait a year to be there!!\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":340,"NextPage":350,"PreviousPage":330,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
