:0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"be61ec0d195aa0a82d782542aa6411eb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; It&#039;s been a long process of 4 months. Mostly because our first destination turned out to be too expensive, in Negril.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1609864,"PostDate":1334972985,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> It's been a long process of 4 months. Mostly because our first destination turned out to be too expensive, in Negril.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sunny_mylene@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1329185511,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-251379.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"sunnymylene","Id":251379,"Name":"sunnymylene","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d87f08389adde55ae952e64144298c46","RawContent":"[quote name=\"mic813\"]\n&lt;p&gt; Hi all,&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; I am two weeks into my engagement but have been on this website for a few months now.&amp;nbsp; It is fabulous.&amp;nbsp; So much condensed information.&amp;nbsp; Thank you all.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; I am leaning towards the Now Resorts but how did you all decide between the Now Jade and Now Sapphire?&amp;nbsp; I am trying to figure out what the main differences are.&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;&lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt;[\/quote] The reason I chose Now Sapphire was because it has more of a traditional Mexican feel, and the Now Jade is very modern. For my wedding, I preferred that. I am sure you can&#039;t go wrong with either, but I was very happy with our wedding at Now Sapphire and I can&#039;t imagine having had it anywhere else!","Attachments":[],"Id":1609902,"PostDate":1334979411,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"mic813\" url=\"\/t\/74418\/now&#045;sapphire&#045;weddings&#045;formerly&#045;paradisus&#045;riviera\/360#post_1758427\"><p><p> Hi all,<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> I am two weeks into my engagement but have been on this website for a few months now.\u00a0 It is fabulous.\u00a0 So much condensed information.\u00a0 Thank you all.<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> I am leaning towards the Now Resorts but how did you all decide between the Now Jade and Now Sapphire?\u00a0 I am trying to figure out what the main differences are.<\/p><p> \u00a0<\/p><p> Thanks!<\/p><\/p><\/blockquote> The reason I chose Now Sapphire was because it has more of a traditional Mexican feel, and the Now Jade is very modern. For my wedding, I preferred that. I am sure you can't go wrong with either, but I was very happy with our wedding at Now Sapphire and I can't imagine having had it anywhere else!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a4028cde1772502149c9f6fbab0d5a57","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; i am currently ready to book at the Now Sapphire. How was your wedding? &amp;nbsp;Are there any photos you could share?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Where did you have your reception and ceremony?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Is there anything you would suggest for a future bride to add on? Dj, Decor? etc&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1610114,"PostDate":1335061281,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> i am currently ready to book at the Now Sapphire. How was your wedding? \u00a0Are there any photos you could share?<\/p> <p> Where did you have your reception and ceremony?<\/p> <p> Is there anything you would suggest for a future bride to add on? Dj, Decor? etc<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a_fleetwood6@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333251668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253433.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Noxx","Id":253433,"Name":"Noxx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf4161f4d900fdb5960418a8e58feb27","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Amy-&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; those cute colored palm tree things you had for the table.&amp;nbsp; Where did you find those?&amp;nbsp; ADORABLE!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; \n &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1610391,"PostDate":1335143603,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Amy-<\/p> <p> those cute colored palm tree things you had for the table.\u00a0 Where did you find those?\u00a0 ADORABLE!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <br \/> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hwessley@new.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317002945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245861.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HeatherViolet","Id":245861,"Name":"HeatherViolet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"70b83825749d6e0f786f5cf3ddc0422d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Sandy,&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was thinking of having my ceremony at the Gazebo. Is this a popular choice?i cant seem to find any pictures of it. My fiance wants the reception to be as private as we can have it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do you happen to have any pictures you can post? Also is the reception private? I am wanting to have a dj but like many others im not sure if its worth paying that much for a few hours. Can you extend your party to a later time?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1610459,"PostDate":1335154928,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Sandy,<\/p> <p> I was thinking of having my ceremony at the Gazebo. Is this a popular choice?i cant seem to find any pictures of it. My fiance wants the reception to be as private as we can have it.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Do you happen to have any pictures you can post? Also is the reception private? I am wanting to have a dj but like many others im not sure if its worth paying that much for a few hours. Can you extend your party to a later time?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a_fleetwood6@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333251668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253433.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Noxx","Id":253433,"Name":"Noxx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ba5f04deec7b5b1e19d15481f96f3d98","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Any Canadian Brides Booked at the Now Sapphire? I am trying to figure out who to book with a travel agent, wedding specialist or right through the hotel for the best deal&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1610467,"PostDate":1335156569,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Any Canadian Brides Booked at the Now Sapphire? I am trying to figure out who to book with a travel agent, wedding specialist or right through the hotel for the best deal<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a_fleetwood6@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333251668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253433.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Noxx","Id":253433,"Name":"Noxx","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bf8d5bd9822a04bcfaf1ddafe6cb0e53","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Noxx[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Any Canadian Brides Booked at the Now Sapphire? I am trying to figure out who to book with a travel agent, wedding specialist or right through the hotel for the best deal[\/quote] \n \n I worked with Wendy Hicks from Wright Travel who I believe is a sponsor of this forum and everything has worked out great so far.  We will arrive at Now Sapphire in 9 days.","Attachments":[],"Id":1610536,"PostDate":1335194464,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Noxx<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Any Canadian Brides Booked at the Now Sapphire? I am trying to figure out who to book with a travel agent, wedding specialist or right through the hotel for the best deal<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I worked with Wendy Hicks from Wright Travel who I believe is a sponsor of this forum and everything has worked out great so far. \u00a0We will arrive at Now Sapphire in 9 days.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bd489a603d4fa2375bec4a05e5ec4cb7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi Everyone.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Just wanted to let you know that we had our wedding this past Saturday. &amp;nbsp;Everything was absolutely beautiful. &amp;nbsp;I willl post more information and pictures later, but just wanted to stop in and let you know that you do not have anything to worry about. &amp;nbsp;Anel is absolutely wonderful!!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1610876,"PostDate":1335231325,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi Everyone.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just wanted to let you know that we had our wedding this past Saturday. \u00a0Everything was absolutely beautiful. \u00a0I willl post more information and pictures later, but just wanted to stop in and let you know that you do not have anything to worry about. \u00a0Anel is absolutely wonderful!!!!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"28357fe9ca4c3689e195d38f97ecb6d8","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Vanessa56[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hi Everyone.  \n \n Just wanted to let you know that we had our wedding this past Saturday.  Everything was absolutely beautiful.  I willl post more information and pictures later, but just wanted to stop in and let you know that you do not have anything to worry about.  Anel is absolutely wonderful!!!![\/quote] \n \n Glad to hear that everything went great.  We leave in 8 days and the wedding is in 11 days.","Attachments":[],"Id":1611019,"PostDate":1335277426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Vanessa56<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hi Everyone.\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Just wanted to let you know that we had our wedding this past Saturday. \u00a0Everything was absolutely beautiful. \u00a0I willl post more information and pictures later, but just wanted to stop in and let you know that you do not have anything to worry about. \u00a0Anel is absolutely wonderful!!!!<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Glad to hear that everything went great. \u00a0We leave in 8 days and the wedding is in 11 days. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":370,"NextPage":380,"PreviousPage":360,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
