Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e2cb58f4b2d253c5d14f75926a4369f4","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n I know it took me a little while to hear from Anel and I was surprised that when I did hear from her that she never received my planning form so I got that sent again.  She did confirm that she received it and also sent me back confirmation of the private transfers... \n \n Our taxi is picking us up at 4:45 AM tomorrow and we should be at Now Sapphire around 1ish.[\/quote] \n RFinger, \n \n How did it go? Me and another girl on here are getting married there next weekend!  We have been looking at the forecasts for next weekend, and so far for wednesday thursday and friday there is a 60% chance of rain :-\/ \n My questions is, how was the weather for you? I&#039;m alittle worried. Being that I am from houston, I am used to thunderstorms and 60% chance of rain does not plant a pretty picture for my imaginations sake...","Attachments":[],"Id":1617924,"PostDate":1336591680,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> I know it took me a little while to hear from Anel and I was surprised that when I did hear from her that she never received my planning form so I got that sent again. \u00a0She did confirm that she received it and also sent me back confirmation of the private transfers...<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Our taxi is picking us up at 4:45 AM tomorrow and we should be at Now Sapphire around 1ish. \u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> RFinger,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How did it go? Me and another girl on here are getting married there next weekend!\u00a0 We have been looking at the forecasts for next weekend, and so far for wednesday thursday and friday there is a 60% chance of rain :-\/<\/p> <p> My questions is, how was the weather for you? I'm alittle worried. Being that I am from houston, I am used to thunderstorms and 60% chance of rain does not plant a pretty picture for my imaginations sake...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"johnsoncnicole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1302373856,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238683.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cnicole51911","Id":238683,"Name":"Cnicole51911","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8caa3bec081e1eef9196f01da9e464c2","RawContent":"Hi craftygal, \n \n I chose the Beach Terrace for my cocktail hour and reception.  Yes, the pool is in the other direction, but it is ot directly next to the pool. \n The best way I could think to describe the setting was the pic below, lol....basically my reception was within the yellow circle.  \n Absolutely gorgeous at night because the pool is light up and there were no other guests around.  :-) \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823990\/width\/600\/height\/464[\/img] \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]craftygal[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Amy G,  \n \n What location did you choose for your reception? I&#039;ve been thinking about the beach terrace but there only seems to be the view looking out over the water, what is on the other side? The pool? \n \n Thanks[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1617986,"PostDate":1336597965,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi craftygal,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I chose the Beach Terrace for my cocktail hour and reception.\u00a0 Yes, the pool is in the other direction, but it is ot directly next to the pool.<\/p> <p> The best way I could think to describe the setting was the pic below, lol....basically my reception was within the yellow circle.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Absolutely gorgeous at night because the pool is light up and there were no other guests around.\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"Publication1.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/823990\/width\/600\/height\/464\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>craftygal<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Amy G,\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> What location did you choose for your reception? I've been thinking about the beach terrace but there only seems to be the view looking out over the water, what is on the other side? The pool?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f9693c2e38460979acad5ac7e396ae17","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; That&#039;s a perfect picture. Thank you. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m sure I&#039;ve read that you got married on the beach. Was it off the tequila terrace? I believe there is someone in the time slot before the one we&#039;re looking at. I was wondering if they were having their reception on the tequila terrace if that would effect us having the ceremony on the beach. Any thoughts on that?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; PS. You&#039;re an amazing resource. Thank you so much for answering all these questions.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1618029,"PostDate":1336603708,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> That's a perfect picture. Thank you. \u00a0I'm sure I've read that you got married on the beach. Was it off the tequila terrace? I believe there is someone in the time slot before the one we're looking at. I was wondering if they were having their reception on the tequila terrace if that would effect us having the ceremony on the beach. Any thoughts on that?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> PS. You're an amazing resource. Thank you so much for answering all these questions.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"sue_hughes@sympatico.ca","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1336096190,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-254916.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"craftygal","Id":254916,"Name":"craftygal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"073d157c6929544ebe099f92aa238328","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Cnicole51911[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n RFinger, \n \n How did it go? Me and another girl on here are getting married there next weekend!  We have been looking at the forecasts for next weekend, and so far for wednesday thursday and friday there is a 60% chance of rain :-\/ \n My questions is, how was the weather for you? I&#039;m alittle worried. Being that I am from houston, I am used to thunderstorms and 60% chance of rain does not plant a pretty picture for my imaginations sake...[\/quote] \n \n \n Before we left the same thing happened to us... The weather said it was 60% chance of rain the whole week I never said anything to Jami and just went along with it.  As the time got closer the 60% changed down to 20%.   \n \n The only time I saw rain drops while I was there was when we landed at the Cancun airport and were in the vehicle.  As soon as we arrived at the resort there was no more rain and no rain the entire time...","Attachments":[],"Id":1618432,"PostDate":1336669331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Cnicole51911<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> RFinger,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> How did it go? Me and another girl on here are getting married there next weekend!\u00a0 We have been looking at the forecasts for next weekend, and so far for wednesday thursday and friday there is a 60% chance of rain :-\/<\/p> <p> My questions is, how was the weather for you? I'm alittle worried. Being that I am from houston, I am used to thunderstorms and 60% chance of rain does not plant a pretty picture for my imaginations sake...<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Before we left the same thing happened to us... The weather said it was 60% chance of rain the whole week I never said anything to Jami and just went along with it. \u00a0As the time got closer the 60% changed down to 20%. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The only time I saw rain drops while I was there was when we landed at the Cancun airport and were in the vehicle. \u00a0As soon as we arrived at the resort there was no more rain and no rain the entire time...<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"02dae32bb3a3ad6246b58b77b2e74f17","RawContent":"&lt;div class=\"quote-container\"&gt; &lt;p&gt; We had our ceremony on the beach and reception and cocktail hour on tequila terrace. &amp;nbsp;Our ceremony was at 5. &amp;nbsp;There was another wedding at 4 a little bit further down the beach but the only time we saw them was as me and the guys were walking to our location and when we were getting our pictures taken. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We actually got lucky as all 3 restaurants by the tequila terrace were closed that night so it was very private. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;span&gt;Quote:&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;div class=\"quote-block\"&gt; Originally Posted by &lt;strong&gt;craftygal&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;img alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/&gt;\n \n &lt;p&gt; That&#039;s a perfect picture. Thank you. &amp;nbsp;I&#039;m sure I&#039;ve read that you got married on the beach. Was it off the tequila terrace? I believe there is someone in the time slot before the one we&#039;re looking at. I was wondering if they were having their reception on the tequila terrace if that would effect us having the ceremony on the beach. Any thoughts on that?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; PS. You&#039;re an amazing resource. Thank you so much for answering all these questions.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;\/div&gt; &lt;\/div&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1618434,"PostDate":1336669539,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <div class=\"quote-container\"> <p> We had our ceremony on the beach and reception and cocktail hour on tequila terrace. \u00a0Our ceremony was at 5. \u00a0There was another wedding at 4 a little bit further down the beach but the only time we saw them was as me and the guys were walking to our location and when we were getting our pictures taken. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We actually got lucky as all 3 restaurants by the tequila terrace were closed that night so it was very private. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span>Quote:<\/span><\/p> <div class=\"quote-block\"> Originally Posted by <strong>craftygal<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> That's a perfect picture. Thank you. \u00a0I'm sure I've read that you got married on the beach. Was it off the tequila terrace? I believe there is someone in the time slot before the one we're looking at. I was wondering if they were having their reception on the tequila terrace if that would effect us having the ceremony on the beach. Any thoughts on that?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> PS. You're an amazing resource. Thank you so much for answering all these questions.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <\/div> <\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2a6d07c5f35715727d424528726be432","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]joda[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n Oh, and I finally have pictures to share! Love, love, love del Sol and would recommend them to anybody :)\n [=http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=678][\/][\/quote] \n \n \n Hi Joda, Stunning photos! I am getting married at the Now Sapphire on July 2nd and also am having a long table. We are going to also use a burlap runner, but have not been able to get the table measurements. Did you order them yourself or did the hotel take care of that? Thank you!!","Attachments":[],"Id":1618498,"PostDate":1336675942,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>joda<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> Oh, and I finally have pictures to share! Love, love, love del Sol and would recommend them to anybody <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><br \/> [=http:\/\/delsolphotography.com\/blog\/content\/galleries\/?gal=678][\/]<\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Hi Joda, Stunning photos! I am getting married at the Now Sapphire on July 2nd and also am having a long table. We are going to also use a burlap runner, but have not been able to get the table measurements. Did you order them yourself or did the hotel take care of that? Thank you!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecaevantash@gmail.com","IpAddress":"157.166.159.230","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1331668391,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252682.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"becky0520","Id":252682,"Name":"becky0520","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"781cb32a55b3d7d98f3cb8e80cc1a13f","RawContent":"Thanks, I tried to get a pic so you could see the whole view.   :-) \n Yes, I got marreid on the beach, but it was right in front of that concrete area next to my reception location (the Beach Terrace).  \n So basically there are two beach ceremony locations, one in front of the Beach Terrace and the other in front of the Tequila Terrace.  Depending upon which cocktail\/reception location you pick that will determine which beach you would have your ceremony at.  They will allow two weddings at approx. the same times but they are not at the same locations so you don&#039;t have to worry about that.  They could have multiple ceremonies at the same location but only at different time slots. \n Have you checked to see what locations for the ceremony, cocktail and reception are available for your day? \n [quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]craftygal[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n That&#039;s a perfect picture. Thank you.  I&#039;m sure I&#039;ve read that you got married on the beach. Was it off the tequila terrace? I believe there is someone in the time slot before the one we&#039;re looking at. I was wondering if they were having their reception on the tequila terrace if that would effect us having the ceremony on the beach. Any thoughts on that? \n \n PS. You&#039;re an amazing resource. Thank you so much for answering all these questions.[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1618551,"PostDate":1336681113,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks, I tried to get a pic so you could see the whole view.\u00a0\u00a0 :-)<\/p> <p> Yes, I got marreid on the beach, but it was right in front of that concrete area next to my reception location (the Beach Terrace).\u00a0<\/p> <p> So basically there are two beach ceremony locations, one in front of the Beach Terrace and the other in front of the Tequila Terrace.\u00a0 Depending upon which cocktail\/reception location you pick that will determine which beach you would have your ceremony at.\u00a0 They will allow two weddings at approx. the same times but they are not at the same locations so you don't have to worry about that.\u00a0 They could have multiple ceremonies at the same location but only at different time slots.<\/p> <p> Have you checked to see what locations for the ceremony, cocktail and reception are available for your day?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>craftygal<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> That's a perfect picture. Thank you. \u00a0I'm sure I've read that you got married on the beach. Was it off the tequila terrace? I believe there is someone in the time slot before the one we're looking at. I was wondering if they were having their reception on the tequila terrace if that would effect us having the ceremony on the beach. Any thoughts on that?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> PS. You're an amazing resource. Thank you so much for answering all these questions.<\/p> <\/blockquote>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ladybug1280@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1284746058,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232417.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"AmyG","Id":232417,"Name":"AmyG","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"775b76c9a95af5d150966bc29d7d14c0","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]RFinger[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n \n \n Before we left the same thing happened to us... The weather said it was 60% chance of rain the whole week I never said anything to Jami and just went along with it.  As the time got closer the 60% changed down to 20%.   \n \n The only time I saw rain drops while I was there was when we landed at the Cancun airport and were in the vehicle.  As soon as we arrived at the resort there was no more rain and no rain the entire time...[\/quote] \n \n RFinger, \n \n Can you please post some photos? I would love to see your special day :)","Attachments":[],"Id":1618890,"PostDate":1336754389,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>RFinger<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Before we left the same thing happened to us... The weather said it was 60% chance of rain the whole week I never said anything to Jami and just went along with it. \u00a0As the time got closer the 60% changed down to 20%. \u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> The only time I saw rain drops while I was there was when we landed at the Cancun airport and were in the vehicle. \u00a0As soon as we arrived at the resort there was no more rain and no rain the entire time...<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> RFinger,<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Can you please post some photos? I would love to see your special day <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"johnsoncnicole@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1302373856,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-238683.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Cnicole51911","Id":238683,"Name":"Cnicole51911","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"df45da80d114e979cfe91c48c94f1ce7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Here you go:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash4\/305622_3894912773362_1295361217_3643064_1001325422_n.jpg\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &lt;img src=\"http:\/\/a3.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-ash3\/529780_3894924293650_1295361217_3643078_232481646_n.jpg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash3\/560369_3894930933816_1295361217_3643087_921978589_n.jpg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash3\/538886_3894915893440_1295361217_3643068_775804982_n.jpg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-prn1\/522310_3894921493580_1295361217_3643072_904124649_n.jpg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash3\/576312_3894934013893_1295361217_3643091_1086234125_n.jpg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/a4.sphotos.ak.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ak-snc7\/577949_3894935693935_1295361217_3643096_797665327_n.jpg\" \/&gt;&lt;img src=\"http:\/\/sphotos.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-ash3\/559558_3894922373602_1295361217_3643074_1266189655_n.jpg\"