{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5cb60ac5d6248f411b8b1902dee2e2c2","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Oh, Such beautiful pictures! It was a pleasure to work with you and your group of family and friends on the travel arrangements!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My biggest congratulations to you!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; TA Wendy&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1618961,"PostDate":1336763138,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Oh, Such beautiful pictures! It was a pleasure to work with you and your group of family and friends on the travel arrangements!<\/p> <p> My biggest congratulations to you!<\/p> <p> TA Wendy<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>? We are an award winning travel agency and you can read our reviews <\/span><a class='bbc_url' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>HERE.<\/strong><\/span><\/a><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><strong class='bbc'>Awards and recognition: <\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Palace Resorts Top PRO Agency <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='font-size: 14px;'><span style='color: rgb(164,164,164)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'>Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator <\/span><\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span><br \/>\n<span style='color: rgb(0,128,128)'><span style='font-family: arial'><span style='font-size: 14px;'>Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner<\/span><\/span><\/span>","Email":"wendyhicks1@sbcglobal.net","IpAddress":"99.187.229.252","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1238037840,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-216154.jpg?_r=1419958783","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":250,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TA Wendy","Id":216154,"Name":"TA Wendy","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ecfcd7809d0d3e83224ac8b567b5055d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Rfinger Beautiful pictures! Who did them? Where did you get that cake topper? Too cute.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1619342,"PostDate":1336875741,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Rfinger Beautiful pictures! Who did them? Where did you get that cake topper? Too cute.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"shellee2374@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":47,"GroupName":"Site Supporter","JoinDate":1333252640,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253436.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Shelgal","Id":253436,"Name":"Shelgal","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1580d9f911a56f1de3406019daceeb21","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Shelgal[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Rfinger Beautiful pictures! Who did them? Where did you get that cake topper? Too cute.[\/quote] \n The pictures were done by whoever the resort uses in our wedding package.  We actually found the cake topper on a website off of Amazon.com","Attachments":[],"Id":1619418,"PostDate":1336923370,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Shelgal<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Rfinger Beautiful pictures! Who did them? Where did you get that cake topper? Too cute.<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> The pictures were done by whoever the resort uses in our wedding package.\u00a0 We actually found the cake topper on a website off of Amazon.com<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3b8023a45128c87c4102b5add77fcfd8","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Wow.... everyone&#039;s pictures are AMAZING!&amp;nbsp; You all look so happy and so good!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; My finace, Ryan and I leave a week from today for our May 25th wedding at the Sapphire.&amp;nbsp; I am sooooooo excited!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; We are doing the Beach Terrace for everything... and by the looks of all of your pictures, I think we made the right choice!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; One quick question for any of you....&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Do you need to bring an electric plug adapter?&amp;nbsp; I have stayed at other resorts in Riviera Maya, and we had to have an adapter to curl your hair, plug in your MP3 Player, etc.&amp;nbsp; Do you need that for this resort?&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; This forum is wonderful... thanks for all of your help with planning.&amp;nbsp; I would normally be nervous about having my wedding at a place I had never been before, but because of all of your help.... I haven&#039;t \"freaked out\" yet!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Heather Violet&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1619622,"PostDate":1337000275,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Wow.... everyone's pictures are AMAZING!\u00a0 You all look so happy and so good!!!<\/p> <p> My finace, Ryan and I leave a week from today for our May 25th wedding at the Sapphire.\u00a0 I am sooooooo excited!<\/p> <p> We are doing the Beach Terrace for everything... and by the looks of all of your pictures, I think we made the right choice!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> One quick question for any of you....<\/p> <p> Do you need to bring an electric plug adapter?\u00a0 I have stayed at other resorts in Riviera Maya, and we had to have an adapter to curl your hair, plug in your MP3 Player, etc.\u00a0 Do you need that for this resort?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This forum is wonderful... thanks for all of your help with planning.\u00a0 I would normally be nervous about having my wedding at a place I had never been before, but because of all of your help.... I haven't \"freaked out\" yet!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> Heather Violet<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hwessley@new.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317002945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245861.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HeatherViolet","Id":245861,"Name":"HeatherViolet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f919610fc0776745382db643bee93ac4","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]HeatherViolet[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Wow.... everyone&#039;s pictures are AMAZING!  You all look so happy and so good!!! \n My finace, Ryan and I leave a week from today for our May 25th wedding at the Sapphire.  I am sooooooo excited! \n We are doing the Beach Terrace for everything... and by the looks of all of your pictures, I think we made the right choice! \n \n One quick question for any of you.... \n Do you need to bring an electric plug adapter?  I have stayed at other resorts in Riviera Maya, and we had to have an adapter to curl your hair, plug in your MP3 Player, etc.  Do you need that for this resort? \n \n This forum is wonderful... thanks for all of your help with planning.  I would normally be nervous about having my wedding at a place I had never been before, but because of all of your help.... I haven&#039;t \"freaked out\" yet! \n \n Thanks! \n Heather Violet[\/quote] \n \n No adapter is needed.  I was able to easily charge my ipad and iphone.","Attachments":[],"Id":1619795,"PostDate":1337022825,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>HeatherViolet<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Wow.... everyone's pictures are AMAZING!\u00a0 You all look so happy and so good!!!<\/p> <p> My finace, Ryan and I leave a week from today for our May 25th wedding at the Sapphire.\u00a0 I am sooooooo excited!<\/p> <p> We are doing the Beach Terrace for everything... and by the looks of all of your pictures, I think we made the right choice!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> One quick question for any of you....<\/p> <p> Do you need to bring an electric plug adapter?\u00a0 I have stayed at other resorts in Riviera Maya, and we had to have an adapter to curl your hair, plug in your MP3 Player, etc.\u00a0 Do you need that for this resort?<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> This forum is wonderful... thanks for all of your help with planning.\u00a0 I would normally be nervous about having my wedding at a place I had never been before, but because of all of your help.... I haven't \"freaked out\" yet!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks!<\/p> <p> Heather Violet<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> No adapter is needed. \u00a0I was able to easily charge my ipad and iphone. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"cda35f97b751eb94f4a4efa046354246","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; What has everyone done for hair and makeup. Are the stylists\/ makeup artists at the resort good or should I start looking for other options?&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1619907,"PostDate":1337034745,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> What has everyone done for hair and makeup. Are the stylists\/ makeup artists at the resort good or should I start looking for other options?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"tpsmithslp@gmail.com","IpAddress":"168.216.83.100","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1331500985,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-252586.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TauruSmith","Id":252586,"Name":"TauruSmith","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f27e1847fb773b07d4177c33f118cdcf","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]TauruSmith[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n What has everyone done for hair and makeup. Are the stylists\/ makeup artists at the resort good or should I start looking for other options?[\/quote] \n I did both my hair and makeup at the resort spa (I used what was included in the Divine package).  They were absolutely wonderful!!! I have not received my pictures yet, which is why I have not posted them yet.  Here&#039;s a picture I do have where you can see my hair and makeup. \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/832104\/width\/600\/height\/400[\/img]","Attachments":[],"Id":1620125,"PostDate":1337090538,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>TauruSmith<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> What has everyone done for hair and makeup. Are the stylists\/ makeup artists at the resort good or should I start looking for other options?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> I did both my hair and makeup at the resort spa (I used what was included in the Divine package).\u00a0 They were absolutely wonderful!!! I have not received my pictures yet, which is why I have not posted them yet.\u00a0 Here's a picture I do have where you can see my hair and makeup.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"IMG_7212.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/832104\/width\/600\/height\/400\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"floresvy05@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1260154781,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-223750.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Vanessa56","Id":223750,"Name":"Vanessa56","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a198c2a9691e6042c5905b43e5042ec1","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hello Everyone! So my fiance and I decided on our 4.27.13 for our wedding a little while ago, but we hadn&#039;t actually \"reserved\" the date. I e-mailed Anel (4\/27) with a question about moving forward with the booking process and I never heard back, so I e-mailed Ramon (5\/7) and I haven&#039;t heard back from him either!!!!!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Is this the norm?? Not hearing back for weeks? And does anybody have any suggestions on how to get in touch with the wedding coordinators?&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1620219,"PostDate":1337100102,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hello Everyone! So my fiance and I decided on our 4.27.13 for our wedding a little while ago, but we hadn't actually \"reserved\" the date. I e-mailed Anel (4\/27) with a question about moving forward with the booking process and I never heard back, so I e-mailed Ramon (5\/7) and I haven't heard back from him either!!!!!!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Is this the norm?? Not hearing back for weeks? And does anybody have any suggestions on how to get in touch with the wedding coordinators?\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>~Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>4.27.13<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>54 Booked + The Bride & Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grassif@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319096283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246906.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":173,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LTLFAITHY","Id":246906,"Name":"LTLFAITHY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c73617db6bd2887edd0a5e91d6ea9f99","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]Noxx[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Congrats LTLFAITHY!!! \n I am getting married on 4\/8\/13 we chose the devine package and are having the reception and cocktail hour at the tequilla terrece. I believe our ceremony will be there also.  \n What have you chose? Are you having a Dj or paying for a dance floor, centerpieces or photographer?[\/quote] \n Yay for April 2013 Sapphire Brides!! I am soooo excited (even though I just got off the phone with my mom, who flat out said she wasn&#039;t excited about the fact that we are getting married in Mexico, and that we should be having a \"proper\" wedding back home in MA - grrrrrrrrrrrr).  \n \n Anyway, we are also having the reception at the tequila terrace with the ceremony on the beach right in front of the tequila terrace. We decided that we are going to do the cocktail reception the night before the wedding, as kind of a Welcome Party, and we&#039;ll use the photographer included in the package that night as well. We aren&#039;t going to have a DJ or a dance floor -- just an iPod and then we&#039;ll go to the bar\/dance club? at the hotel after. But we are going to use an outside photographer, right now we are pretty sure we are going to go with Adrian from Victor Herrera Photography. As far as centerpieces go I don&#039;t really have a clue!! I think it is all going to depend on how many people end up coming, because if the group is small enough I think I want to do one long table. \n \n Are you going to be using a travel agent?? I am still on the fence, but leaning towards yes..........................................","Attachments":[],"Id":1620552,"PostDate":1337138426,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>Noxx<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Congrats LTLFAITHY!!!<\/p> <p> I am getting married on 4\/8\/13 we chose the devine package and are having the reception and cocktail hour at the tequilla terrece. I believe our ceremony will be there also.\u00a0<\/p> <p> What have you chose? Are you having a Dj or paying for a dance floor, centerpieces or photographer?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Yay for April 2013 Sapphire Brides!! I am soooo excited (even though I just got off the phone with my mom, who flat out said she wasn't excited about the fact that we are getting married in Mexico, and that we should be having a \"proper\" wedding back home in MA - grrrrrrrrrrrr).\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyway, we are also having the reception at the tequila terrace with the ceremony on the beach right in front of the tequila terrace. We decided that we are going to do the cocktail reception the night before the wedding, as kind of a Welcome Party, and we'll use the photographer included in the package that night as well. We aren't going to have a DJ or a dance floor -- just an iPod and then we'll go to the bar\/dance club? at the hotel after. But we are going to use an outside photographer, right now we are pretty sure we are going to go with Adrian from Victor Herrera Photography. As far as centerpieces go I don't really have a clue!! I think it is all going to depend on how many people end up coming, because if the group is small enough I think I want to do one long table.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Are you going to be using a travel agent?? I am still on the fence, but leaning towards yes..........................................<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>~Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>4.27.13<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>54 Booked + The Bride & Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grassif@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319096283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246906.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":173,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LTLFAITHY","Id":246906,"Name":"LTLFAITHY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b3c686f221d924120c686c37bd41fbae","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]LTLFAITHY[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Hello Everyone! So my fiance and I decided on our 4.27.13 for our wedding a little while ago, but we hadn&#039;t actually \"reserved\" the date. I e-mailed Anel (4\/27) with a question about moving forward with the booking process and I never heard back, so I e-mailed Ramon (5\/7) and I haven&#039;t heard back from him either!!!!!!!  \n \n Is this the norm?? Not hearing back for weeks? And does anybody have any suggestions on how to get in touch with the wedding coordinators?[\/quote] \n Yes it is definitely normal.  We were there two weeks ago and they are so busy right now. They typically concentrate on the weddings that are coming up.  If I was you I would just comment on their Facebook Wall that you are waiting to hear if your wedding date is available and then you usually get a response.","Attachments":[],"Id":1620684,"PostDate":1337179085,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>LTLFAITHY<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Hello Everyone! So my fiance and I decided on our 4.27.13 for our wedding a little while ago, but we hadn't actually \"reserved\" the date. I e-mailed Anel (4\/27) with a question about moving forward with the booking process and I never heard back, so I e-mailed Ramon (5\/7) and I haven't heard back from him either!!!!!!!\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Is this the norm?? Not hearing back for weeks? And does anybody have any suggestions on how to get in touch with the wedding coordinators?\u00a0<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Yes it is definitely normal. \u00a0We were there two weeks ago and they are so busy right now. They typically concentrate on the weddings that are coming up. \u00a0If I was you I would just comment on their Facebook Wall that you are waiting to hear if your wedding date is available and then you usually get a response. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":420,"NextPage":430,"PreviousPage":410,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
