Request Time: 0 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c79e77b4fdde7ebdffda2a318140a47e","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; RFinger: thank you! I was beginning to develop a complex ~ LOL&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; And your wedding pictures are stunning!! Whenever someone posts pictures from their wedding at Now Sapphire it makes me even more excited that I already am!!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1620727,"PostDate":1337184052,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> RFinger: thank you! I was beginning to develop a complex ~ LOL<\/p> <p> And your wedding pictures are stunning!! Whenever someone posts pictures from their wedding at Now Sapphire it makes me even more excited that I already am!!!\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>~Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>4.27.13<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>54 Booked + The Bride & Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grassif@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319096283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246906.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":173,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LTLFAITHY","Id":246906,"Name":"LTLFAITHY","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"c64c3fa46968f893e5c3491ef74eb724","RawContent":"[quote name=\"becky0520\"]\nHi Joda, Stunning photos! I am getting married at the Now Sapphire on July 2nd and also am having a long table. We are going to also use a burlap runner, but have not been able to get the table measurements. Did you order them yourself or did the hotel take care of that? Thank you!! [\/quote] Sorry for the late reply, just got back from our Honeymoon. Thanks about the pictures, I love them. I first asked the hotel if I could rent one and they quoted me $300 - yikes! I ended up ordering one from save on crafts, it was 30 feet for $11. After I ordered it, I read some bad reviews on the company, but I had no issues.","Attachments":[],"Id":1620733,"PostDate":1337185144,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"becky0520\" url=\"\/t\/74418\/now&#045;sapphire&#045;weddings&#045;formerly&#045;paradisus&#045;riviera\/410#post_1768066\"><p>Hi Joda, Stunning photos! I am getting married at the Now Sapphire on July 2nd and also am having a long table. We are going to also use a burlap runner, but have not been able to get the table measurements. Did you order them yourself or did the hotel take care of that? Thank you!!\u00a0<\/p><\/blockquote> Sorry for the late reply, just got back from our Honeymoon. Thanks about the pictures, I love them. I first asked the hotel if I could rent one and they quoted me $300 - yikes! I ended up ordering one from save on crafts, it was 30 feet for $11. After I ordered it, I read some bad reviews on the company, but I had no issues.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8b2d12bf361e7ed261f7a649abc1680d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Hi All Now Sapphire Brides! I was finially able to confirm my date of February 14, 2013!! YAY&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Anyway I trying to get details on group rates so i can send out my save the dates, but am having a hard time hearing back... the amount the travel agent quoted was more then i was expecting and i was thinking that my guests could just book through the hotel directly! Has anyone done this?? Any information on the requirements for a group booking would be amazing, and if you could share the group rate you received!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; Thanks Ladies!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1620822,"PostDate":1337195987,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Hi All Now Sapphire Brides! I was finially able to confirm my date of February 14, 2013!! YAY<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Anyway I trying to get details on group rates so i can send out my save the dates, but am having a hard time hearing back... the amount the travel agent quoted was more then i was expecting and i was thinking that my guests could just book through the hotel directly! Has anyone done this?? Any information on the requirements for a group booking would be amazing, and if you could share the group rate you received!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Thanks Ladies!<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"JenniferLeitch17@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333120533,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253378.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferL","Id":253378,"Name":"JenniferL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4b861e0128e0c19060ee69bce276972d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; Thanks Amy!!!!!&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p&gt; I was able to get a quote through a travel agent, but it was much higher then i expected... i hate to ask but what approximately did your guests pay per person (if you don&#039;t mind me asking)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1620828,"PostDate":1337196507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> Thanks Amy!!!!!<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I was able to get a quote through a travel agent, but it was much higher then i expected... i hate to ask but what approximately did your guests pay per person (if you don't mind me asking)<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"JenniferLeitch17@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333120533,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253378.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferL","Id":253378,"Name":"JenniferL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7fba607a02bcc8740ed5b4fd0bf7b32b","RawContent":"&lt;p style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"&gt; This is what our guests paid for tropical view:&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Single:&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;$516 for 3 nights; $160 each additional night&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Double:&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;$403 pp for 3 nights; $123 pp each additional night&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Triple:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;$393 pp for 3 nights; $119 pp each additional night&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Children 3 - 12:&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/strong&gt;$185 for &amp;nbsp;3 nights; $50 each additional night&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"&gt; &lt;strong&gt;Children 2 and under:&lt;\/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;$38 for the whole time.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"&gt; Resort is an all-inclusive resort so all drinks, food, and tips are included. &amp;nbsp;These prices also include airport transfers to and from the resort. &amp;nbsp;Please check out the Flights tab for information on booking your flights.&lt;\/p&gt; &lt;p style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119); font-family: &#039;Trebuchet MS&#039;, Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"&gt; &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1621126,"PostDate":1337263232,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> This is what our guests paid for tropical view:<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> \u00a0<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Single:<\/strong>\u00a0$516 for 3 nights; $160 each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Double:<\/strong>\u00a0$403 pp for 3 nights; $123 pp each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Triple:\u00a0<\/strong>$393 pp for 3 nights; $119 pp each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Children 3 - 12:\u00a0<\/strong>$185 for \u00a03 nights; $50 each additional night<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> <strong>Children 2 and under:<\/strong>\u00a0$38 for the whole time.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> Resort is an all-inclusive resort so all drinks, food, and tips are included. \u00a0These prices also include airport transfers to and from the resort. \u00a0Please check out the Flights tab for information on booking your flights.<\/p> <p  style=\"color: rgb(119, 119, 119);font-family:'Trebuchet MS', Helvetica, sans-serif; line-height: normal; \"> \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6deb432dd57b86b4828358f6d1feab72","RawContent":"[quote name=\"JenniferL\"]\nThanks Amy!!!!! I was able to get a quote through a travel agent, but it was much higher then i expected... i hate to ask but what approximately did your guests pay per person (if you don&#039;t mind me asking)[\/quote] Jennifer, I assume because you are from Canada you are looking at the 7 night packages including flights? For us, the price was $1659 from Montreal, and $1760 from Saskatoon, including all taxes. This was also for the Tropical view room. What were you quoted?","Attachments":[],"Id":1621131,"PostDate":1337263838,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class='ipsBlockquote' data-author=\"JenniferL\" url=\"\/t\/74418\/now&#045;sapphire&#045;weddings&#045;formerly&#045;paradisus&#045;riviera\/430#post_1770396\"><p>Thanks Amy!!!!! I was able to get a quote through a travel agent, but it was much higher then i expected... i hate to ask but what approximately did your guests pay per person (if you don't mind me asking)<\/p><\/blockquote> Jennifer, I assume because you are from Canada you are looking at the 7 night packages including flights? For us, the price was $1659 from Montreal, and $1760 from Saskatoon, including all taxes. This was also for the Tropical view room. What were you quoted?\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"664a18aa633491054314c02274c1c658","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]joda[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Jennifer, I assume because you are from Canada you are looking at the 7 night packages including flights? For us, the price was $1659 from Montreal, and $1760 from Saskatoon, including all taxes. This was also for the Tropical view room.\n What were you quoted?[\/quote] \n Thanks Joda,  \n \n We were quoted just over $2100 for 7 nights including flight... did you use a travel agency?","Attachments":[],"Id":1621182,"PostDate":1337270090,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>joda<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <br \/> Jennifer, I assume because you are from Canada you are looking at the 7 night packages including flights? For us, the price was $1659 from Montreal, and $1760 from Saskatoon, including all taxes. This was also for the Tropical view room.<br \/> What were you quoted?<\/blockquote> <p> Thanks Joda,\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We were quoted just over $2100 for 7 nights including flight... did you use a travel agency?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"JenniferLeitch17@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333120533,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253378.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":150,"PhotoHeight":150,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"JenniferL","Id":253378,"Name":"JenniferL","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"d4748fa82e62432710251273fe4ffa3f","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I found what worked best for us was that we used the travel agent to get us a good group rate on the rooms and then had people book their own flights using orbitz or kayak. &amp;nbsp;Orbitz has Price Assurance so if the price went down they are supposed to send you a check for the difference.&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1621298,"PostDate":1337282025,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I found what worked best for us was that we used the travel agent to get us a good group rate on the rooms and then had people book their own flights using orbitz or kayak. \u00a0Orbitz has Price Assurance so if the price went down they are supposed to send you a check for the difference.\u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"ryan@panthersgrad.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1307990680,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-241083.jpg?_r=1388290366","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":255,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"RFinger","Id":241083,"Name":"RFinger","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e74fbed4b3f8a624ec907af9d3d0bbfb","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]JenniferL[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Thanks Joda,  \n \n We were quoted just over $2100 for 7 nights including flight... did you use a travel agency?[\/quote] \n \n I used Blue Petal Destination Weddings (although my travel agent is now working for another company, but still specializing in weddings). If you want I can PM you her contact info. She checked basically all Canadian companies to get the best rate for us, and there was a big range in the prices. \n \n Have you also compared with sites like redtag.ca to see what they are quoting?","Attachments":[],"Id":1621304,"PostDate":1337282485,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>JenniferL<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Thanks Joda,\u00a0<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> We were quoted just over $2100 for 7 nights including flight... did you use a travel agency?<\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> I used Blue Petal Destination Weddings (although my travel agent is now working for another company, but still specializing in weddings). If you want I can PM you her contact info. She checked basically all Canadian companies to get the best rate for us, and there was a big range in the prices.<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> Have you also compared with sites like redtag.ca to see what they are quoting?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"writetojodi@gmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1299617006,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-237569.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":146,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"joda","Id":237569,"Name":"joda","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e3d7bed2e45a4f432866ef53baa545bd","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt; I just received the confirmation email from Anel! Our wedding is officially booked for 4\/27\/13 at Now Sapphire!! Yay!!&amp;nbsp;&lt;img id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1337407247246_1401\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile123.gif\" \/&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1621839,"PostDate":1337410974,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p> I just received the confirmation email from Anel! Our wedding is officially booked for 4\/27\/13 at Now Sapphire!! Yay!!\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' id=\"yui_3_4_1_1_1337407247246_1401\" src=\"http:\/\/files.bestdestinationwedding.com\/images\/smilies\/smile123.gif\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>~Now Sapphire Riviera Cancun~<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>4.27.13<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><p style=\"text-align:center;\"><span>54 Booked + The Bride & Groom!<\/span><\/p><span><\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"grassif@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1319096283,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-246906.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":173,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LTLFAITHY","Id":246906,"Name":"LTLFAITHY","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":430,"NextPage":440,"PreviousPage":420,"LastPage":2540},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
