eight\/72\" \/><\/span><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"hwessley@new.rr.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1317002945,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-245861.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":160,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"HeatherViolet","Id":245861,"Name":"HeatherViolet","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"0.0.0.0","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":62152,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6dc51624057ea97101f6b8364494344e","RawContent":"[quote]\nOriginally Posted by [b]HeatherViolet[\/b] \/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\n \n \n Here are a few pics of the table set up and decos from the Beach Terrace.... \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/861183\/width\/96\/height\/63[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/861185\/width\/96\/height\/63[\/img] \n \n [img]http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/861187\/width\/96\/height\/72[\/img][\/quote] \n Thanks HeatherViolet for the great review.  \n Did you bring your own decor for the tables? was there a set up fee? i am thinking of bringing down my own table sashes and table decor.  \n Also deciding on which photographer to use. What was the price conpairison to the resorts?","Attachments":[],"Id":1629863,"PostDate":1339383782,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <blockquote class=\"ipsBlockquote\">Originally Posted by <strong>HeatherViolet<\/strong>\u00a0<span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"View Post\" class=\"inlineimg\" src=\"\/img\/forum\/go_quote.gif\" \/><\/span><br \/> <br \/> <p> Here are a few pics of the table set up and decos from the Beach Terrace....<\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"232323232%7Ffp635 2)vq=335 )745)689)WSNRCG=37(5989 ;4337vq0mrj.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/861183\/width\/96\/height\/63\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"232323232%7Ffp63592)vq=335 )745)689)WSNRCG=37(5989 79337vq0mrj.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/861185\/width\/96\/height\/63\" \/><\/span><\/p> <p> \u00a0<\/p> <p> <span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' alt=\"232323232%7Ffp635;9)vq=325 )6 9)252)WSNRCG=379798(78 32(vq0mrj.jpg\" src=\"http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/image\/id\/861187\/width\/96\/height\/72\" \/><\/span><\/p> <\/blockquote> <p> Thanks HeatherViolet for the great review.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Did you bring your own decor for the tables? was there a set up fee? i am thinking of bringing down my own table sashes and table decor.\u00a0<\/p> <p> Also deciding on which photographer to use. What was the price conpairison to the resorts?<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"a_fleetwood6@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1333251668,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-253433.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Noxx","Id":253433,"Name":"Noxx","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":2541,"TotalPages":255,"CurrentPage":460,"NextPage":470,"PreviousPage":450,"LastPage":2540},"